,"following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alysonvilela/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alysonvilela/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alysonvilela","id":22202745,"login":"alysonvilela","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjAyNzQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alysonvilela/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alysonvilela/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alysonvilela/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alysonvilela/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alysonvilela/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alysonvilela","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alysonvilela/spike-microfrontends-expo/commits/933639180342e760cccccd0ae7eb0c2cf89fd5f2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-26T22:51:01Z","email":"ctt.alysonvilela@gmail.com","name":"Alyson Vilela"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-26T22:51:01Z","email":"ctt.alysonvilela@gmail.com","name":"Alyson Vilela"},"message":"docs(skills): add add-app skill for wiring a new micro-frontend\n\nAdding an app touches five files across three packages, and none of the\nlinks are discoverable from the code alone: the manifest registry, the\nredirect allowlist, the Caddy route, the bundled manifest, and the tests.\n\nThe skill leads with the rule the last bug broke — an app''s entry URL is\nderived from the requesting host, never written by hand — and co-locates\neach trap with the step it belongs to: ports must be unique because\nlocal-direct clients tell apps apart only by port; the allowlist takes\npublic origins, not LAN IPs; the bundled manifest carries production\nentries because it ships inside the binary.\n\nAlso records that presentation/bridge/fallback reach the client but are\nnot consumed yet, and that the shell needs no code change to pick up a\nnew app.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"561e2da8c619e9108c98ee22441d5db2af36f2fb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alysonvilela/spike-microfrontends-expo/git/trees/561e2da8c619e9108c98ee22441d5db2af36f2fb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alysonvilela/spike-microfrontends-expo/git/commits/933639180342e760cccccd0ae7eb0c2cf89fd5f2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22202745?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alysonvilela/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alysonvilela/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alysonvilela/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alysonvilela/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alysonvilela","id":22202745,"login":"alysonvilela","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjAyNzQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alysonvilela/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alysonvilela/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alysonvilela/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alysonvilela/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alysonvilela/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alysonvilela","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/alysonvilela/spike-microfrontends-expo/commit/933639180342e760cccccd0ae7eb0c2cf89fd5f2","node_id":"C_kwDOTkjBzdoAKDkzMzYzOTE4MDM0MmU3NjBjY2NjY2QwYWU3ZWIwYzJjZjg5ZmQ1ZjI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/alysonvilela/spike-microfrontends-expo/commit/25e86cc16c63c014d4d901909f907f059939cfc7","sha":"25e86cc16c63c014d4d901909f907f059939cfc7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alysonvilela/spike-microfrontends-expo/commits/25e86cc16c63c014d4d901909f907f059939cfc7"}],"sha":"933639180342e760cccccd0ae7eb0c2cf89fd5f2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alysonvilela/spike-microfrontends-expo/commits/933639180342e760cccccd0ae7eb0c2cf89fd5f2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22202745?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alysonvilela/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alysonvilela/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alysonvilela/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alysonvilela/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alysonvilela","id":22202745,"login":"alysonvilela","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjAyNzQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alysonvilela/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alysonvilela/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alysonvilela/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alysonvilela/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alysonvilela/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alysonvilela","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alysonvilela/spike-microfrontends-expo/commits/25e86cc16c63c014d4d901909f907f059939cfc7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-26T22:39:42Z","email":"ctt.alysonvilela@gmail.com","name":"Alyson Vilela"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-26T22:39:42Z","email":"ctt.alysonvilela@gmail.com","name":"Alyson Vilela"},"message":"fix(manifest): resolve entry URLs against the requesting host\n\nThe remote manifest hardcoded https://clube.alysonvilela.local:3000 for\nlocal env while manifest.bundled.json had been patched to the LAN IP.\nBecause resolveManifest stamps version: Date.now() and the bundled\nmanifest is version 0, the remote always won — so the working LAN URL was\nreplaced by an unreachable one within milliseconds of reaching Home, on\nevery launch. Opening clube then failed on DNS (a device cannot resolve\n*.alysonvilela.local), and would have failed again on Caddy''s untrusted\ninternal CA, and again on the session cookie, which webview-enter scopes\nhost-only to the backend''s host.\n\nEntry URLs are now derived server-side from the host the request arrived\nat, collapsing the two sources of truth into one:\n\n- production        -> https://clube.alysonvilela.com\n- local via Caddy   -> https://clube.alysonvilela.local (443, no port —\n                       Caddy proxies to localPort, the client never names it)\n- local direct      -> http://<request-host>:3000\n\nSame host for backend and frontend also keeps the session cookie working,\nsince cookies are scoped by host and ignore the port.\n\nThe redirect allowlist follows: the hardcoded LAN IP is gone, replaced by\na same-hostname rule restricted to loopback and RFC 1918 addresses. The\nrestriction matters — requestOrigin comes from the Host header, so an\nunrestricted same-host rule would make Host: evil.com an open redirect.\n\nmanifest.bundled.json now ships production entries, which is what is true\nfor a shipped binary on first offline launch. It is a cold-start\nplaceholder; the host-derived remote replaces it before it can be opened.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b9e8f3a4d1f1054cfe9483fa9d7c02117f437820","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alysonvilela/spike-microfrontends-expo/git/trees/b9e8f3a4d1f1054cfe9483fa9d7c02117f437820"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alysonvilela/spike-microfrontends-expo/git/commits/25e86cc16c63c014d4d901909f907f059939cfc7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22202745?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alysonvilela/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alysonvilela/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alysonvilela/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alysonvilela/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alysonvilela","id":22202745,"login":"alysonvilela","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjAyNzQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alysonvilela/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alysonvilela/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alysonvilela/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alysonvilela/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alysonvilela/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alysonvilela","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/alysonvilela/spike-microfrontends-expo/commit/25e86cc16c63c014d4d901909f907f059939cfc7","node_id":"C_kwDOTkjBzdoAKDI1ZTg2Y2MxNmM2M2MwMTRkNGQ5MDE5MDlmOTA3ZjA1OTkzOWNmYzc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/alysonvilela/spike-microfrontends-expo/commit/84389bf6e8fab1e19faa4b76fdd7f77272c7ba14","sha":"84389bf6e8fab1e19faa4b76fdd7f77272c7ba14","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alysonvilela/spike-microfrontends-expo/commits/84389bf6e8fab1e19faa4b76fdd7f77272c7ba14"}],"sha":"25e86cc16c63c014d4d901909f907f059939cfc7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alysonvilela/spike-microfrontends-expo/commits/25e86cc16c63c014d4d901909f907f059939cfc7"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22202745?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alysonvilela/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alysonvilela/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alysonvilela/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alysonvilela/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alysonvilela","id":22202745,"login":"alysonvilela","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjAyNzQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alysonvilela/orgs","received_even