tHub orgs/repos and a real local D1\ndatabase via `wrangler dev` (local D1 needs no cloud login — this repo\nstill has no provisioned remote database, so that''s as far as this\nenvironment could verify it).","tree":{"sha":"a1e0a80a2caef4d9d8527f1b0b7aba2ee7221ff1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/khalilurrrahmanridoykhan/public-health-repository-quality-auditor/git/trees/a1e0a80a2caef4d9d8527f1b0b7aba2ee7221ff1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/khalilurrrahmanridoykhan/public-health-repository-quality-auditor/git/commits/b3f7ddd34bd18785ed0de83d51c5341c44a7fc50","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/114473324?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khalilurrrahmanridoykhan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khalilurrrahmanridoykhan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khalilurrrahmanridoykhan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khalilurrrahmanridoykhan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/khalilurrrahmanridoykhan","id":114473324,"login":"khalilurrrahmanridoykhan","node_id":"U_kgDOBtK5bA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khalilurrrahmanridoykhan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khalilurrrahmanridoykhan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khalilurrrahmanridoykhan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khalilurrrahmanridoykhan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khalilurrrahmanridoykhan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/khalilurrrahmanridoykhan","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/khalilurrrahmanridoykhan/public-health-repository-quality-auditor/commit/b3f7ddd34bd18785ed0de83d51c5341c44a7fc50","node_id":"C_kwDOTkjMhtoAKGIzZjdkZGQzNGJkMTg3ODVlZDBkZTgzZDUxYzUzNDFjNDRhN2ZjNTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/khalilurrrahmanridoykhan/public-health-repository-quality-auditor/commit/1821bcfb3961057c75f0f65ba00aad0f31d3059d","sha":"1821bcfb3961057c75f0f65ba00aad0f31d3059d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/khalilurrrahmanridoykhan/public-health-repository-quality-auditor/commits/1821bcfb3961057c75f0f65ba00aad0f31d3059d"}],"sha":"b3f7ddd34bd18785ed0de83d51c5341c44a7fc50","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/khalilurrrahmanridoykhan/public-health-repository-quality-auditor/commits/b3f7ddd34bd18785ed0de83d51c5341c44a7fc50"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/114473324?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khalilurrrahmanridoykhan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khalilurrrahmanridoykhan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khalilurrrahmanridoykhan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khalilurrrahmanridoykhan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/khalilurrrahmanridoykhan","id":114473324,"login":"khalilurrrahmanridoykhan","node_id":"U_kgDOBtK5bA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khalilurrrahmanridoykhan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khalilurrrahmanridoykhan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khalilurrrahmanridoykhan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khalilurrrahmanridoykhan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khalilurrrahmanridoykhan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/khalilurrrahmanridoykhan","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/khalilurrrahmanridoykhan/public-health-repository-quality-auditor/commits/1821bcfb3961057c75f0f65ba00aad0f31d3059d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T15:25:49Z","email":"khalilurrahmanridoykhan@gmail.com","name":"khalilurrrahmanridoykhan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T15:25:49Z","email":"khalilurrahmanridoykhan@gmail.com","name":"khalilurrrahmanridoykhan"},"message":"feat: audit any public repo without an App installation; org-wide audit\n\nauditTreeAt() extracted from auditAndPublish() so the tree->files->\npolicy->audit() pipeline is shared between the App-installation path\nand a new no-installation path — the org-wide fleet audit and the\npublic demo both need to read repositories the maintainer never\ninstalled this App on.\n\n- publicGithubFetch(): works unauthenticated (GitHub''s public-repo\n  reads need no auth), optionally raised to 5000/hour with a\n  GITHUB_READONLY_TOKEN env var for real traffic instead of the\n  unauthenticated 60/hour.\n- auditAnyPublicRepository(): the no-installation equivalent of\n  auditAndPublish() — no Check Run posted (there''s no installation to\n  post one on behalf of), returns the report + commit sha.\n- listOrgPublicRepositories() / auditOrganization(): paginated at 8\n  repos/page by default. Each repo audit is ~4 GitHub API calls, and\n  Cloudflare Workers caps subrequests per request at 50 on the free\n  tier — this bounds a single request within that budget rather than\n  guessing at a page size. Forks and archived repos are excluded: an\n  org-wide fleet audit is about an org''s own maintained work. One\n  failed repository in a page doesn''t fail the rest.\n\nEvery audit path (webhook, manual dashboard, org-wide, demo) now also\nrecords a trend-history row via a new recordRunQuietly() helper, which\nswallows any D1 failure — a missing/unreachable database must never\ntake down the audit it''s recording.","tree":{"sha":"6671c0344f2fd95585b20be87c079a5b5a0fbecc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/khalilurrrahmanridoykhan/public-health-repository-quality-auditor/git/trees/6671c0344f2fd95585b20be87c079a5b5a0fbecc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/khalilurrrahmanridoykhan/public-health-repository-