name":"khalilurrrahmanridoykhan"},"message":"feat: add the D1-backed run-history store\n\nlib/db.ts: recordRun/getTrend/getLatestRun/getLatestRunPerRepository\nagainst the `DB` D1 binding added in the previous commit. getDb() wraps\ngetCloudflareContext() and degrades to null on any failure (no binding\nprovisioned, not running in a Cloudflare context at all) rather than\nthrowing — trend history is best-effort, the same policy the Python\ncore uses for optional external validators.\n\ntypes/cloudflare-env.d.ts declaration-merges `DB?: D1Database` into\n@opennextjs/cloudflare''s global CloudflareEnv interface, which only\ndeclares the bindings it ships (ASSETS, IMAGES, ...) — this project''s\nown DB binding has to be added from outside node_modules.","tree":{"sha":"770a3d2d97e641897919de5f9157cccd5967d8ec","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/khalilurrrahmanridoykhan/public-health-repository-quality-auditor/git/trees/770a3d2d97e641897919de5f9157cccd5967d8ec"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/khalilurrrahmanridoykhan/public-health-repository-quality-auditor/git/commits/74ab9e4b40a769db9635ec40f1cec82ad14ce098","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/114473324?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khalilurrrahmanridoykhan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khalilurrrahmanridoykhan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khalilurrrahmanridoykhan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khalilurrrahmanridoykhan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/khalilurrrahmanridoykhan","id":114473324,"login":"khalilurrrahmanridoykhan","node_id":"U_kgDOBtK5bA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khalilurrrahmanridoykhan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khalilurrrahmanridoykhan/received_events","repos_url":