anridoykhan"},"message":"feat(packs): add the migration-safety pack\n\nCross-cutting in spirit, but still gated on detecting an actual migration-\nframework marker (alembic.ini, a Flyway-style versioned SQL migration, a\nPrisma migration.sql, a Django/Rails/Alembic migration file) matched by\nconventional directory *segment* (migration/migrations/migrate, or\nversions under alembic/) — a loose substring match on \"migrat\" would also\ncatch this pack''s own source/test filenames, caught during self-testing.\n\nShips migration/irreversible, migration/non-idempotent, and\nmigration/data-and-schema-mixed across Flyway/Prisma raw SQL, Django,\nRails, and Alembic — regex heuristics over migration file text, same\nrigor tier as the DHIS2 pack''s source scanning, not a real SQL/Python/\nRuby parse. Liquibase is intentionally not duplicated here; OpenmrsPack\nalready owns it. Knex is deferred: its migrations are plain JS/TS\nfunctions with no textual convention as reliable as Flyway''s V__/U__\nnaming or Django''s RunPython, so a regex-only pass would be guessing\nrather than checking.","tree":{"sha":"a57cdc8a1db4f4a0411496dd089acbe4e5dc7db4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/khalilurrrahmanridoykhan/public-health-repository-quality-auditor/git/trees/a57cdc8a1db4f4a0411496dd089acbe4e5dc7db4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/khalilurrrahmanridoykhan/public-health-repository-quality-auditor/git/commits/8b11ed88184d55a2243bf9b28bbf7f7802175274","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/114473324?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khalilurrrahmanridoykhan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khalilurrrahmanridoykhan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khalilurrrahmanridoykhan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khalilurrrahmanridoykhan/gists{/gist_id}","