14473324,"login":"khalilurrrahmanridoykhan","node_id":"U_kgDOBtK5bA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khalilurrrahmanridoykhan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khalilurrrahmanridoykhan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khalilurrrahmanridoykhan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khalilurrrahmanridoykhan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khalilurrrahmanridoykhan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/khalilurrrahmanridoykhan","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/khalilurrrahmanridoykhan/public-health-repository-quality-auditor/commits/d0072fb9b7934cc70e78a93004a5cd20e6be1ff5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T15:18:00Z","email":"khalilurrahmanridoykhan@gmail.com","name":"khalilurrrahmanridoykhan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T15:18:00Z","email":"khalilurrahmanridoykhan@gmail.com","name":"khalilurrrahmanridoykhan"},"message":"feat(packs): add the pii pack\n\nCross-cutting (always detects at confidence 1.0, no platform marker\nneeded) — the auditor''s own core privacy mission. Ships:\n\n- pii/patient-data-in-repo: a committed .csv whose header row clusters\n  several person-level-data column groups together (identity, date of\n  birth, a health-specific field, a contact/ID field), not just one —\n  a single \"name\" column on an org-unit lookup table shouldn''t trip it.\n  Skipped on paths that look deliberately synthetic (test/, fixture/,\n  sample/, mock/, demo/, example/).\n- secrets/committed-env-values: a tracked .env/.env.* file (not\n  .env.example/.sample/.template/.dist) with a non-empty, non-placeholder\n  value.\n- pii/db-dump-committed: a committed .dump/.bak file by presence, or a\n  .sql file outside a migrations directory over ~20KB — shaped like a\n  database export rather than a schema change.","tree":{"sha":"93f713ba78