6b5bc46de3fcbd238/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-13T10:40:03Z","email":"khalilurrahmanridoykhan@gmail.com","name":"khalilurrrahmanridoykhan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-13T10:40:03Z","email":"khalilurrahmanridoykhan@gmail.com","name":"khalilurrrahmanridoykhan"},"message":"feat(packs): add the OpenMRS pack\n\nDetects on an OpenMRS module descriptor (config.xml with a <module> root\nand a <package> child — bare config.xml is too generic a name to trust\nalone), pom.xml with <packaging>omod</packaging>, an O3 routes.json\n(schema json.openmrs.org/routes.schema.json), or @openmrs/esm-framework in\nany of a package.json''s dependencies/devDependencies/peerDependencies.\nLiquibase checks match by root tag and local element name\n(namespace-tolerant), not filename, so any .xml with a <databaseChangeLog>\nroot gets checked.\n\nShips: liquibase-missing-id, liquibase-duplicate-id,\nliquibase-sql-no-rollback, liquibase-non-idempotent,\nliquibase-db-specific-sql, hardcoded-concept-uuid,\no3-missing-framework-peer, o3-route-missing-export, o3-invalid-routes-json.\n\nThree rules from the original plan were dropped, not shipped speculatively:\nundeclared-privilege/undeclared-global-property (real @Authorized(...)/\ngetGlobalProperty(...) calls pass a Java constant, not a string literal, so\na literal-only regex would never fire on real code) and\nrequiremodules-unresolvable (needs the OpenMRS module registry). Two were\nrenamed/rebuilt after finding the plan''s assumptions didn''t match real O3\nconventions: liquibase-no-rollback narrowed to liquibase-sql-no-rollback\n(Liquibase auto-generates rollback for createTable/addColumn), and\no3-routes-registry rebuilt into o3-route-missing-export around the real\nsrc/routes.json file (not routes.registry.json).","tree":{"sha":"ca92fddfb6638df708916bb3cff46c59387d71bb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/khalilurrrahmanridoykhan/public-health-repository-quality-auditor/git/trees/ca92fddfb6638df708916bb3cff46c59387d71bb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/khalilurrrahmanridoykhan/public-health-repository-quality-auditor/git/commits/72263ac75b22f4bb527b74a6b5bc46de3fcbd238","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/114473324?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khalilurrrahmanridoykhan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khalilurrrahmanridoykhan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khalilurrrahmanridoykhan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khalilurrrahmanridoykhan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/khalilurrrahmanridoykhan","id":114473324,"login":"khalilurrrahmanridoykhan","node_id":"U_kgDOBtK5bA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khalilurrrahmanridoykhan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khalilurrrahmanridoykhan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khalilurrrahmanridoykhan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khalilurrrahmanridoykhan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khalilurrrahmanridoykhan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/khalilurrrahmanridoykhan","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/khalilurrrahmanridoykhan/public-health-repository-quality-auditor/commit/72263ac75b22f4bb527b74a6b5bc46de3fcbd238","node_id":"C_kwDOTkjMhtoAKDcyMjYzYWM3NWIyMmY0YmI1MjdiNzRhNmI1YmM0NmRlM2ZjYmQyMzg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/khalilurrrahmanridoykhan/public-health-repository-quality-auditor/commit/064844f5f7c9d523fee0ff5c6b0bc353195cbf35","sha":"064844f5f7c9d523fee0ff5c6b0bc353195cbf35","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/khalilurrrahmanridoykhan/public-health-repository-quality-auditor/commits/064844f5f7c9d523fee0ff5c6b0bc353195cbf35"}]