version both import __version__\ninstead of carrying their own separate literal, so this can''t drift again.\n\nCovers Phases 1-3 of the platform-packs plan since v0.1.0 (2026-07-27):\npluggable pack architecture with SARIF/GitHub-annotation output, a FHIR\npack, and a DHIS2 pack — all merged to main with real-world verification\nagainst cloned FHIR IGs and the user''s own DHIS2 apps.","tree":{"sha":"3e37eedcdb508a159f2c0ecd341878d34cfd4fbd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/khalilurrrahmanridoykhan/public-health-repository-quality-auditor/git/trees/3e37eedcdb508a159f2c0ecd341878d34cfd4fbd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/khalilurrrahmanridoykhan/public-health-repository-quality-auditor/git/commits/064844f5f7c9d523fee0ff5c6b0bc353195cbf35","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/114473324?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khalilurrrahmanridoykhan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khalilurrrahmanridoykhan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khalilurrrahmanridoykhan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khalilurrrahmanridoykhan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/khalilurrrahmanridoykhan","id":114473324,"login":"khalilurrrahmanridoykhan","node_id":"U_kgDOBtK5bA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khalilurrrahmanridoykhan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khalilurrrahmanridoykhan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khalilurrrahmanridoykhan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khalilurrrahmanridoykhan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khalilurrrahmanridoykhan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/khalilurrrahmanridoykhan","user_view_type":"public"},"html