"name":"khalilurrrahmanridoykhan"},"message":"test: cover the DHIS2 pack\n\nUnit tests for every shipped rule (positive and negative cases, including\nthe fetch-through-a-helper and bare-domain-in-comment false-positive\nguards confirmed against real app source), detection scoping (distinctive\nvs. generic metadata keys), case-insensitive detection/ignore_paths, and\ndisabled_packs turning the pack off. Metadata-bundle rules use constructed\nfixtures (duplicate-uid, dangling-ref at arbitrary nesting depth, sqlview\nmutating statements, program rule variables) since no native raw DHIS2\nmetadata-export repo was available to test against live data.","tree":{"sha":"5bd54930725b7ffb24b4d772ef0138045b6e723b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/khalilurrrahmanridoykhan/public-health-repository-quality-auditor/git/trees/5bd54930725b7ffb24b4d772ef0138045b6e723b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/khalilurrrahmanridoykhan/public-health-repository-quality-auditor/git/commits/6675ebdb89c829dad95a41d0dd3d3c05fbfd66f6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/114473324?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khalilurrrahmanridoykhan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khalilurrrahmanridoykhan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khalilurrrahmanridoykhan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khalilurrrahmanridoykhan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/khalilurrrahmanridoykhan","id":114473324,"login":"khalilurrrahmanridoykhan","node_id":"U_kgDOBtK5bA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khalilurrrahmanridoykhan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khalilurrrahmanridoykhan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khalilurrrahmanridoykhan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://a