08-10T19:11:15Z","email":"amashadahamni16@gmail.com","name":"amashadahamni"},"message":"feat: Add initial frontend structure for Project Summit food marketplace\n\n- Created index.html for the main landing page with navigation and hero section.\n- Added signin.html for user authentication with Google and email/password options.\n- Implemented supplier.html for supplier-specific functionalities and product management.\n- Introduced auth-config.js and auth.js for AWS Cognito authentication setup.\n- Developed a simple Node.js server to serve static files.\n- Added sample auth-config file for configuration guidance.\n- Created a supplier app using React with single-spa for microfrontend architecture.\n- Established FastAPI services for product, cart, and approval management with CRUD operations.\n- Included Dockerfiles and requirements for each service to facilitate deployment.","tree":{"sha":"015f749636556452f8f2a92f570be3a31e7db446","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amashadahamni/project-summit-food-marketplace/git/trees/015f749636556452f8f2a92f570be3a31e7db446"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amashadahamni/project-summit-food-marketplace/git/commits/dcdf571fa5f6079d6cbdf4043cf4d25cff7ea66a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/170313376?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amashadahamni/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amashadahamni/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amashadahamni/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amashadahamni/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/amashadahamni","id":170313376,"login":"amashadahamni","node_id":"U_kgDOCibGoA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amashadahamni/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amashadahamni/received_events","repos_url":