r":{"account":{"login":"scriptcoded","providerType":"User"},"email":"malcolm.nihlen@gmail.com","name":"Malcolm Nihlén"},"authoredDate":"2026-07-27T12:49:17Z","committedDate":"2026-07-27T12:49:17Z","committer":{"account":{"login":"scriptcoded","providerType":"User"},"email":"malcolm.nihlen@gmail.com","name":"Malcolm Nihlén"},"observedAt":"2026-10-08T23:56:32.752Z","repositoryId":1313837166,"sha":"36748e31e03b61b82fb1035a568900159f008c98"}],"observedAt":"2026-10-08T23:56:32.752Z","raw":[{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6452991?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scriptcoded/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scriptcoded/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scriptcoded/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scriptcoded/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/scriptcoded","id":6452991,"login":"scriptcoded","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY0NTI5OTE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scriptcoded/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scriptcoded/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scriptcoded/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scriptcoded/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scriptcoded/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/scriptcoded","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scouterna/j26-tags/commits/1e7f7bfd70988433954f285ca160849307048150/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-27T19:51:31Z","email":"malcolm.nihlen@gmail.com","name":"Malcolm Nihlén"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-27T19:51:31Z","email":"malcolm.nihlen@gmail.com","name":"Malcolm Nihlén"},"message":"fix: add migration to rename groupNo to groupId\n\nThe previous commit renamed the column by editing the already-applied\nmigration in place. That was wrong twice over: it breaks the checksum Prisma\nrecorded when the migration ran, and it leaves any database that already\napplied it on the old column name — which surfaced as\n\n    The column `Tag.groupId` does not exist in the current database.\n\nRestores 20260727180000 to exactly the content that was applied, and adds a\nnew migration renaming Tag.groupNo and Group.groupNo to groupId, plus the\nTag_groupNo_idx index. Guarded with IF EXISTS so replaying the chain is a\nno-op.\n\nVerified in PGlite that a fresh 1->2->3 chain and a database already carrying\nthe old shape converge on identical schemas, that tag and group data survives\nthe rename, and that migration 3 can run twice without error.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f7cc06b87ea3638d56feb8810ca6c81701f93f42","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scouterna/j26-tags/git/trees/f7cc06b87ea3638d56feb8810ca6c81701f93f42"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scouterna/j26-tags/git/commits/1e7f7bfd70988433954f285ca160849307048150","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6452991?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scriptcoded/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scriptcoded/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scriptcoded/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scriptcoded/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/scriptcoded","id":6452991,"login":"scriptcoded","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY0NTI5OTE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scriptcoded/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scriptcoded/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scriptcoded/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scriptcoded/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scriptcoded/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/scriptcoded","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Scouterna/j26-tags/commit/1e7f7bfd70988433954f285ca160849307048150","node_id":"C_kwDOTk-QbtoAKDFlN2Y3YmZkNzA5ODg0MzM5NTRmMjg1Y2ExNjA4NDkzMDcwNDgxNTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Scouterna/j26-tags/commit/eaf5ac4625e43b238ec10c640daec536c768f32c","sha":"eaf5ac4625e43b238ec10c640daec536c768f32c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scouterna/j26-tags/commits/eaf5ac4625e43b238ec10c640daec536c768f32c"}],"sha":"1e7f7bfd70988433954f285ca160849307048150","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scouterna/j26-tags/commits/1e7f7bfd70988433954f285ca160849307048150"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6452991?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scriptcoded/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scriptcoded/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scriptcoded/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scriptcoded/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/scriptcoded","id":6452991,"login":"scriptcoded","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY0NTI5OTE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scriptcoded/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scriptcoded/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scriptcoded/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scriptcoded/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scriptcoded/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/scriptcoded","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scouterna/j26-tags/commits/eaf5ac4625e43b238ec10c640daec536c768f32c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-27T19:39:59Z","email":"malcolm.nihlen@gmail.com","name":"Malcolm Nihlén"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-27T19:39:59Z","email":"malcolm.nihlen@gmail.com","name":"Malcolm Nihlén"},"message":"fix: decode CSV uploads by encoding, and rename groupNo back to groupId\n\nTwo changes that both surfaced from real use.\n\nCSV encoding\n------------\nUploads were read with File.text(), which always assumes UTF-8. Desktop\nExcel''s plain \"CSV (comma delimited)\" writes the system codepage\n(Windows-1252 here), so å ä ö decoded to U+FFFD — reported as question\nmarks. decodeCsvBytes() now sniffs the bytes: BOM first (UTF-8 and UTF-16\neither byte order), then strict UTF-8, falling back to Windows-1252, which\nnever fails. The form reports the encoding when it isn''t UTF-8.\n\nThe samples in public/ also lacked a UTF-8 BOM, which is what made Excel\nmisread them in the first place and start the broken round trip. They now\ncarry one, enforced by a test that parses each shipped file.\n\nA file whose characters were already destroyed before upload cannot be\nrecovered, so U+FFFD is detected and the operator is told to re-save as\n\"CSV UTF-8\" rather than plain \"CSV\".\n\ngroupNo -> groupId\n------------------\nRestores the original field name across the schema, server functions,\nmachine API, CSV column, route params and docs. memberNo is unchanged.\n\nThis makes the migration simpler rather than more complex: Tag.groupId\nalready existed and already held the external group number, so it now stays\nin place instead of being copied into a new column, and Tag_groupId_idx is\nleft untouched. Only memberNo is genuinely new.\n\nAlso dropped groupId from the machine API''s moved_field guard — it is the\ntag''s own reference column again, not a removed one — and renamed the\ninvalid_group_no error code to invalid_group_id.\n\nMigration chain re-verified against a real Postgres engine via PGlite;\n82 unit tests.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c439c6f16efa94594a7dab1b686a62277c6185d5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scouterna/j26-tags/git/trees/c439c6f16efa94594a7dab1b686a62277c6185d5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scouterna/j26-tags/git/commits/eaf5ac4625e43b238ec10c640daec536c768f32c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6452991?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scriptcoded/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scriptcoded/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scriptcoded/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scriptcoded/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/scriptcoded","id":6452991,"login":"scriptcoded","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY0NTI5OTE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scriptcoded/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scriptcoded/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scriptcoded/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scriptcoded/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scriptcoded/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/scriptcoded","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Scouterna/j26-tags/commit/eaf5ac4625e43b238ec10c640daec536c768f32c","node_id":"C_kwDOTk-QbtoAKGVhZjVhYzQ2MjVlNDNiMjM4ZWMxMGM2NDBkYWVjNTM2Yzc2OGYzMmM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Scouterna/j26-tags/commit/bfc77bab2e42fa23da22968f2714a393e8dd6eb8","sha":"bfc77bab2e42fa23da22968f2714a393e8dd6eb8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scouterna/j26-tags/commits/bfc77bab2e42fa23da22968f2714a393e8dd6eb8"}],"sha":"eaf5ac4625e43b238ec10c640daec536c768f32c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scouterna/j26-tags/commits/eaf5ac4625e43b238ec10c640daec536c768f32c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6452991?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scriptcoded/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scriptcoded/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scriptcoded/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scriptcoded/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/scriptcoded","id":6452991,"login":"scriptcoded","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY0NTI5OTE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scriptcoded/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scriptcoded/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scriptcoded/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scriptcoded/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scriptcoded/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/scriptcoded","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scouterna/j26-tags/commits/bfc77bab2e42fa23da22968f2714a393e8dd6eb8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-27T19:15:38Z","email":"malcolm.nihlen@gmail.com","name":"Malcolm Nihlén"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-27T19:15:38Z","email":"malcolm.nihlen@gmail.com","name":"Malcolm Nihlén"},"message":"feat!: resolve group and location from lookup tables\n\nA tag now stores only references — a group number, a member number, or\nboth. The group name and coordinates move into two new lookup tables and\nare resolved when a tag is read, so correcting a camp site is one edit\ninstead of one per tag.\n\n    Tag     id (UID)  ->  groupNo?  memberNo?\n    Group   groupNo   ->  name, lat?, lng?\n    Member  memberNo  ->  lat?, lng?\n\nReferences are deliberately not foreign keys: a tag can be registered\nbefore its group or member has been imported, and resolves with\nresolved:false until then. Deleting a lookup row orphans tags rather than\ncascading, and the delete handlers return the count so the UI can warn.\n\nCoordinates prefer the group''s camp site and fall back to the member''s own\nposition; coordinateSource records which was used.\n\nBREAKING CHANGE: creating a tag no longer accepts a group name or\ncoordinates. POST /api/tags takes groupNo and/or memberNo and rejects the\nremoved fields with `moved_field`. Reads keep the group/lat/lng keys as\nresolved values so existing clients are unaffected. The tag CSV format is\nnow tagId;groupNo;memberNo, and a file with the old columns is rejected\nrather than silently losing them.\n\n- New admin screens for groups and members (list, create, edit, import)\n- Three CSV imports sharing one preview-then-commit component\n- Validation extracted to lib/tag-input so the API and forms can''t diverge\n- Migration backfills a Group row per distinct groupId, taking the name and\n  coordinates from that group''s most recently updated tag\n\nMigration chain and resolution precedence verified against a real Postgres\nengine via PGlite; 66 unit tests.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2cf5263f9bd31dfd40f5ead627386e21c74289a4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scouterna/j26-tags/git/trees/2cf5263f9bd31dfd40f5ead627386e21c74289a4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scouterna/j26-tags/git/commits/bfc77bab2e42fa23da22968f2714a393e8dd6eb8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6452991?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scriptcoded/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scriptcoded/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scriptcoded/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scriptcoded/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/scriptcoded","id":6452991,"login":"scriptcoded","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY0NTI5OTE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scriptcoded/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scriptcoded/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scriptcoded/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scriptcoded/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scriptcoded/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/scriptcoded","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Scouterna/j26-tags/commit/bfc77bab2e42fa23da22968f2714a393e8dd6eb8","node_id":"C_kwDOTk-QbtoAKGJmYzc3YmFiMmU0MmZhMjNkYTIyOTY4ZjI3MTRhMzkzZThkZDZlYjg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Scouterna/j26-tags/commit/77c7d9ef50d3393877fb308a2a30c22e635d0cd7","sha":"77c7d9ef50d3393877fb308a2a30c22e635d0cd7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scouterna/j26-tags/commits/77c7d9ef50d3393877fb308a2a30c22e635d0cd7"}],"sha":"bfc77bab2e42fa23da22968f2714a393e8dd6eb8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scouterna/j26-tags/commits/bfc77bab2e42fa23da22968f2714a393e8dd6eb8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6452991?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scriptcoded/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scriptcoded/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scriptcoded/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scriptcoded/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/scriptcoded","id":6452991,"login":"scriptcoded","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY0NTI5OTE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scriptcoded/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scriptcoded/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scriptcoded/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scriptcoded/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scriptcoded/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/scriptcoded","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scouterna/j26-tags/commits/77c7d9ef50d3393877fb308a2a30c22e635d0cd7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-27T14:23:24Z","email":"malcolm.nihlen@gmail.com","name":"Malcolm Nihlén"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-27T14:23:24Z","email":"malcolm.nihlen@gmail.com","name":"Malcolm Nihlén"},"message":"fix: don''t create tables","tree":{"sha":"f36f962131195b6a7687df0c6081f3839461f2ef","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scouterna/j26-tags/git/trees/f36f962131195b6a7687df0c6081f3839461f2ef"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scouterna/j26-tags/git/commits/77c7d9ef50d3393877fb308a2a30c22e635d0cd7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6452991?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scriptcoded/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scriptcoded/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scriptcoded/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scriptcoded/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/scriptcoded","id":6452991,"login":"scriptcoded","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY0NTI5OTE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scriptcoded/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scriptcoded/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scriptcoded/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scriptcoded/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scriptcoded/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/scriptcoded","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Scouterna/j26-tags/commit/77c7d9ef50d3393877fb308a2a30c22e635d0cd7","node_id":"C_kwDOTk-QbtoAKDc3YzdkOWVmNTBkMzM5Mzg3N2ZiMzA4YTJhMzBjMjJlNjM1ZDBjZDc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Scouterna/j26-tags/commit/36748e31e03b61b82fb1035a568900159f008c98","sha":"36748e31e03b61b82fb1035a568900159f008c98","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scouterna/j26-tags/commits/36748e31e03b61b82fb1035a568900159f008c98"}],"sha":"77c7d9ef50d3393877fb308a2a30c22e635d0cd7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scouterna/j26-tags/commits/77c7d9ef50d3393877fb308a2a30c22e635d0cd7"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6452991?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scriptcoded/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scriptcoded/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scriptcoded/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scriptcoded/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/scriptcoded","id":6452991,"login":"scriptcoded","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY0NTI5OTE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scriptcoded/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scriptcoded/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scriptcoded/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scriptcoded/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scriptcoded/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/scriptcoded","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scouterna/j26-tags/commits/36748e31e03b61b82fb1035a568900159f008c98/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-27T12:49:17Z","email":"malcolm.nihlen@gmail.com","name":"Malcolm Nihlén"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-27T12:49:17Z","email":"malcolm.nihlen@gmail.com","name":"Malcolm Nihlén"},"message":"feat: RFID tag registry with admin UI and machine API\n\nMaps a physical tag''s UID to the group holding it, so lost tags can be\ntraced and other services can resolve tag ids programmatically.\n\n- Lookup page with Web NFC scanning for lost-and-found staff\n- Admin CRUD with server-side search, filtering and pagination\n- CSV bulk import: preview, then commit as a single transaction\n- Read-only machine API guarded by a static TAGS_API_KEY\n- /api/me and /api/app-config for the j26-app shell\n\nAuth follows the house pattern: Keycloak access token from the\nj26-auth cookie, verified against JWKS. Roles admin / tags:write /\ntags:read resolve to capabilities in src/lib/permissions.ts.\n\nTag ids are normalised to uppercase without separators on every read\nand write, so reader formatting differences resolve to one tag.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a61da63d85c0920b53fb7725b3001b547c611b00","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scouterna/j26-tags/git/trees/a61da63d85c0920b53fb7725b3001b547c611b00"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scouterna/j26-tags/git/commits/36748e31e03b61b82fb1035a568900159f008c98","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6452991?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scriptcoded/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scriptcoded/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scriptcoded/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scriptcoded/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/scriptcoded","id":6452991,"login":"scriptcoded","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY0NTI5OTE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scriptcoded/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scriptcoded/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scriptcoded/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scriptcoded/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scriptcoded/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/scriptcoded","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Scouterna/j26-tags/commit/36748e31e03b61b82fb1035a568900159f008c98","node_id":"C_kwDOTk-QbtoAKDM2NzQ4ZT