","email":"hmt1501@users.noreply.github.com","name":"hmt1501"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-29T03:26:34Z","email":"hmt1501@users.noreply.github.com","name":"hmt1501"},"message":"Tach hai hang doi doc lap cho lan nghe va lan noi\n\nTruoc day ca hai che do dung chung mot hang doi tuan tu: cau nguoi dung go\n(can doc TTS ngay) phai xep sau luot dich cua doi phuong — te nhat la khi\nfallback Workers AI keo dai 3-5s. Tach doi thi lan noi khong bao gio ket\nsau lan nghe, trong khi moi lan van tuan tu nen goi y va thu tu doc TTS\nkhong bi lon.","tree":{"sha":"796a45ff1bced860df1656f94aff3aae7ddc3702","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hmt1501/Translator/git/trees/796a45ff1bced860df1656f94aff3aae7ddc3702"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hmt1501/Translator/git/commits/00f5dfc168283c6742e0707dbc5cc5b8059b9e96","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/141661968?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hmt1501/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hmt1501/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hmt1501/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hmt1501/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hmt1501","id":141661968,"login":"hmt1501","node_id":"U_kgDOCHGXEA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hmt1501/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hmt1501/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hmt1501/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hmt1501/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hmt1501/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hmt1501","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/hmt1501/Translator/commit/00f5dfc168283c6742e0707dbc5cc5b8059b9e96","node_id":"C_kwDOTlrjAtoAKDAwZjVkZmMxNjgyODNjNjc0MmUwNzA3ZGJjNWNjNWI4MDU5YjllOTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hmt1501/Translator/commit/4a9e4fcad50109ea2fafbc45d4683ffbe705ae6c","sha":"4a9e4fcad50109ea2fafbc45d4683ffbe705ae6c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hmt1501/Translator/commits/4a9e4fcad50109ea2fafbc45d4683ffbe705ae6c"}],"sha":"00f5dfc168283c6742e0707dbc5cc5b8059b9e96","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hmt1501/Translator/commits/00f5dfc168283c6742e0707dbc5cc5b8059b9e96"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/141661968?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hmt1501/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hmt1501/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hmt1501/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hmt1501/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hmt1501","id":141661968,"login":"hmt1501","node_id":"U_kgDOCHGXEA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hmt1501/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hmt1501/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hmt1501/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hmt1501/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hmt1501/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hmt1501","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hmt1501/Translator/commits/4a9e4fcad50109ea2fafbc45d4683ffbe705ae6c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-29T03:20:24Z","email":"hmt1501@users.noreply.github.com","name":"hmt1501"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-29T03:20:24Z","email":"hmt1501@users.noreply.github.com","name":"hmt1501"},"message":"Tach hai hang doi + tuy chon doc to ban dich tieng Viet\n\nHang doi:\n- Tach enqueue chung thanh enqueueListen va enqueueSpeak. Cau nguoi dung go\n  khong con xep sau luot dich cua doi phuong. Do duoc: nhanh hon ~2.9s trong\n  kich ban Groq bi chan vung phai fallback sang Workers AI.\n- Trong moi lan van tuan tu nen khong can sequence guard cho setSuggestions.\n\nDoc tieng Viet:\n- useTextToSpeech: pickEnglishVoice -> pickVoice(voices, lang, preferredURI)\n  ho tro ca en va vi; speak(text, {lang}); tra ve enVoices/viVoices va\n  hasVietnameseVoice thay cho voices.\n- Them speakIfIdle() cho auto-read: bo qua neu dang doc do, de cau tieng Anh\n  gui cho nguoi doi dien khong bi cat ngang.\n- Khong co giong vi-VN thi khong doc gi ca (doc tieng Viet bang giong tieng Anh\n  ra am thanh khong nghe hieu duoc).\n- Nut bat/tat 🔊 VI o thanh tren cung, tu xam khi may thieu giong tieng Viet.\n- Them o chon giong tieng Viet trong Cai dat.\n- README: huong dan cai goi vi-VN cho Windows/Android/macOS va ghi ro danh doi\n  micro tam dung trong luc doc.","tree":{"sha":"920888ad4e684dc115f32690558b2cb9aaffb435","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hmt1501/Translator/git/trees/920888ad4e684dc115f32690558b2cb9aaffb435"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hmt1501/Translator/git/commits/4a9e4fcad50109ea2fafbc45d4683ffbe705ae6c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/141661968?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hmt1501/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hmt1501/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hmt1501/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hmt1501/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hmt1501","id":141661968,"login":"hmt1501","node_id":"U_kgDOCHGXEA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hmt1501/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hmt1501/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hmt1501/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hmt1501/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api