:"hmt1501"},"message":"Bo han xAI, chi con Groq + Workers AI\n\n- worker.js: bo mang PROVIDERS da nha cung cap, goi thang Groq roi fallback\n- Bo bien GROK_MODEL va secret XAI_API_KEY khoi cau hinh\n- Doi ten src/api/grok.js thanh translate.js cho dung nghia\n- Xoa ten model xAI con sot trong localStorage de khong bi Groq tra 404","tree":{"sha":"b10d21c28e8cbbe7de556de16f9d44e9e7d88895","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hmt1501/Translator/git/trees/b10d21c28e8cbbe7de556de16f9d44e9e7d88895"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hmt1501/Translator/git/commits/e465de1e310d62acff5baa8f59367723d9374ad2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/141661968?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hmt1501/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hmt1501/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hmt1501/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hmt1501/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hmt1501","id":141661968,"login":"hmt1501","node_id":"U_kgDOCHGXEA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hmt1501/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hmt1501/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hmt1501/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hmt1501/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hmt1501/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hmt1501","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/hmt1501/Translator/commit/e465de1e310d62acff5baa8f59367723d9374ad2","node_id":"C_kwDOTlrjAtoAKGU0NjVkZTFlMzEwZDYyYWNmZjViYWE4ZjU5MzY3NzIzZDkzNzRhZDI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hmt1501/Translator/commit/b2cb33a5d53c5be54e7bba709f74a7415ce6e604","sha":"b2cb33a5d53c5be54e7bba709f74a7415ce6e604","url":"https://api