c now shows that facility''s\nown sender: whether it can reach central, records waiting and retrying, the\nlast change picked up, first-load progress, and any facility alert in plain\nwords. It reads the facility''s own Prometheus, as central does.\n\nThe capture exporter asks the sender''s health endpoint for Spring''s broker\ncheck and exports sync_sender_broker_connected, which the new\nSyncCentralUnreachable alert watches. Its runbook section covers a facility\non the HTTPS tunnel as well as one still on 61617. The backend keeps\nenabled=false at a facility, so the currently pinned page stays hidden until\nthe new one is pinned.","tree":{"sha":"1b25fd8265cb2bdbc434d7a331192ddd7939323c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IntelliSOFT-Consulting/liberia-emr/git/trees/1b25fd8265cb2bdbc434d7a331192ddd7939323c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IntelliSOFT-Consulting/liberia-emr/git/commits/6cb8dd1d0870ca8bbb7aacfd3a6ece0ea9f2746f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12535929?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ekirapapaul/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ekirapapaul/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ekirapapaul/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ekirapapaul/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Ekirapapaul","id":12535929,"login":"Ekirapapaul","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyNTM1OTI5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ekirapapaul/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ekirapapaul/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ekirapapaul/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ekirapapaul/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ekirapapaul/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ekir