1c2c4db370688cdf64ce77b68408824d38c8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IntelliSOFT-Consulting/liberia-emr/commits/70781c2c4db370688cdf64ce77b68408824d38c8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12535929?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ekirapapaul/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ekirapapaul/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ekirapapaul/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ekirapapaul/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Ekirapapaul","id":12535929,"login":"Ekirapapaul","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyNTM1OTI5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ekirapapaul/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ekirapapaul/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ekirapapaul/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ekirapapaul/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ekirapapaul/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ekirapapaul","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IntelliSOFT-Consulting/liberia-emr/commits/a5500e97d4f53d48cb0ea0ce259339dc2548108b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T14:29:55Z","email":"ekirapapaul@gmail.com","name":"Paul Ekirapa"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T18:56:31Z","email":"ekirapapaul@gmail.com","name":"Paul Ekirapa"},"message":"feat(identity): review possible matches at central and decide them [LE-403]\n\nPairs the National ID rule cannot settle (ADR 0005 band 2) waited in\nmatch_review with no way to act on them. A Possible matches page at central,\nreached from the Sync status tile, lists them with each record''s facility,\nshows both records side by side with what differs marked, and records a\nperson''s answer to one question: are these the same person.\n\nSame person aliases the record under review''s person to the other''s.\nDifferent people on linked records separates the record under review, its\naliases moving to its primary; on records not linked it changes nothing, and\nthe National ID rule never links or queues that pair again. Nothing is\nmerged, deleted or reused. Every change is a cpi_event with the reviewer,\nthe reason is required and kept, and a review is decided once.\n\nNew privilege Review Identity Matches, held by no role until the MOH names\nthe queue''s owner.","tree":{"sha":"fb7b23118c5f3185ff8bbf89a0f08030f84f9d3e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IntelliSOFT-Consulting/liberia-emr/git/trees/fb7b23118c5f3185ff8bbf89a0f08030f84f9d3e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IntelliSOFT-Consulting/liberia-emr/git/commits/a5500e97d4f53d48cb0ea0ce259339dc2548108b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12535929?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ekirapapaul/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ekirapapaul/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ekirapapaul/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ekirapapaul/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Ekirapapaul","id":12535929,"login":"Ekirapapaul","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyNTM1OTI5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ekirapapaul/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ekirapapaul/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ekirapapaul/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ekirapapaul/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ekirapapaul/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ekirapapaul","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/IntelliSOFT-Consulting/liberia-emr/commit/a5500e97d4f53d48cb0ea0ce259339dc2548108b","nod