s_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moshonk/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moshonk/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moshonk/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moshonk/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/moshonk","id":1963527,"login":"moshonk","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NjM1Mjc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moshonk/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moshonk/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moshonk/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moshonk/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moshonk/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/moshonk","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IntelliSOFT-Consulting/liberia-emr/commits/4aee6045c1c4ba157ea8311fd9a435d9714e8d62/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-04T20:02:47Z","email":"omondi.ken@gmail.com","name":"moshonk"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-04T20:02:47Z","email":"omondi.ken@gmail.com","name":"moshonk"},"message":"feat(LE-399): CI refuses changes to UUIDs a release already shipped\n\nShipped content is append-only (IMPLEMENTATION.md section 9), but only the\nadvisory review skill said so. A database that loaded a released UUID keeps\nit: content that moves the UUID cannot load beside the old row''s name, and\nrecords synced from a facility that did load it become placeholders at\ncentral. Both dev servers hit this in August.\n\nscripts/validate/released-uuids.sh compares the tree with the newest\nliberiaemr-* tag and fails when:\n- a UUID a released variables.properties declared is no longer declared by any\n  var.* (moving it to another key is allowed and reported);\n- a UUID a released CSV defined in its Uuid column, literally or through a\n  var.*, is no longer defined by any CSV (retiring the row is allowed).\n\ncontent-demo and var.form.* are out of scope: form UUIDs derive from name and\nversion, so a version bump is a new form by design. Exceptions go in\nreleased-uuids.allowlist with a reason and a second reviewer; an allowlisted\nvariable covers its rows. With no release tag it does nothing.\n\nAgainst liberiaemr-1.0.0 today it passes: 2359 variables and 1490 CSV rows\nunchanged, one key rename reported as a move. Re-applying the August partograph\nchange to the real content fails on both the variable and its CSV row.\ntests/released-uuids.test.sh covers 14 cases. Both run in the validate job;\nIMPLEMENTATION.md section 9 and the review skill point at it.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01V44xbH5zsmcjXhiqxY1RVi","tree":{"sha":"3cca51654367debb89af3ed0ec62d3fabdbae448","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IntelliSOFT-Consulting/liberia-emr/git/trees/3cca51654367debb89af3ed0ec62d3fabdbae448"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IntelliSOFT-Consulting/liberia-emr/git/commits/4aee6045c1c4ba157ea8311fd9a435d9714e8d62","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1963527?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moshonk/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moshonk/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moshonk/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moshonk/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/moshonk","id":1963527,"login":"moshonk","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NjM1Mjc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moshonk/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moshonk/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moshonk/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moshonk/starred{/owner}{/repo}