","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rashidtvmr/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rashidtvmr/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rashidtvmr/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rashidtvmr/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rashidtvmr","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rashidtvmr/frontcore-next-pre-migration/commits/1be3961573727a31cf23de3ab4ba9fac47b92f3f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-07T10:16:52Z","email":"rashidtvmr@gmail.com","name":"rashidtvmr"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-07T10:16:52Z","email":"rashidtvmr@gmail.com","name":"rashidtvmr"},"message":"playground: retire Next.js, TanStack Start + Workers is now the only stack\n\nDeletes app/layout.tsx, app/page.tsx, app/EmbedLoader.tsx, next.config.ts,\nnext-env.d.ts, wrangler.toml (Pages config), and the next dependency —\nfully absorbed by src/routes/__root.tsx since wave 2''s earlier scaffolding\nstep. Confirmed nothing else referenced these files before removing them.\n\npackage.json: dev/build/build:cf now run vite directly (no more dev:vite/\nbuild:vite aliases needed); deploy:cf switches from `wrangler pages deploy`\nto `wrangler deploy` (Workers, using wrangler.jsonc). preview now runs\n`wrangler dev` instead of `serve out` (no more static `out/` directory).\n\nplaywright.config.ts: removed the STACK=vite toggle added for validation —\nvite dev is now the only path, matching production.\n\nVerified: `next` fully removed from node_modules, `pnpm build` (vite) and\nthe full 40-test e2e suite both pass with Next completely gone.\n\nNOT yet done: no `wrangler deploy` has been run against production.\nplayground.frontendx.dev is still a live Cloudflare Pages project — moving\nit to a Worker is a real DNS/routing change that needs to happen as its own\nexplicit, confirmed step before this is actually live.","tree":{"sha":"992d702bf079d31443563eb69142b5afc6b3ca3a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rashidtvmr/frontcore-next-pre-migration/git/trees/992d702bf079d31443563eb69142b5afc6b3ca3a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rashidtvmr/frontcore-next-pre-migration/git/commits/1be3961573727a31cf23de3ab4ba9fac47b92f3f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/58169715?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rashidtvmr/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rashidtvmr/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rashidtvmr/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rashidtvmr/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rashidtvmr","id":58169715,"login":"rashidtvmr","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU4MTY5NzE1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rashidtvmr/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rashidtvmr/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rashidtvmr/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rashidtvmr/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rashidtvmr/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rashidtvmr","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rashidtvmr/frontcore-next-pre-migration/commit/1be3961573727a31cf23de3ab4ba9fac47b92f3f","node_id":"C_kwDOTl2V1NoAKDFiZTM5NjE1NzM3MjdhMzFjZjIzZGUzYWI0YmE5ZmFjNDdiOTJmM2Y","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rashidtvmr/frontcore-next-pre-migration/commit/469836ff9bfd4c07247c7e3806edd056e33cfe2d","sha":"469836ff9bfd4c07247c7e3806edd056e33cfe2d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rashidtvmr/frontcore-next-pre-migration/commits/469836ff9bfd4c07247c7e3806edd056e33cfe2d"}],"sha":"1be3961573727a31cf23de3ab4ba9fac47b92f3f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rashid