e":{"sha":"fbf5fbf45f4b3525c795bc4f0b9fb5234f30a87e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-spa-home/git/trees/fbf5fbf45f4b3525c795bc4f0b9fb5234f30a87e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-spa-home/git/commits/e98f2a13e893cc242800e8e46f97ce68b2e070c4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-spa-home/commit/e98f2a13e893cc242800e8e46f97ce68b2e070c4","node_id":"C_kwDOTl6CftoAKGU5OGYyYTEzZTg5M2NjMjQyODAwZThlNDZmOTdjZTY4YjJlMDcwYzQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-spa-home/commit/6dde056a523e9fca64b0ead6f1d29a7b41b13234","sha":"6dde056a523e9fca64b0ead6f1d29a7b41b13234","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-spa-home/commits/6dde056a523e9fca64b0ead6f1d29a7b41b13234"}],"sha":"e98f2a13e893cc242800e8e46f97ce68b2e070c4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-spa-home/commits/e98f2a13e893cc242800e8e46f97ce68b2e070c4"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-spa-home/commits/6dde056a523e9fca64b0ead6f1d29a7b41b13234/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-02T14:50:51Z","email":"git@wohlben.de","name":"wohlben"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-02T14:50:51Z","email":"git@wohlben.de","name":"wohlben"},"message":"Follow shared npm releases through maintenance branches","tree":{"sha":"8619e67c13cc3447ab34e94bff0824550db8d514","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-spa-home/git/trees/8619e67c13cc3447ab34e94bff0824550db8d514"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-spa-home/git/commits/6dde056a523e9fca64b0ead6f1d29a7b41b13234","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-spa-home/commit/6dde056a523e9fca64b0ead6f1d29a7b41b13234","node_id":"C_kwDOTl6CftoAKDZkZGUwNTZhNTIzZTlmY2E2NGIwZWFkNmYxZDI5YTdiNDFiMTMyMzQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-spa-home/commit/0c6b1e67df684edd62dfdd5c493ce04ec2dbbdf4","sha":"0c6b1e67df684edd62dfdd5c493ce04ec2dbbdf4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-spa-home/commits/0c6b1e67df684edd62dfdd5c493ce04ec2dbbdf4"}],"sha":"6dde056a523e9fca64b0ead6f1d29a7b41b13234","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-spa-home/commits/6dde056a523e9fca64b0ead6f1d29a7b41b13234"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-spa-home/commits/0c6b1e67df684edd62dfdd5c493ce04ec2dbbdf4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-01T11:37:22Z","email":"git@wohlben.de","name":"wohlben"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-01T11:37:22Z","email":"git@wohlben.de","name":"wohlben"},"message":"Trust the event: the poll becomes a single assertion\n\nThe SCM-release split changed what SoftwareRelease means. It is no longer \"the\nrelease landed on the upstream''s main\" — qits-ci publishes it only AFTER a\nrelease pipeline has published the package, so it now means the artifact is in\nthe registry and you can install it. Its payload is {repository, version,\npackageType, packageName}.\n\nThis file predates the split and taught the old model. The prose claimed\nSoftwareRelease carries a `branch`, which is now false: the payload has four\nfields and none of them is a branch. The conclusion was right for the wrong\nreason, so only the reason changed — `repository` is still the whole selection,\nand a `branch: { exact: main }` condition would still match nothing, ever.\n\nThe registry poll guarded a race the split removed by construction. Waiting up\nto ten minutes for a version the event already promised is waiting for\nsomething that cannot be late. The same npm view probe runs once instead of\nsixty times, and it is now defence in depth rather than a race guard: it\nasserts the event meant what it says before the bump writes the version into\nthe manifest, and goes red with a message naming the broken contract.\n\nNothing else moved. The two-way origin dance, the caret pin, the commit\nconvention and the force-push to maintenance/qits-spa-ui-components are all\ncorrect under the new model and stay byte-identical.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c27edf341ad472380ad8f499003a3378e78091b6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-spa-home/git/trees/c27edf341ad472380ad8f499003a3378e78091b6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-spa-home/git/commits/0c6b1e67df684edd62dfdd5c493ce04ec2dbbdf4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-spa-home/commit/0c6b1e67df684edd62dfdd5c493ce04ec2dbbdf4","node_id":"C_kwDOTl6CftoAKDBjNmIxZTY3ZGY2ODRlZGQ2MmRmZGQ1YzQ5M2NlMDRlYzJkYmJkZjQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-spa-home/commit/dd021e83840f540ba23016a67e240fe0a932d30c","sha":"dd021e83840f540ba23016a67e240fe0a932d30c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-spa-home/commits/dd021e83840f540ba23016a67e240fe0a932d30c"}],"sha":"0c6b1e67df684edd62dfdd5c493ce04ec2dbbdf4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-spa-home/commits/0c6b1e67df684edd62dfdd5c493ce04ec2dbbdf4"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-spa-home/commits/dd021e83840f540ba23016a67e240fe0a932d30c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-01T08:52:49Z","email":"qits@local","name":"qits"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-01T08:52:49Z","email":"qits@local","nam