c48dd8c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-spa-home/commit/0fe77803d3f8ceefd95ddc6a529b77daac48dd8c","node_id":"C_kwDOTl6CftoAKDBmZTc3ODAzZDNmOGNlZWZkOTVkZGM2YTUyOWI3N2RhYWM0OGRkOGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-spa-home/commit/2633238c8828849df8f5fbc78e4838f21c1995be","sha":"2633238c8828849df8f5fbc78e4838f21c1995be","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-spa-home/commits/2633238c8828849df8f5fbc78e4838f21c1995be"}],"sha":"0fe77803d3f8ceefd95ddc6a529b77daac48dd8c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-spa-home/commits/0fe77803d3f8ceefd95ddc6a529b77daac48dd8c"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-spa-home/commits/2633238c8828849df8f5fbc78e4838f21c1995be/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-01T06:27:03Z","email":"git@wohlben.de","name":"wohlben"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-01T06:27:03Z","email":"git@wohlben.de","name":"wohlben"},"message":"Join the release train: hear a release, hop it, release in turn\n\nTwo pipeline files make this repository the first consumer on the train.\n\nThe new ci-event-upstream-ui-components.yml triggers on SoftwareRelease from\nqits-spa-ui-components. It waits for the version to reach the registry with a\nbounded budget, swaps the lockfile origins in, regenerates the pin with\nnpm install --package-lock-only, swaps every origin back to localhost:8081,\nasserts none survived, commits as the train, and force-pushes\nmaintenance/qits-spa-ui-components. It matches `repository` and never `branch`:\nSoftwareRelease.branch is the source branch that was released, never main.\n\nci-post-receive.yml grows a second step, bound to prefix maintenance/, that\nPOSTs /workspaces/api/branches/release. Release, not integrate: releasing is\nthe only door onto main, and integrating targets the branch''s parent. The\nexisting test step is untouched, so the maintenance push runs the regular\ntests, and step ordering is the whole of \"release only when they pass\".\n\nThe step asserts the branch itself as well as declaring it. An older qits-ci\nignores the unknown key and would run the release on every push.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6c433aa396ac6a947b05673a7144441b50535452","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-spa-home/git/trees/6c433aa396ac6a947b05673a7144441b50535452"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-spa-home/git/commits/2633238c8828849df8f5fbc78e4838f21c1995be","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-spa-home/commit/2633238c8828849df8f5fbc78e4838f21c1995be","node_id":"C_kwDOTl6CftoAKDI2MzMyMzhjODgyODg0OWRmOGY1ZmJjNzhlNDgzOGYyMWMxOTk1YmU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-spa-home/commit/a2457841448be3763cabc5b5014e17e1c7f2d12a","sha":"a2457841448be3763cabc5b5014e17e1c7f2d12a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-spa-home/commits/a2457841448be3763cabc5b5014e17e1c7f2d12a"}],"sha":"2633238c8828849df8f5fbc78e4838f21c1995be","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-spa-home/commits/2633238c8828849df8f5fbc78e4838f21c1995be"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9362553?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wohlben/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wohlben/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wohlben/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wohlben/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/wohlben","id":9362553,"log