":"2026-10-08T10:20:43Z","email":"qits@local","name":"qits"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T10:20:43Z","email":"qits@local","name":"qits"},"message":"feat(qits-762): the screenshots report view, the githost raw read client and the pixel diff\n\nQitsScreenshotsReport draws the screenshots report kind (v1): header against\nthe baseline tag and the fold, totals, a renderer banner, and New / Changed /\nRemoved groups by spec. Rows are collapsed and read no image until opened;\na changed screenshot shows Side by side, Diff (after at 35% with the mask on\na canvas) and Onion, with the pixel count diffScreenshots computes. Images\ncome through QitsRepositoryRawClient (qits-githost''s /raw door on its own\norigin, withCredentials, 40-entry LRU), are decoded behind\nQITS_IMAGE_DECODER, and their object URLs are revoked on close and destroy.\n\nRegistered by provideQitsScreenshotsReportKind() and among\nprovideQitsStandardReportKinds().\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"04812fc31c2fab10639256ea6f84a4e8053e2f89","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/git/trees/04812fc31c2fab10639256ea6f84a4e8053e2f89"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/git/commits/51fa3eda02f0dce733cde74a9a7be4824aef4755","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/commit/51fa3eda02f0dce733cde74a9a7be4824aef4755","node_id":"C_kwDOTl6iztoAKDUxZmEzZWRhMDJmMGRjZTczM2NkZTc0YTlhN2JlNDgyNGFlZjQ3NTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/commit/2960ed3a2faf600f975517b77338d8a5f6ef5cc2","sha":"2960ed3a2faf600f975517b77338d8a5f6ef5cc2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/commits/2960ed3a2faf600f975