s://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/commits/be156da14af9335e9a547d231ab584edc0ce2bd3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T15:08:44Z","email":"qits@local","name":"qits"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T15:08:44Z","email":"qits@local","name":"qits"},"message":"feat(qits-760): the entity-changes report view and its registration among the standard kinds\n\nQitsEntityChangesReport draws payload v1 (epic Design §5): per unit a status\nchip, the tables/columns/relations added, removed and changed, and the\ndiagrams through QitsMermaidDiagram — a Before/After switch for CHANGED,\nAfter only for ADDED and CURRENT, Before only for REMOVED, UNCHANGED collapsed.\nThe payload''s TS types live in reports.ts; QITS_ENTITY_CHANGES_REPORT_KIND is\nregistered by provideQitsStandardReportKinds().\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f058042fca54eeb8bcac755d979df4c5ef3ae41a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/git/trees/f058042fca54eeb8bcac755d979df4c5ef3ae41a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/git/commits/be156da14af9335e9a547d231ab584edc0ce2bd3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/commit/be156da14af9335e9a547d231ab584edc0ce2bd3","node_id":"C_kwDOTl6iztoAKGJlMTU2ZGExNGFmOTMzNWU5YTU0N2QyMzFhYjU4NGVkYzBjZTJiZDM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/commit/3fbc81f8fbb26a127f57e6bd469151ee8093a151","sha":"3fbc81f8fbb26a127f57e6bd469151ee8093a151","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/commits/3fbc81f8fbb26a127f57e6bd469151ee8093a151"}],"sha":"be156da14af9335e9a547d231ab584edc0ce2bd3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/commits/be156da14af9335e9a547d231ab584edc0ce2bd3"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/commits/3fbc81f8fbb26a127f57e6bd469151ee8093a151/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T15:08:44Z","email":"qits@local","name":"qits"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T15:08:44Z","email":"qits@local","name":"qits"},"message":"feat(qits-760): QitsMermaidDiagram, with mermaid as a runtime dependency\n\nLifts qits-docs-frontend''s renderMermaidBlocks: mermaid is imported lazily\n(QITS_MERMAID_LOADER) only once the component renders, initialised with\nsecurityLevel ''strict'' and the theme from prefers-color-scheme; an undrawable\ndefinition, or a failed load, stays legible as text in a <pre>.\n\nmermaid ^11.17.2 joins the library''s dependencies and allowedNonPeerDependencies,\nand the workspace harness so it resolves for build and test.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"43180edb357d6e4bc3d34ad36719c0ea42714528","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/git/trees/43180edb357d6e4bc3d34ad36719c0ea42714528"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/git/commits/3fbc81f8fbb26a127f57e6bd469151ee8093a151","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/commit/3fbc81f8fbb26a127f57e6bd469151ee8093a151","node_id":"C_kwDOTl6iztoAKDNmYmM4MWY4ZmJiMjZhMTI3ZjU3ZTZiZDQ2OTE1MWVlODA5M2ExNTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/commit/c67e7841501018f35ac3bdb72482d5ecd2247b52","sha":"c67e7841501018f35ac3bdb72482d5ecd2247b52","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/commits/c67e7841501018f35ac3bdb72482d5ecd2247b52"}],"sha":"3fbc81f8fbb26a127f57e6bd469151ee8093a151","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/commits/3fbc81f8fbb26a127f57e6bd469151ee8093a151"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/commits/c67e7841501018f35ac3bdb72482d5ecd2247b52/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T13:16:36Z","email":"qits-projects@qits.internal","name":"qits-projects"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T13:16:36Z","email":"qits-projects@qits.internal","name":"qits-projects"},"message":"release(2026.1007.131636): qits-759 (qits-1020): QitsContractsReport, contractChanges and the contracts kind among the standard report kinds","tree":{"sha":"9704aa71c0ea302d492677eabdd6a44d116cd047","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/git/trees/9704aa71c0ea302d492677eabdd6a44d116cd047"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/git/commits/c67e7841501018f35ac3bdb72482d5ecd2247b52","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/commit/c67e7841501018f35ac3bdb72482d5ecd2247b52","node_id":"C_kwDOTl6iztoAKGM2N2U3ODQxNTAxMDE4ZjM1YWMzYmRiNzI0ODJkNWVjZDIyNDdiNTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/commit/5328d05372c1b9309462657dcecdfc8dfe5d61d2","sha":"5328d05372c1b9309462657dcecdfc8dfe5d61d2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/commits/5328d05372c1b9309462657dcecdfc8dfe5d61d2"}],"sha":"c67e7841501018f35ac3bdb72482d5ecd2247b52","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/commits/c67e7841501018f35ac3bdb72482d5ecd2247b52"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/commits/5328d05372c1b9309462657dcecdfc8dfe5d61d2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T13:14:50Z","email":"qits-projects@qits.internal","name":"qits-projects"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T13:14:50Z","email":"qits-projects@qits.internal","name":"qits-projects"},"message":"Release request 2f9e8f1f-ed48-4e74-8f1c-f2a60323d71c: qits-759 (qits-1020): QitsContractsReport, contractChanges and the contracts kind among the standard report kinds","tree":{"sha":"143f60f8f403585d84ac93db5832268243aa41e8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/git/trees/143f60f8f403585d84ac93db5832268243aa41e8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/git/commits/5328d05372c1b9309462657dcecdfc8dfe5d61d2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/commit/5328d05372c1b9309462657dcecdfc8dfe5d61d2","node_id":"C_kwDOTl6iztoAKDUzMjhkMDUzNzJjMWI5MzA5NDYyNjU3ZGNlY2RmYzhkZmU1ZDYxZDI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/commit/e3bb99c846e8809282472210fcc0b4c4f21eb77a","sha":"e3bb99c846e8809282472210fcc0b4c4f21eb77a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/commits/e3bb99c846e8809282472210fcc0b4c4f21eb77a"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/commit/3ed4f5c51873992eeb6b8ea16735a441d7c4d5ba","sha":"3ed4f5c51873992eeb6b8ea16735a441d7c4d5ba","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/commits/3ed4f5c51873992eeb6b8ea16735a441d7c4d5ba"}],"sha":"5328d05372c1b9309462657dcecdfc8dfe5d61d2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/commits/5328d05372c1b9309462657dcecdfc8dfe5d61d2"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/commits/3ed4f5c51873992eeb6b8ea16735a441d7c4d5ba/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T13:12:04Z","email":"qits@local","name":"qits"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T13:12:04Z","email":"qits@local","name":"qits"},"message":"feat(qits-759): the contracts view asserts the CLI''s shared diff fixtures\n\nReplaces the interim fixtures with qits-platform-access-cli''s shared set,\ncopied byte-identical from 7cdb6bc2ee9159e51bf7886fe990df6493d8c175\n(platform-access-commands/src/test/resources/report/contracts/diff/): the main\ncase and provider-side-absent/. contractChanges deep-equals changes.json for\nboth; the view specs and stories follow the new data, and the second case is a\nstory of its own (provider side not reported in the baseline: nothing new).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"077bdbc440989086d585a0731046ed8cd1d61985","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/git/trees/077bdbc440989086d585a0731046ed8cd1d61985"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/git/commits/3ed4f5c51873992eeb6b8ea16735a441d7c4d5ba","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/commit/3ed4f5c51873992eeb6b8ea16735a441d7c4d5ba","node_id":"C_kwDOTl6iztoAKDNlZDRmNWM1MTg3Mzk5MmVlYjZiOGVhMTY3MzVhNDQxZDdjNGQ1YmE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/commit/9800ad4eead9efa5254c053fbfefd2f3a964b13b","sha":"9800ad4eead9efa5254c053fbfefd2f3a964b13b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/commits/9800ad4eead9efa5254c053fbfefd2f3a964b13b"}],"sha":"3ed4f5c51873992eeb6b8ea16735a441d7c4d5ba","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/commits/3ed4f5c51873992eeb6b8ea16735a441d7c4d5ba"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/commits/9800ad4eead9efa5254c053fbfefd2f3a964b13b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T12:52:22Z","email":"qits@local","name":"qits"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T12:52:22Z","email":"qits@local","name":"qits"},"message":"feat(qits-759): the contracts report view, contractChanges and the contracts registration\n\nQitsContractsReport draws the `contracts` kind (payload v1): New (pairs with\ntheir role, provider states, interactions by pair), Removed (muted, a removed\nstate in the warning tone, hidden when empty), Changed (contentHash moved), and\nthe inventory collapsed, pacts expandable, failed verification in danger.\ncontractChanges is the pure browser half of the CLI''s identity rules; a side\neither report did not read is never compared, and no baseline is null.\n\nRegistered as QITS_CONTRACTS_REPORT_KIND (contracts v1, \"Contracts\") in\nprovideQitsStandardReportKinds(), so <qits-run-reports> draws it with no page\nchange. The payload type is QitsContractsPayload: the component holds the\nQitsContractsReport name.\n\nThe diff fixtures under fixtures/contracts/diff/ are INTERIM, written to the\nshape file until qits-platform-access-cli commits its shared set.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"657b4c2ec3098f96233eda47af5505aff9d02756","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/git/trees/657b4c2ec3098f96233eda47af5505aff9d02756"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/git/commits/9800ad4eead9efa5254c053fbfefd2f3a964b13b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/commit/9800ad4eead9efa5254c053fbfefd2f3a964b13b","node_id":"C_kwDOTl6iztoAKDk4MDBhZDRlZWFkOWVmYTUyNTRjMDUzZmJmZWZkMmYzYTk2NGIxM2I","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/commit/dc6f1d50424d5f84e104f48d6f556f5f959ccdbc","sha":"dc6f1d50424d5f84e104f48d6f556f5f959ccdbc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/commits/dc6f1d50424d5f84e104f48d6f556f5f959ccdbc"}],"sha":"9800ad4eead9efa5254c053fbfefd2f3a964b13b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/commits/9800ad4eead9efa5254c053fbfefd2f3a964b13b"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/commits/e3bb99c846e8809282472210fcc0b4c4f21eb77a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T12:49:00Z","email":"qits-projects@qits.internal","name":"qits-projects"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T12:49:00Z","email":"qits-projects@qits.internal","name":"qits-projects"},"message":"release(2026.1007.124900): qits-755 fix: the code preview resolves its repository where no project is in scope (qits-ci /runs/<id>) or of another project","tree":{"sha":"084a037e42c70a5960080a82e84dfb1aaf58e36a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/git/trees/084a037e42c70a5960080a82e84dfb1aaf58e36a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/git/commits/e3bb99c846e8809282472210fcc0b4c4f21eb77a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/commit/e3bb99c846e8809282472210fcc0b4c4f21eb77a","node_id":"C_kwDOTl6iztoAKGUzYmI5OWM4NDZlODgwOTI4MjQ3MjIxMGZjYzBiNGM0ZjIxZWI3N2E","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/commit/819fd19280f2dc68a3f989b08dfa96f9e620834d","sha":"819fd19280f2dc68a3f989b08dfa96f9e620834d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/commits/819fd19280f2dc68a3f989b08dfa96f9e620834d"}],"sha":"e3bb99c846e8809282472210fcc0b4c4f21eb77a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/commits/e3bb99c846e8809282472210fcc0b4c4f21eb77a"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/commits/819fd19280f2dc68a3f989b08dfa96f9e620834d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T12:45:58Z","email":"qits@local","name":"qits"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T12:45:58Z","email":"qits@local","name":"qits"},"message":"fix(qits-755): resolve the code preview''s repository where no project is in scope\n\nQitsCodePreview resolved the failure''s repository only through QITS_REPOSITORIES,\nwhich lists the project in scope and asks nothing when none is - so on qits-ci''s\n/runs/<id> the preview waited for ever. Where the scoped listing does not cover\nthe failure''s project, it now resolves through QitsProjectRepositoryLookup: the\nsame qits-projects door and mapping, one request per project for the app''s life\n(a failed read is not kept), registered with PendingTasks. A failure naming no\nproject on a page with none in scope says it cannot be resolved here.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7278441706c240323e88b53f8f40be898bec9172","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/git/trees/7278441706c240323e88b53f8f40be898bec9172"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/git/commits/819fd19280f2dc68a3f989b08dfa96f9e620834d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/commit/819fd19280f2dc68a3f989b08dfa96f9e620834d","node_id":"C_kwDOTl6iztoAKDgxOWZkMTkyODBmMmRjNjhhM2Y5ODliMDhkZmE5NmY5ZTYyMDgzNGQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/commit/dc6f1d50424d5f84e104f48d6f556f5f959ccdbc","sha":"dc6f1d50424d5f84e104f48d6f556f5f959ccdbc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/commits/dc6f1d50424d5f84e104f48d6f556f5f959ccdbc"}],"sha":"819fd19280f2dc68a3f989b08dfa96f9e620834d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/commits/819fd19280f2dc68a3f989b08dfa96f9e620834d"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/commits/dc6f1d50424d5f84e104f48d6f556f5f959ccdbc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T12:12:11Z","email":"qits-projects@qits.internal","name":"qits-projects"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T12:12:11Z","email":"qits-projects@qits.internal","name":"qits-projects"},"message":"release(2026.1007.121211): qits-755 (qits-1012): failure classifier, insight/action registries, Java/TS highlighting, <qits-code-excerpt> and the test-code preview","tree":{"sha":"e264dbf291008096b6d44c1c75acfcd9e569a866","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/git/trees/e264dbf291008096b6d44c1c75acfcd9e569a866"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/git/commits/dc6f1d50424d5f84e104f48d6f556f5f959ccdbc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/commit/dc6f1d50424d5f84e104f48d6f556f5f959ccdbc","node_id":"C_kwDOTl6iztoAKGRjNmYxZDUwNDI0ZDVmODRlMTA0ZjQ4ZDZmNTU2ZjVmOTU5Y2NkYmM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/commit/8d2de64ce296e716f971141a3e25d80db5842173","sha":"8d2de64ce296e716f971141a3e25d80db5842173","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/commits/8d2de64ce296e716f971141a3e25d80db5842173"}],"sha":"dc6f1d50424d5f84e104f48d6f556f5f959ccdbc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/commits/dc6f1d50424d5f84e104f48d6f556f5f959ccdbc"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/commits/8d2de64ce296e716f971141a3e25d80db5842173/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T12:01:20Z","email":"qits@local","name":"qits"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T12:01:20Z","email":"qits@local","name":"qits"},"message":"feat(qits-755): failure insights and the test-code preview\n\nAn opened failure in the test-results view now draws <qits-failure-insights>:\nthe failure is classified (StandardFailureClassifier: java under\nsurefire/failsafe, typescript/javascript under vitest), and every insight\nregistered for its kind is drawn under its title. The first insight is the\ncode preview: the failing test''s lines read once per (repository, commit,\npath) from qits-githost''s own origin, highlighted by hand-written Java and\nTypeScript lexers, with a link to the same lines on the githost Code page.\nEvery way short of the excerpt is one muted line.\n\nqits-990''s QITS_TEST_FAILURE_PREVIEW slot now defaults to the insight area\nand also hands over the whole failure, narrowed to the inputs a preview\ndeclares so a coordinates-only preview keeps working.\n\nQITS_FAILURE_ACTIONS is kept in the design and ships empty.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"08009fbd677f0109d3d1e41451aaa53cf70f7170","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/git/trees/08009fbd677f0109d3d1e41451aaa53cf70f7170"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/git/commits/8d2de64ce296e716f971141a3e25d80db5842173","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/commit/8d2de64ce296e716f971141a3e25d80db5842173","node_id":"C_kwDOTl6iztoAKDhkMmRlNjRjZTI5NmU3MTZmOTcxMTQxYTNlMjVkODBkYjU4NDIxNzM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/commit/a04da70a7f2f705a9ca12d16e6efffbb9c8e7647","sha":"a04da70a7f2f705a9ca12d16e6efffbb9c8e7647","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/commits/a04da70a7f2f705a9ca12d16e6efffbb9c8e7647"}],"sha":"8d2de64ce296e716f971141a3e25d80db5842173","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/commits/8d2de64ce296e716f971141a3e25d80db5842173"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/commits/a04da70a7f2f705a9ca12d16e6efffbb9c8e7647/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T20:12:16Z","email":"qits-projects@qits.internal","name":"qits-projects"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T20:12:16Z","email":"qits-projects@qits.internal","name":"qits-projects"},"message":"release(2026.1006.201216): qits-754 (qits-990): release report kind registry, <qits-run-reports>, test-results and coverage views","tree":{"sha":"43672361c8150813cdd885462abdc520adc8e1da","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/git/trees/43672361c8150813cdd885462abdc520adc8e1da"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/git/commits/a04da70a7f2f705a9ca12d16e6efffbb9c8e7647","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/commit/a04da70a7f2f705a9ca12d16e6efffbb9c8e7647","node_id":"C_kwDOTl6iztoAKGEwNGRhNzBhN2YyZjcwNWE5Y2ExMmQxNmU2ZWZmZmJiOWM4ZTc2NDc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/commit/9ed568d5a1c62fea448c7b3a2be10de3c46b3c60","sha":"9ed568d5a1c62fea448c7b3a2be10de3c46b3c60","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/commits/9ed568d5a1c62fea448c7b3a2be10de3c46b3c60"}],"sha":"a04da70a7f2f705a9ca12d16e6efffbb9c8e7647","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/commits/a04da70a7f2f705a9ca12d16e6efffbb9c8e7647"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/commits/9ed568d5a1c62fea448c7b3a2be10de3c46b3c60/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T20:07:51Z","email":"qits@local","name":"qits"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T20:07:51Z","email":"qits@local","name":"qits"},"message":"feat(qits-754): report kind registry, <qits-run-reports>, test-results and coverage views\n\nqits-990. QITS_REPORT_KINDS (multi) filled by provideQitsReportKind;\nprovideQitsStandardReportKinds registers test-results v1 and coverage v1.\nQitsReportsClient does the four reads on qits-ci''s own origin\n(QitsAppLinks.apiOrigin(''qits-ci''), withCredentials), waiting for the\nnavigation like provideQitsBuilds.\n\n<qits-run-reports [runId]> reads summaries only when runId changes\n(reload() for the host), draws every highlight, one collapsible section per\nreport, fetches payload + same-kind baseline report on open and renders the\nregistered component via NgComponentOutlet (report/baseline/context).\nUnregistered kinds/versions fall back to highlights; no reports reads\n\"Not reported.\"; read failures are one muted line.\n\nThe test-results view exposes qits-755''s seam as the failureOpened output\n(coordinates) and the QITS_TEST_FAILURE_PREVIEW token. Stories (fake\nclient) and vitest specs included.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0d7659deaf1281fda8824d18c35e7ac73652133d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/git/trees/0d7659deaf1281fda8824d18c35e7ac73652133d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/git/commits/9ed568d5a1c62fea448c7b3a2be10de3c46b3c60","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/commit/9ed568d5a1c62fea448c7b3a2be10de3c46b3c60","node_id":"C_kwDOTl6iztoAKDllZDU2OGQ1YTFjNjJmZWE0NDhjN2IzYTJiZTEwZGUzYzQ2YjNjNjA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/commit/316768ba31438170bb45e2c4931705ccb79ccb42","sha":"316768ba31438170bb45e2c4931705ccb79ccb42","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/commits/316768ba31438170bb45e2c4931705ccb79ccb42"}],"sha":"9ed568d5a1c62fea448c7b3a2be10de3c46b3c60","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/commits/9ed568d5a1c62fea448c7b3a2be10de3c46b3c60"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/commits/316768ba31438170bb45e2c4931705ccb79ccb42/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-03T05:26:37Z","email":"qits-projects@qits.internal","name":"qits-projects"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-03T05:26:37Z","email":"qits-projects@qits.internal","name":"qits-projects"},"message":"release(2026.1003.52637): qits-731: docs name the public registry hosts