igned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/commit/3bf1c856421f5577b55a8839c28b494b1fd170ce","node_id":"C_kwDOTl6iztoAKDNiZjFjODU2NDIxZjU1NzdiNTVhODgzOWMyOGI0OTRiMWZkMTcwY2U","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/commit/892adf3e532619de1747a501d48411b4aea1a1e6","sha":"892adf3e532619de1747a501d48411b4aea1a1e6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/commits/892adf3e532619de1747a501d48411b4aea1a1e6"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/commit/42211526aa859a6b78b0ec6bbbef1cc35acecb74","sha":"42211526aa859a6b78b0ec6bbbef1cc35acecb74","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/commits/42211526aa859a6b78b0ec6bbbef1cc35acecb74"}],"sha":"3bf1c856421f5577b55a8839c28b494b1fd170ce","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/commits/3bf1c856421f5577b55a8839c28b494b1fd170ce"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/commits/42211526aa859a6b78b0ec6bbbef1cc35acecb74/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-30T13:24:06Z","email":"git@wohlben.de","name":"wohlben"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-30T13:24:06Z","email":"git@wohlben.de","name":"wohlben"},"message":"Name the new identity in the release trigger: qits-ui-components-jslib\n\nThis repository is about to be renamed qits-ui-components-jslib. The release\npipeline now selects the tag by repoName under the new name.\n\nThe old `repoId: qits-spa-ui-components` matcher was dead: since the identity\ncutover the git host''s coordinate is a UUID, so a name match on repoId never\nfired and neither the tarball nor the docs were published on a release.\n`repoName` carries the public name the push was addressed with.\n\nThe package name, the Angular project and the dist path are unchanged — only the\nrepository is renamed.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_017wrutnFNE1yHpe6cBVYn5Q","tree":{"sha":"57647b89c1cdc21d29626a9a42a9b70dcfb5ff8b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/git/trees/57647b89c1cdc21d29626a9a42a9b70dcfb5ff8b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/git/commits/42211526aa859a6b78b0ec6bbbef1cc35acecb74","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/commit/42211526aa859a6b78b0ec6bbbef1cc35acecb74","node_id":"C_kwDOTl6iztoAKDQyMjExNTI2YWE4NTlhNmI3OGIwZWM2YmJiZWYxY2MzNWFjZWNiNzQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/commit/892adf3e532619de1747a501d48411b4aea1a1e6","sha":"892adf3e532619de1747a501d48411b4aea1a1e6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/commits/892adf3e532619de1747a501d48411b4aea1a1e6"}],"sha":"42211526aa859a6b78b0ec6bbbef1cc35acecb74","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/commits/42211526aa859a6b78b0ec6bbbef1cc35acecb74"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/commits/892adf3e532619de1747a501d48411b4aea1a1e6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-30T08:19:42Z","email":"qits@local","name":"qits"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-30T08:19:42Z","email":"qits@local","name":"qits"},"message":"release(2026.830.81942): Sidebar grouped by component; component-form addresses beside the category form\n\nIntegrates workspace branch `wrapper-reorg-p1`.","tree":{"sha":"fd36d75673d87cb49d6fcf64c3cec576e97e7ff7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/git/trees/fd36d75673d87cb49d6fcf64c3cec576e97e7ff7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/git/commits/892adf3e532619de1747a501d48411b4aea1a1e6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/commit/892adf3e532619de1747a501d48411b4aea1a1e6","node_id":"C_kwDOTl6iztoAKDg5MmFkZjNlNTMyNjE5ZGUxNzQ3YTUwMWQ0ODQxMWI0YWVhMWExZTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/commit/8e87a514b6bbfa3130ec3effb552c9df1634f186","sha":"8e87a514b6bbfa3130ec3effb552c9df1634f186","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/commits/8e87a514b6bbfa3130ec3effb552c9df1634f186"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/commit/984eb331232d8e2829b4aa17a6ee5b0e709fd92e","sha":"984eb331232d8e2829b4aa17a6ee5b0e709fd92e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/commits/984eb331232d8e2829b4aa17a6ee5b0e709fd92e"}],"sha":"892adf3e532619de1747a501d48411b4aea1a1e6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/commits/892adf3e532619de1747a501d48411b4aea1a1e6"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/commits/984eb331232d8e2829b4aa17a6ee5b0e709fd92e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-30T07:31:13Z","email":"git@wohlben.de","name":"wohlben"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-30T07:31:13Z","email":"git@wohlben.de","name":"wohlben"},"message":"Group the sidebar by component, and address repositories by it\n\nA repository row now draws under its technical component — the unit a\nservice, its frontend and its daemon share — instead of under one of the\nsix archetype categories. Related repositories sit together, which is the\npoint of the wrapper reorganisation.\n\nThe change is transitional, because the rows carry a component only after\nthe wrapper moves:\n\n- the repository source reads `component` where qits-projects sends one,\n  and treats absent and null alike;\n- a row with no component draws under its archetype category as before, so\n  a platform that has not migrated renders exactly the six groups it always\n  did, a migrated one renders components alone, and a half-migrated one\n  renders both — components first in name order, then the categories that\n  still hold something, in their own order;\n- the address is `/<project>/<component>/<repoName>/…`, and the archetype\n  form keeps resolving. `QitsScope` carries the middle segment as `group`,\n  with `category` set as well where it spells one of the six, so a link\n  built from a literal before components existed spells what it always did.\n\nComponent names are an open set, so the closed-set test cannot prove one:\n`parseScope` takes a `knownComponents` set beside `knownSlugs`, filled from\nthe scoped project''s repositories. A component address therefore settles\nonce that list answers, the way a project address settles on the project\nlist — and it names the same project either way, so nothing re-reads.\n\nThe `<category>.details` slots are untouched: the children under an open\nrepository come from its own archetype, because the slots say which KINDS\nof repository an application has something to say about, which is a\ndifferent question from which component it is part of.","tree":{"sha":"7974c96e512113315d82237b9e966d40ef263855","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/git/trees/7974c96e512113315d82237b9e966d40ef263855"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/git/commits/984eb331232d8e2829b4aa17a6ee5b0e709fd92e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/commit/984eb331232d8e2829b4aa17a6ee5b0e709fd92e","node_id":"C_kwDOTl6iztoAKDk4NGViMzMxMjMyZDhlMjgyOWI0YWExN2E2ZWU1YjBlNzA5ZmQ5MmU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/commit/8e87a514b6bbfa3130ec3effb552c9df1634f186","sha":"8e87a514b6bbfa3130ec3effb552c9df1634f186","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/commits/8e87a514b6bbfa3130ec3effb552c9df1634f186"}],"sha":"984eb331232d8e2829b4aa17a6ee5b0e709fd92e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/commits/984eb331232d8e2829b4aa17a6ee5b0e709fd92e"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/commits/8e87a514b6bbfa3130ec3effb552c9df1634f186/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-27T16:05:21Z","email":"qits@local","name":"qits"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-27T16:05:21Z","email":"qits@local","name":"qits"},"message":"release(2026.827.160521): isCurrent: scope root counts without its trailing slash\n\nIntegrates workspace branch `artifacts-user-flows`.","tree":{"sha":"36ffe4054ed2c9dcc4548fd9af188b8c2984d2de","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/git/trees/36ffe4054ed2c9dcc4548fd9af188b8c2984d2de"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/git/commits/8e87a514b6bbfa3130ec3effb552c9df1634f186","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/commit/8e87a514b6bbfa3130ec3effb552c9df1634f186","node_id":"C_kwDOTl6iztoAKDhlODdhNTE0YjZiYmZhMzEzMGVjM2VmZmI1NTJjOWRmMTYzNGYxODY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/commit/51ce8a7709a16b01f7e43625831184b6ab7c3c65","sha":"51ce8a7709a16b01f7e43625831184b6ab7c3c65","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/commits/51ce8a7709a16b01f7e43625831184b6ab7c3c65"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/commit/dcc82eb4a140f633e36b6c5432c63ec8b38c2e19","sha":"dcc82eb4a140f633e36b6c5432c63ec8b38c2e19","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/commits/dcc82eb4a140f633e36b6c5432c63ec8b38c2e19"}],"sha":"8e87a514b6bbfa3130ec3effb552c9df1634f186","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/commits/8e87a514b6bbfa3130ec3effb552c9df1634f186"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/commits/dcc82eb4a140f633e36b6c5432c63ec8b38c2e19/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-27T16:05:20Z","email":"qits@local","name":"qits"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-27T16:05:20Z","email":"qits@local","name":"qits"},"message":"fix(app-links): the scope root is current without its trailing slash\n\nThe router serializes the scope root as /qits/services/qits-ci — one\ncharacter short of the scope path — so the page an entry''s own sidebar row\nopens never counted as current, and the layout rendered the sub-menu\ndetached at the bottom instead of under that row. Both sides of the prefix\ntest are slash-terminated now, which also stops a sibling whose name merely\nextends the asked-for path from reading as inside it.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"77dadb82c13679d450b5b43103ec090f64cf5f45","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/git/trees/77dadb82c13679d450b5b43103ec090f64cf5f45"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/git/commits/dcc82eb4a140f633e36b6c5432c63ec8b38c2e19","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/commit/dcc82eb4a140f633e36b6c5432c63ec8b38c2e19","node_id":"C_kwDOTl6iztoAKGRjYzgyZWI0YTE0MGY2MzNlMzZiNmM1NDMyYzYzZWM4YjM4YzJlMTk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/commit/51ce8a7709a16b01f7e43625831184b6ab7c3c65","sha":"51ce8a7709a16b01f7e43625831184b6ab7c3c65","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/commits/51ce8a7709a16b01f7e43625831184b6ab7c3c65"}],"sha":"dcc82eb4a140f633e36b6c5432c63ec8b38c2e19","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/commits/dcc82eb4a140f633e36b6c5432c63ec8b38c2e19"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/commits/51ce8a7709a16b01f7e43625831184b6ab7c3c65/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-25T05:07:17Z","email":"qits@local","name":"qits"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-25T05:07:17Z","email":"qits@local","name":"qits"},"message":"release(2026.825.50717): Spell an api-docs URL on the application''s own host\n\nIntegrates workspace branch `release/api-docs-host`.","tree":{"sha":"2d529217cb4c5c37a6d7b55df1f908387014cb3d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/git/trees/2d529217cb4c5c37a6d7b55df1f908387014cb3d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/git/commits/51ce8a7709a16b01f7e43625831184b6ab7c3c65","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/commit/51ce8a7709a16b01f7e43625831184b6ab7c3c65","node_id":"C_kwDOTl6iztoAKDUxY2U4YTc3MDlhMTZiMDFmN2U0MzYyNTgzMTE4NGI2YWI3YzNjNjU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/commit/4d46567b264516273749068ab808bcc11400aa7e","sha":"4d46567b264516273749068ab808bcc11400aa7e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/commits/4d46567b264516273749068ab808bcc11400aa7e"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/commit/6023520ac8761290efeda04a989ef6c761046ee9","sha":"6023520ac8761290efeda04a989ef6c761046ee9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/commits/6023520ac8761290efeda04a989ef6c761046ee9"}],"sha":"51ce8a7709a16b01f7e43625831184b6ab7c3c65","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/commits/51ce8a7709a16b01f7e43625831184b6ab7c3c65"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/commits/6023520ac8761290efeda04a989ef6c761046ee9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-25T04:58:36Z","email":"git@wohlben.de","name":"wohlben"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-25T04:58:36Z","email":"git@wohlben.de","name":"wohlben"},"message":"Spell an api-docs URL on the application''s own host\n\nThe environment door stops serving paths: it will redirect / and 404 the\nrest. An api-docs path is one of the application''s own routes, so its own\nhost serves it. An application with no host of its own keeps the\nenvironment origin, which is where an older platform still serves it.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f192c95b0e95173c60380ff3adade45d3d418a2d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/git/trees/f192c95b0e95173c60380ff3adade45d3d418a2d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/git/commits/6023520ac8761290efeda04a989ef6c761046ee9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/commit/6023520ac8761290efeda04a989ef6c761046ee9","node_id":"C_kwDOTl6iztoAKDYwMjM1MjBhYzg3NjEyOTBlZmVkYTA0YTk4OWVmNmM3NjEwNDZlZTk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/commit/cb5c34956e0daf392f5a9ad5266749e4033cee49","sha":"cb5c34956e0daf392f5a9ad5266749e4033cee49","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/commits/cb5c34956e0daf392f5a9ad5266749e4033cee49"}],"sha":"6023520ac8761290efeda04a989ef6c761046ee9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/commits/6023520ac8761290efeda04a989ef6c761046ee9"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/commits/cb5c34956e0daf392f5a9ad5266749e4033cee49/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-24T17:56:09Z","email":"git@wohlben.de","name":"wohlben"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-25T04:57:14Z","email":"git@wohlben.de","name":"wohlben"},"message":"Say how a link reaches the sidebar, and where to change what\n\nThe chain from navigation-entries in a service''s deployments.yml through the\ndeployer, the edge''s /main-navigation and this package''s three reads to the\nrows sidebar() draws, plus what to edit for each kind of change.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7f258d76b12219a1fa533093469f9132c36db3a4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/git/trees/7f258d76b12219a1fa533093469f9132c36db3a4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/git/