","node_id":"C_kwDOTl6iztoAKDRkNDY1NjdiMjY0NTE2MjczNzQ5MDY4YWI4MDhiY2MxMTQwMGFhN2U","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/commit/61feb37f4a691d83d5eadd818c103689e1b3a442","sha":"61feb37f4a691d83d5eadd818c103689e1b3a442","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/commits/61feb37f4a691d83d5eadd818c103689e1b3a442"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/commit/f8201561c7b6e13c6355446437ae25b2b7abd473","sha":"f8201561c7b6e13c6355446437ae25b2b7abd473","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/commits/f8201561c7b6e13c6355446437ae25b2b7abd473"}],"sha":"4d46567b264516273749068ab808bcc11400aa7e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/commits/4d46567b264516273749068ab808bcc11400aa7e"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/commits/f8201561c7b6e13c6355446437ae25b2b7abd473/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-24T20:57:52Z","email":"qits@local","name":"qits"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-24T20:57:52Z","email":"qits@local","name":"qits"},"message":"Carry a subpath per navigation entry and api-docs paths per application\n\nTwo additions from /main-navigation. An entry''s optional subpath is the view\nit opens, appended after the scope the sidebar composes — '''' stays the\napplication''s root, which is what every entry was. The new applications\nobject arrives as tree.apiDocs, and QitsAppLinks.apiDocsUrl composes it\nagainst the environment origin, where /<seg>/q/… is served through every\nhost flip. isCurrent scopes a subpathed entry to its own view, reducing\nexactly to the old test when the subpath is empty.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3f49f994b71103b5314325b4ea17eeb94910e032","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/git/trees/3f49f994b71103b5314325b4ea17eeb94910e032"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/git/commits/f8201561c7b6e13c6355446437ae25b2b7abd473","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/commit/f8201561c7b6e13c6355446437ae25b2b7abd473","node_id":"C_kwDOTl6iztoAKGY4MjAxNTYxYzdiNmUxM2M2MzU1NDQ2NDM3YWUyNWIyYjdhYmQ0NzM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/commit/61feb37f4a691d83d5eadd818c103689e1b3a442","sha":"61feb37f4a691d83d5eadd818c103689e1b3a442","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/commits/61feb37f4a691d83d5eadd818c103689e1b3a442"}],"sha":"f8201561c7b6e13c6355446437ae25b2b7abd473","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/commits/f8201561c7b6e13c6355446437ae25b2b7abd473"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/commits/61feb37f4a691d83d5eadd818c103689e1b3a442/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-24T15:54:25Z","email":"qits@local","name":"qits"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-24T15:54:25Z","email":"qits@local","name":"qits"},"message":"release(2026.824.155425): Pick a project without a trailing slash, and sort the repository rows\n\nIntegrates workspace branch `release/picker-slash-and-sort`.","tree":{"sha":"311f8386f66504622b8b9481e5313c6057df4028","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/git/trees/311f8386f66504622b8b9481e5313c6057df4028"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/git/commits/61feb37f4a691d83d5eadd818c103689e1b3a442","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/commit/61feb37f4a691d83d5eadd818c103689e1b3a442","node_id":"C_kwDOTl6iztoAKDYxZmViMzdmNGE2OTFkODNkNWVhZGQ4MThjMTAzNjg5ZTFiM2E0NDI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/commit/efecb5a29afdacc56b31d1fadb429d2f6bb555ab","sha":"efecb5a29afdacc56b31d1fadb429d2f6bb555ab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/commits/efecb5a29afdacc56b31d1fadb429d2f6bb555ab"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/commit/f305c5821cb1aa42fe01ef62f2d0dc8a74e1d7cf","sha":"f305c5821cb1aa42fe01ef62f2d0dc8a74e1d7cf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/commits/f305c5821cb1aa42fe01ef62f2d0dc8a74e1d7cf"}],"sha":"61feb37f4a691d83d5eadd818c103689e1b3a442","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/commits/61feb37f4a691d83d5eadd818c103689e1b3a442"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/commits/f305c5821cb1aa42fe01ef62f2d0dc8a74e1d7cf/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-24T15:53:48Z","email":"git@wohlben.de","name":"wohlben"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-24T15:53:48Z","email":"git@wohlben.de","name":"wohlben"},"message":"Pick a project without a trailing slash, and sort the repository rows\n\nTwo things the live platform showed.\n\nThe picker navigated to `/<slug>/`, and DefaultUrlSerializer reads that as the\nsegment plus an EMPTY one — so no `:project` route matched and every pick landed\non the app''s `**`. The router''s form loses the slash. Full-document hrefs keep\ntheirs: the browser asks for the path and Location normalises it away before\nanything is matched, so scopePath and href are untouched. `select` is the only\nin-app navigation this library makes.\n\nThe sidebar listed repositories in the order the API answered in. A reader\nscanning a group cannot predict that, so the rows sort by name, blind to case.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"dfa72534bae20d57d3aec5549221c05f76753682","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/git/trees/dfa72534bae20d57d3aec5549221c05f76753682"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/git/commits/f305c5821cb1aa42fe01ef62f2d0dc8a74e1d7cf","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/commit/f305c5821cb1aa42fe01ef62f2d0dc8a74e1d7cf","node_id":"C_kwDOTl6iztoAKGYzMDVjNTgyMWNiMWFhNDJmZTAxZWY2MmYyZDBkYzhhNzRlMWQ3Y2Y","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/commit/efecb5a29afdacc56b31d1fadb429d2f6bb555ab","sha":"efecb5a29afdacc56b31d1fadb429d2f6bb555ab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/commits/efecb5a29afdacc56b31d1fadb429d2f6bb555ab"}],"sha":"f305c5821cb1aa42fe01ef62f2d0dc8a74e1d7cf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/commits/f305c5821cb1aa42fe01ef62f2d0dc8a74e1d7cf"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/commits/efecb5a29afdacc56b31d1fadb429d2f6bb555ab/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-24T14:50:30Z","email":"qits@local","name":"qits"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-24T14:50:30Z","email":"qits@local","name":"qits"},"message":"release(2026.824.145030): Nested navigation tree, URL scope, repositories and app links in the chrome\n\nIntegrates workspace branch `release/nested-navigation`.","tree":{"sha":"eb46ade748457b4e25c765f58a9c29ce1a0dbb4a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/git/trees/eb46ade748457b4e25c765f58a9c29ce1a0dbb4a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/git/commits/efecb5a29afdacc56b31d1fadb429d2f6bb555ab","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/commit/efecb5a29afdacc56b31d1fadb429d2f6bb555ab","node_id":"C_kwDOTl6iztoAKGVmZWNiNWEyOWFmZGFjYzU2YjMxZDFmYWRiNDI5ZDJmNmJiNTU1YWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/commit/ba53c95cf80def5a86aadca47a311326e5c664c1","sha":"ba53c95cf80def5a86aadca47a311326e5c664c1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/commits/ba53c95cf80def5a86aadca47a311326e5c664c1"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/commit/dcc851e0e0cce72ce400d72831b2bb0089c05028","sha":"dcc851e0e0cce72ce400d72831b2bb0089c05028","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/commits/dcc851e0e0cce72ce400d72831b2bb0089c05028"}],"sha":"efecb5a29afdacc56b31d1fadb429d2f6bb555ab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/commits/efecb5a29afdacc56b31d1fadb429d2f6bb555ab"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/commits/dcc851e0e0cce72ce400d72831b2bb0089c05028/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-24T14:49:12Z","email":"git@wohlben.de","name":"wohlben"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-24T14:49:12Z","email":"git@wohlben.de","name":"wohlben"},"message":"Draw an application that has no host of its own yet\n\nEvery slot entry now carries `path`, the segment the application answers on,\nso the chrome can address one the edge does not serve on a host yet: the\nenvironment origin plus that segment. Dropping such entries was the honest\nanswer while nothing said where they were; with the platform saying it, leaving\nthem out would hide half the platform for the length of the rollout.\n\nThe scope is dropped for those links, because an unflipped application has no\nscoped address and spelling one would 404. Under a repository that makes the\nrow a link to the application''s front page, so it is drawn but never marked as\nthe page on screen. Everywhere else it is current the ordinary way: on the\nenvironment origin, under its own segment.\n\n`href`''s `legacyFallback` stays for an application the platform names in no\nentry at all; an entry''s own path wins over it.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b0dd00d801925074cdab564c8d6f8b9fde5a058d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/git/trees/b0dd00d801925074cdab564c8d6f8b9fde5a058d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/git/commits/dcc851e0e0cce72ce400d72831b2bb0089c05028","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/commit/dcc851e0e0cce72ce400d72831b2bb0089c05028","node_id":"C_kwDOTl6iztoAKGRjYzg1MWUwZTBjY2U3MmNlNDAwZDcyODMxYjJiYjAwODljMDUwMjg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/commit/dd26b4a4c4e153bdc49f29ec16c83d643b436b41","sha":"dd26b4a4c4e153bdc49f29ec16c83d643b436b41","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/commits/dd26b4a4c4e153bdc49f29ec16c83d643b436b41"}],"sha":"dcc851e0e0cce72ce400d72831b2bb0089c05028","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/commits/dcc851e0e0cce72ce400d72831b2bb0089c05028"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/commits/dd26b4a4c4e153bdc49f29ec16c83d643b436b41/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-24T14:42:19Z","email":"git@wohlben.de","name":"wohlben"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-24T14:42:19Z","email":"git@wohlben.de","name":"wohlben"},"message":"Make the chrome a tree of what the address says is in scope\n\nEvery service becomes its own host, and every SPA under it shares one URL\ngrammar: /<project>/<category>/<repository>/…. A flat list of front doors\ncannot say anything about that, so the sidebar becomes a tree the platform\nstill owns: the edge serves entries in slots, and the layout files them under\nthe project, its repositories by group, and the repository in scope.\n\nThe scope now comes from the URL alone. `?project=` was a second spelling of a\nfact the path can carry, and it made the same address render differently for\ntwo people. `parseScope` reads segment one as a project only when segment two\nis a category or the project list names the slug, so every SPA keeps its own\ntop-level routes.\n\nBreaking: QITS_PROJECT_SCOPE, QueryParamProjectScope and QitsNavigationSource\n.links are gone. A consumer provides `provideQitsScope(routing)`, and the\nnavigation source answers a QitsNavTree. The flat {links} shape still renders\nexactly as before, which is the one release the two payloads overlap for.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"48ac04f78815ae88d7b8bda72580ffbb070c0a95","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/git/trees/48ac04f78815ae88d7b8bda72580ffbb070c0a95"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/git/commits/dd26b4a4c4e153bdc49f29ec16c83d643b436b41","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/commit/dd26b4a4c4e153bdc49f29ec16c83d643b436b41","node_id":"C_kwDOTl6iztoAKGRkMjZiNGE0YzRlMTUzYmRjNDlmMjllYzE2YzgzZDY0M2I0MzZiNDE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/commit/ba53c95cf80def5a86aadca47a311326e5c664c1","sha":"ba53c95cf80def5a86aadca47a311326e5c664c1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/commits/ba53c95cf80def5a86aadca47a311326e5c664c1"}],"sha":"dd26b4a4c4e153bdc49f29ec16c83d643b436b41","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/commits/dd26b4a4c4e153bdc49f29ec16c83d643b436b41"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/commits/ba53c95cf80def5a86aadca47a311326e5c664c1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-23T06:02:05Z","email":"qits@local","name":"qits"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-23T06:02:05Z","email":"qits@local","name":"qits"},"message":"release(2026.823.60205): Hoist the project picker into the layout brand slot\n\nIntegrates workspace branch `adhoc-changes2`.","tree":{"sha":"f00595512ffc0833128a1f93836bcb33cb734714","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/git/trees/f00595512ffc0833128a1f93836bcb33cb734714"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/git/commits/ba53c95cf80def5a86aadca47a311326e5c664c1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/commit/ba53c95cf80def5a86aadca47a311326e5c664c1","node_id":"C_kwDOTl6iztoAKGJhNTNjOTVjZjgwZGVmNWE4NmFhZGNhNDdhMzExMzI2ZTVjNjY0YzE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/commit/080babb7f2493973e3f2dfd63d84f19344d0f01a","sha":"080babb7f2493973e3f2dfd63d84f19344d0f01a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/commits/080babb7f2493973e3f2dfd63d84f19344d0f01a"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/commit/e4c3931a4a819d8db2158e4652831a158eca0b56","sha":"e4c3931a4a819d8db2158e4652831a158eca0b56","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/commits/e4c3931a4a819d8db2158e4652831a158eca0b56"}],"sha":"ba53c95cf80def5a86aadca47a311326e5c664c1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/commits/ba53c95cf80def5a86aadca47a311326e5c664c1"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/commits/e4c3931a4a819d8db2158e4652831a158eca0b56/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-23T06:01:08Z","email":"qits@local","name":"qits"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-23T06:01:08Z","email":"qits@local","name":"qits"},"message":"Hoist the project picker into the layout''s brand slot\n\nThe top-left slot of QitsMainLayout now renders the project picker when an\napp wires QITS_PROJECTS (provideQitsProjects) and QITS_PROJECT_SCOPE; it\nfalls back to the plain brand when unwired. The default QueryParamProjectScope\ncarries a pick in ?project= on the current page.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f9b4fa8e84205c3e1a78d951a2f3cf56f2102c65","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/git/trees/f9b4fa8e84205c3e1a78d951a2f3cf56f2102c65"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/git/commits/e4c3931a4a819d8db2158e4652831a158eca0b56","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/commit/e4c3931a4a819d8db2158e4652831a158eca0b56","node_id":"C_kwDOTl6iztoAKGU0YzM5MzFhNGE4MTlkOGRiMjE1OGU0NjUyODMxYTE1OGVjYTBiNTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/commit/080babb7f2493973e3f2dfd63d84f19344d0f01a","sha":"080babb7f2493973e3f2dfd63d84f19344d0f01a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/commits/080babb7f2493973e3f2dfd63d84f19344d0f01a"}],"sha":"e4c3931a4a819d8db2158e4652831a158eca0b56","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/commits/e4c3931a4a819d8db2158e4652831a158eca0b56"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/commits/080babb7f2493973e3f2dfd63d84f19344d0f01a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-12T15:37:42Z","email":"git@wohlben.de","name":"wohlben"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-12T15:37:42Z","email":"git@wohlben.de","name":"wohlben"},"message":"Release off the tag, so a replay restores this library\n\n`ci-event-release.yml` selects `SCMPublishTag` instead of `SCMRelease`. The tag\nis the release stamp that outlives the event log, the run rows and the\nregistry, so a bootstrap replay re-establishes this release by pushing the tag\nalone — where it used to need a synthetic `SCMRelease` fabricated through ci''s\nmanual trigger door.\n\nThe version comes off `tagName` and is shape-checked before the build: no\nrelease flow vets a tag, and the string becomes both the npm coordinate and the\ndocs URL.\n\n`artifacts:` is untouched, so the two declared entries still drive the\nannouncement. A real release publishes `SCMRelease` beside the tag and that is\nwhat qits-ci joins with a green run; a replay publishes silently and wakes no\ntrain.\n\nThe push pipeline''s cross-reference and the README paragraph follow the same\ncorrection.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_012jpcqUBppVGPQVfgX6jQmG","tree":{"sha":"19e0ba9e4bf06f39cdc0b4efa48ba35afd4add5f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/git/trees/19e0ba9e4bf06f39cdc0b4efa48ba35afd4add5f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/git/commits/080babb7f2493973e3f2dfd63d84f19344d0f01a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/commit/080babb7f2493973e3f2dfd63d84f19344d0f01a","node_id":"C_kwDOTl6iztoAKDA4MGJhYmI3ZjI0OTM5NzNlM2YyZGZkNjNkODRmMTkzNDRkMGYwMWE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/commit/81eadf8129e2cff0aced7c62f9a003be08a2efad","sha":"81eadf8129e2cff0aced7c62f9a003be08a2efad","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/commits/81eadf8129e2cff0aced7c62f9a003be08a2efad"}],"sha":"080babb7f2493973e3f2dfd63d84f19344d0f01a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/commits/080babb7f2493973e3f2dfd63d84f19344d0f01a"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/commits/81eadf8129e2cff0aced7c62f9a003be08a2efad/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-10T20:14:09Z","email":"git@wohlben.de","name":"wohlben"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-10T20:14:09Z","email":"git@wohlben.de","name":"wohlben"},"message":"Point the install notes at the mirror on 8082\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"15c09b7a6f7c1dd9a5d56603e051f442de346155","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/git/trees/15c09b7a6f7c1dd9a5d56603e051f442de346155"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/git/commits/81eadf8129e2cff0aced7c62f9a003be08a2efad","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/commit/81eadf8129e2cff0aced7c62f9a003be08a2efad","node_id":"C_kwDOTl6iztoAKDgxZWFkZjgxMjllMmNmZjBhY2VkN2M2MmY5YTAwM2JlMDhhMmVmYWQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/commit/763727634ed6e2258c87354f85bd281ccbd845d1","sha":"763727634ed6e2258c87354f85bd281ccbd845d1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/commits/763727634ed6e2258c87354f85bd281ccbd845d1"}],"sha":"81eadf8129e2cff0aced7c62f9a003be08a2efad","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/commits/81eadf8129e2cff0aced7c62f9a003be08a2efad"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/commits/763727634ed6e2258c87354f85bd281ccbd845d1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-08T12:30:29Z","email":"git@wohlben.de","name":"wohlben"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-08T12:30:29Z","email":"git@wohlben.de","name":"wohlben"},"message":"Name the store by its new wire alias\n\nThe artifact store answers to qits-platform-artifacts. Only comments named\nit — the registry origins come from injected environment — so nothing this\npipeline runs changes.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b2061d84976498612934d9b52291a3ef639b7ba9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/git/trees/b2061d84976498612934d9b52291a3ef639b7ba9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuicklyIterateTheSoftware/qits-ui-components-jslib/git/commits/763727634ed6e2258c87354f85bd281ccbd84