:false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndrejK666/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndrejK666/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndrejK666","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/studio-web/commits/53dbe0690c218390152679eef66828fe4610c919/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T22:10:04Z","email":"Andrej.Kuchma@constructor.tech","name":"ANDREI KUCHMA"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T22:10:04Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"test(spec-quality): pin what Studio''s findings in the editor rest on (#603)\n\nBackend: what AnalyzeBatchTask::record writes through the two hub ports\nfor purpose, leak and bloat (duplicates edges only between binding\nsubjects), that a refusal records pending, which documents a sync\nanalyses (changed, never-analysed, cap, not configured), and what\nrecord_subjects maps paths to.\n\nTheia: a bounded-refresh guard on setStudioFindings -> refreshQuality,\nstudio-quality edge cases, and three showInEditor cases. Prototype:\nold verdicts, mixed kinds and unknown rule labels in spec-findings.\n\nTests only; the two test-only hooks (TaskContext::for_tests,\nspec_quality::set_configured_for_tests) are cfg(test).\n\nSigned-off-by: Andrej Kuchma <Andrej.Kuchma@constructor.tech>","tree":{"sha":"8f56f05aa230963f823a92ca3ce5396309d9fa82","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/studio-web/git/trees/8f56f05aa230963f823a92ca3ce5396309d9fa82"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/studio-web/git/commits/53dbe0690c218390152679eef66828fe4610c919","verification":{"payload":"tree 8f56f05aa230963f823a92ca3ce5396309d9fa82\nparent 91a922869063fbd8910cfc4e92e248fbfc38a0bd\nauthor ANDREI KUCHMA <Andrej.Kuchma@constructor.tech> 1790892604 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790892604 +0200\n\ntest(spec-quality): pin what Studio''s findings in the editor rest on (#603)\n\nBackend: what AnalyzeBatchTask::record writes through the two hub ports\nfor purpose, leak and bloat (duplicates edges only between binding\nsubjects), that a refusal records pending, which documents a sync\nanalyses (changed, never-analysed, cap, not configured), and what\nrecord_subjects maps paths to.\n\nTheia: a bounded-refresh guard on setStudioFindings -> refreshQuality,\nstudio-quality edge cases, and three showInEditor cases. Prototype:\nold verdicts, mixed kinds and unknown rule labels in spec-findings.\n\nTests only; the two test-only hooks (TaskContext::for_tests,\nspec_quality::set_configured_for_tests) are cfg(test).\n\nSigned-off-by: Andrej Kuchma <Andrej.Kuchma@constructor.tech>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqvto8CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAmF4QAHEJmzWGib0oKE/lpFT/VLiy\nEf16iBY5PmhA9pjFSFT3MLypjwCEHEFzQrpTHcN4yKchRidYzx5levbGq5euoN3i\njg4txFrHxRLsHXdcIRXuowtR90dqhHvoGxAi90QYVllvwfD3nA7KuHrH8DfkADPK\ndTTgsiCC1/OODpGw8QKAp3+FaCSaLUTFcxHdcXxU6OZRqf/cv8pPrOvUD+FSFJ57\nsflrPoMkwSxWvYRMVgGd/kA9x7gW2TEvBoUUBWSu6lgAc/j8+JoNNEbfcIENxNJL\naFJdjOTsL/UhlW8N6HKNTgm9/5fGkvUUavW2tEppIWUquonYKNI/YwCuHpIeEX/D\nVONJjtkhX6Qhgb8k6PrXgBypypOYtzXaUlrP91eCMkdimGMmiJxY+2j0INQEEeJ9\nN6+XypzPDPFVnMfdXLj9zrOGmWU8/uGp9ruxOp9IzjcTkeoLFLIKsIFmCFw57Hjy\n3KsreosvVBvowqk7qYpaRqZtXpNE2ImU9K17NWyG3qmQf+tGWmigUgBXvUav9vwi\n6I3SnyfihzoyJ17Qu+nFd6GL+ROmvkO1yz/fIGY4XOFB0W3keSy1tjuklhn2a0bE\n7J1yl5h9yhgQfVveZD9alc0tJC7FvGYRGQhjFsZf3+8ReBn6ZhiZtvw2Vcyp7Rn3\nZW8iL+P3Ueh2FAF9tIHe\n=42Zb\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-01T22:10:05Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}",