arred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndrejK666/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndrejK666","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/studio-web/commits/91a922869063fbd8910cfc4e92e248fbfc38a0bd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T21:23:43Z","email":"Andrej.Kuchma@constructor.tech","name":"ANDREI KUCHMA"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T21:23:43Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(deploy): an IDE session gets 4Gi, not 2Gi (#602)\n\nOn dev a studio-web session (two repositories, the Orca runtime, the\nassistants'' plugin hosts) reached 2.03Gi within a minute of starting and\nwas OOM-killed three times in a row (21:05, 21:14, 21:18 UTC on\n2026-10-01), leaving the portal showing an IDE whose backend was gone.\n\nk8s_session_memory_limit is now 4Gi in the k8s profile, overridable with\nSTUDIO_SESSION_MEMORY_LIMIT. The request stays 512Mi, so it costs quota\nheadroom, not scheduling: studio-dev''s quota is 24Gi of limits with 6.4Gi\nused, room for four such sessions.\n\nSigned-off-by: Andrej Kuchma <Andrej.Kuchma@constructor.tech>","tree":{"sha":"83a9c8339e9b7b346b379da8241fd5458c808d3f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/studio-web/git/trees/83a9c8339e9b7b346b379da8241fd5458c808d3f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/studio-web/git/commits/91a922869063fbd8910cfc4e92e248fbfc38a0bd","verification":{"payload":"tree 83a9c8339e9b7b346b379da8241fd5458c808d3f\nparent 69b36f6dbb238f9049eb1cb02005acc52232b245\nauthor ANDREI KUCHMA <Andrej.Kuchma@constructor.tech> 1790889823 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790889823 +0200\n\nfix(deploy): an IDE session gets 4Gi, not 2Gi (#602)\n\nOn dev a studio-web session (two repositories, the Orca runtime, the\nassistants'' plugin hosts) reached 2.03Gi within a minute of starting and\nwas OOM-killed three times in a row (21:05, 21:14, 21:18 UTC on\n2026-10-01), leaving the portal showing an IDE whose backend was gone.\n\nk8s_session_memory_limit is now 4Gi in the k8s profile, overridable with\nSTUDIO_SESSION_MEMORY_LIMIT. The request stays 512Mi, so it costs quota\nheadroom, not scheduling: studio-dev''s quota is 24Gi of limits with 6.4Gi\nused, room for four such sessions.\n\nSigned-off-by: Andrej Kuchma <Andrej.Kuchma@constructor.tech>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqvs9fCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAhBkQAAGqM5s/9E6tftKDvKr9solO\nMIGlyQbpuDwbolTWom77NdSwxE+JG4VHtWeqByVuglDGHutnzZ4wCTMu+5Qiimev\nyj/lUfDHLykIbB8wfzKiXURj3Ct/LE6M1PsRCg+Yg17CTDVVUPdRbFa8LTG2Y4lp\nqynP9WT5NaCkgLtgYcoJ/wesA7iiEui/nMjCXM9dOnA9vzPPBOapRcuoNEJmUl3q\nkRc/NNCp3c6M1TMazXIQnvcpDS9i2U0xcxW6OBNdGcHMFLr9qUDJaAg1GHY/cJEk\nCHok/sZYpP1ZYhtwvmTxkP9Syb/icLYw3RVw21auKCoQzLc3zitjey/HmyDPPnEh\n/Je5AAiv8KR/3UT/uvncNYj01M6noqq88Yo7TCShBR9htP1bc7fIrnXph4bO/54z\n74JcvktlB1QCqfE8zcUzYTnRhM62ximBxP5Vn6nCsArn7oQRZKyX74l1yq90HsO+\nWmZk2hEwaJbuimQL44ifqp6V6pivBgmCuFLTOFfX04vDsXQEiZ7yp11J4yvqVxp5\nT6XmAh/MU+G+nXJt7dTX9+1hWiEpQum04XD0XgUmYdBWIOfhjP1H0YoY+5op6WvQ\nN4oIoChnPQcxSRDVn/R0F80vKkABur61kkDI8Omk/pI9Y9TvoCYwiyJ0RcrKwBhd\nw+FlOvKeFRUGEmSjRFdu\n=7qnF\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-01T21:23:44Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/u