2b245/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T20:08:45Z","email":"Andrej.Kuchma@constructor.tech","name":"ANDREI KUCHMA"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T20:08:45Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(spec-quality): the gate card states Studio''s numbers, and the Quality button clears the window edge (#601)\n\nSeen on dev with Studio''s findings in the editor (constructor-studio.md):\n\n- The rail''s verdict card read \"NaN% of this document reads as DESIGN. The\n  limit is NaN%\": a recorded purpose verdict carried whether the gate passed\n  but not its share or limit. The run now records gate_leak_share and\n  gate_threshold beside gate_passed, studio-quality.js hands them to the\n  report, and the card, given no numbers, says what failed without them.\n- With Quality now the last button in the editor''s top bar, its count badge\n  sat against the window edge: the cluster had -4px on the right to pull the\n  last tile to the bar''s edge. It ends at the bar''s own padding now.\n\nSigned-off-by: Andrej Kuchma <Andrej.Kuchma@constructor.tech>","tree":{"sha":"9acf0cafbbd137d33adb9ec5ffa8c585ee2a596f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/studio-web/git/trees/9acf0cafbbd137d33adb9ec5ffa8c585ee2a596f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/studio-web/git/commits/69b36f6dbb238f9049eb1cb02005acc52232b245","verification":{"payload":"tree 9acf0cafbbd137d33adb9ec5ffa8c585ee2a596f\nparent e918a4345ea8e77f3913353a1f42e0118dc28361\nauthor ANDREI KUCHMA <Andrej.Kuchma@constructor.tech> 1790885325 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790885325 +0200\n\nfix(spec-quality): the gate card states Studio''s numbers, and the Quality button clears the window edge (#601)\n\nSeen on dev with Studio''s findings in the editor (constructor-studio.md):\n\n- The rail''s verdict card read \"NaN% of this document reads as DESIGN. The\n  limit is NaN%\": a recorded purpose verdict carried whether the gate passed\n  but not its share or limit. The run now records gate_leak_share and\n  gate_threshold beside gate_passed, studio-quality.js hands them to the\n  report, and the card, given no numbers, says what failed without them.\n- With Quality now the last button in the editor''s top bar, its count badge\n  sat against the window edge: the cluster had -4px on the right to pull the\n  last tile to the bar''s edge. It ends at the bar''s own padding now.\n\nSigned-off-by: Andrej Kuchma <Andrej.Kuchma@constructor.tech>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqvr3NCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAYOoQAIskkhAa/P2AjBKREpsoTWdN\nA80BQ7FVad7BflHX4mlssiN0cOu3vvLMXs9O/A7iyx69pRfN+bw1YNlq7czyxw9S\nYGc8613UYCMYgkia29VL2QzT/w7k6Se1fbFkCi+wZ1xm44ZAB+fo5TQWazoLig1B\nZYtJwDmjNgMVkzf+B5VuLRSk5iDoxc0epZVg53Ysjo1P5EeUrR1A+R5z/rxChuZ4\nUcbE42u1rbBEj+xuHFPqp6/i+aLgTPqBplP+To1D5izc0ZeNldO+zziisTcCWED2\nfzeG4PwddQ3lZqUEtvzV6x74V6n9jmLDXPXgNRF2ELV+CbK4ic03op4Q5Uhgc7mu\nCuFOXs3MTBKeIlCp5Y1puDSm1zCHtS4Dn5h4WLRasBaa2j/ecZw2cd9bvUS34pUT\nIbP3PKYjln6Kg5lhbgaFxdxy0ELC/gNNDxeOdrd+w2TO1OYX+e3j2tpgwM3nA/ph\n/lSwxdimfy6PmqSb48WhX8jQVQXKv+gmL9piEcQVpPErf1ZQJyisZhZpMDkMT+Av\nyBHPLcK+wIyKzsoi2auC6i1ZvMQyHd+AW/Xw1//lqNod6BCt5f7R2i+9PJIqHKUL\njXI3AXguFNgOh2fpkgIktwGrvwqfvtBf8yTuTqrONCwqODuWny8l6DtIl1lQ7mSp\nmQYGS8iLTPAtO5snrVjB\n=Dhd7\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-01T20:08:46Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"