pi.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/studio-web/commits/e918a4345ea8e77f3913353a1f42e0118dc28361/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T19:43:53Z","email":"Andrej.Kuchma@constructor.tech","name":"ANDREI KUCHMA"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T19:43:53Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(theia): the Quality button is always there, live with findings and greyed out without (#600)\n\nThe editor''s Quality destination came and went: hidden unless a project\nturned on local signals (#599 added \"or Studio has findings\"), which read as\na missing feature rather than as \"nothing to look at\". Now it is drawn on\nevery Markdown document. It is live when the document has findings -\nStudio''s, the rail''s loaded ones, or a project''s local signals - and disabled\nwith \"No findings for this document yet\" otherwise, following the findings as\nthey load.\n\nAlso logs one line per hand-over from the Analyze panel,\n\"[studio] quality: N Studio finding(s) for <file>\", so a grey button can be\ntold apart from findings that never arrived.\n\nSigned-off-by: Andrej Kuchma <Andrej.Kuchma@constructor.tech>","tree":{"sha":"00841cbf39f893e7af19a801864b7e41da780216","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/studio-web/git/trees/00841cbf39f893e7af19a801864b7e41da780216"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/studio-web/git/commits/e918a4345ea8e77f3913353a1f42e0118dc28361","verification":{"payload":"tree 00841cbf39f893e7af19a801864b7e41da780216\nparent 2639a6904a874dce98bd0e3c997fb0ecdde41c09\nauthor ANDREI KUCHMA <Andrej.Kuchma@constructor.tech> 1790883833 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790883833 +0200\n\nfix(theia): the Quality button is always there, live with findings and greyed out without (#600)\n\nThe editor''s Quality destination came and went: hidden unless a project\nturned on local signals (#599 added \"or Studio has findings\"), which read as\na missing feature rather than as \"nothing to look at\". Now it is drawn on\nevery Markdown document. It is live when the document has findings -\nStudio''s, the rail''s loaded ones, or a project''s local signals - and disabled\nwith \"No findings for this document yet\" otherwise, following the findings as\nthey load.\n\nAlso logs one line per hand-over from the Analyze panel,\n\"[studio] quality: N Studio finding(s) for <file>\", so a grey button can be\ntold apart from findings that never arrived.\n\nSigned-off-by: Andrej Kuchma <Andrej.Kuchma@constructor.tech>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqvrf5CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAWJYQAC/MC2SDP4rqPGALBHXOIB1X\nRZgvWTnUuGAjnPF8one1LgqbSSNNFus3HYkzthiGn8lhLYss5gYchjgnabazh50S\n9sY7iMQdXjmh+kJTKKKAeOXfYn1xyUKDV3QEnwgnScne+B2rhTpu0p0Cv3DZQ4Ns\ngpYIvIDPaX/V86tWCpKQ+CBxpacDCpekvln2/GF8qorItcpeuEwpx06AMbJwHWsp\nThZsM4SFNtD3KtSAPaFKouzhkG/6B4nNvHpeIVzMOE9fHng1pz13PHZ0Z2m1Kd5U\ng6A2I4oLCjaT6ioe6shRkWGSZvGomu1pyo8PKqotQ8FIqzaO60aGrw/hiwguJu0q\n4wx1EBNP+5zow+0iWujEfE+FNIKgr9HTBnrOPXzQKz2sE4retz15ydBQcK/431Te\nw1R1ZU26C7kRFqc101MqmX6CMI3QON/rlq1xaQKjmxyzvHm3wVaXqnKA87tIwbMl\n3XBpzrYxcmkAftHb/I2CdRh2/1lkSyPufdKS3gZpV6YwQP0pfyeofX4CwuL/KAxF\nbi7/S8/sLHuSYrSqWrdQnZkypAYTnHA3iIFE/Hbhz3C4QPlwgoj7R1lrzYYA0voO\nMREaJFYDIQ2qUyfd6L304JqeQNkIKdzjfaNM4uGrl4waJ9B3ZsTakW6DTudwYavp\n7FIs32z3WfUyDPbs8nUt\n=R8LU\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-01T19:43:54Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","re