://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/constructorfabric/studio-web/commit/c8f982373b03a3b0ccb17d78923ae6ffbc1f1aa2","node_id":"C_kwDOTl7dJtoAKGM4Zjk4MjM3M2IwM2EzYjBjY2IxN2Q3ODkyM2FlNmZmYmMxZjFhYTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/constructorfabric/studio-web/commit/f6e2b4b3abd6de2bbb661ddde134701658da6c29","sha":"f6e2b4b3abd6de2bbb661ddde134701658da6c29","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/studio-web/commits/f6e2b4b3abd6de2bbb661ddde134701658da6c29"}],"sha":"c8f982373b03a3b0ccb17d78923ae6ffbc1f1aa2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/studio-web/commits/c8f982373b03a3b0ccb17d78923ae6ffbc1f1aa2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/301748190?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndrejK666/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndrejK666/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndrejK666/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndrejK666/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AndrejK666","id":301748190,"login":"AndrejK666","node_id":"U_kgDOEfxP3g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndrejK666/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndrejK666/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndrejK666/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndrejK666/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndrejK666/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndrejK666","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/studio-web/commits/f6e2b4b3abd6de2bbb661ddde134701658da6c29/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T13:25:37Z","email":"Andrej.Kuchma@constructor.tech","name":"ANDREI KUCHMA"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T13:25:37Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(desktop): opening a project no longer restarts the IDE (#580)\n\nAfter signing in and picking a project, the whole window reloaded: panels,\nthe assistants and the plugin host started again. The Studio view, the\nlanding page and `cfstudio://` links opened the project with\n`WorkspaceService.open(folder, { preserveWindow: true })`, which changes the\nworkspace by reloading the frontend (`reloadWindow`).\n\nTheia changes a workspace file''s folders in place -- that is how \"Add Folder\nto Workspace\" works -- so `openProjectInPlace` opens a project as one, with\nTheia''s own API only: `save(<project>.theia-workspace)` beside the project''s\nfolder (in place, no reload; named after the project, so the title bar and\nthe Explorer say its name), then `spliceRoots` to the project''s folder, which\nfires `onWorkspaceChanged`. The landing (already following that event)\ncloses, git, the start pages and the status bar follow the new folder. The\nnext start reopens the file as the most recently used workspace, so the\nmember lands in the project. A recent workspace *file* is still opened by\nTheia''s `open`.\n\nVerified live on the local desktop build: opening a project from the landing\ntook 0.6 s with no reload (a marker on `window` survived and\n`performance.timeOrigin` did not change); the title became \"Shop -\nConstructor Studio\", the landing closed, the status bar showed the project''s\nbranch, the Development start page listed its repository, and\n`Shop.theia-workspace` was written beside the folder.\n\nSigned-off-by: Andrej Kuchma <Andrej.Kuchma@constructor.tech>","tree":{"sha":"ed8cd2d4d88a778a9532bfec6c8dda3498f0efce","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/studio-web/git/trees/ed8cd2d4d88a778a9532bfec6c8dda3498f0efce"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/studio-web/git/commits/f6e2b4b3abd6de2bbb661ddde134701658da6c29","verification":{"payload":"tree ed8cd2d4d88a778a9532bfec6c8dda3498f0efce\nparent f177f1d1cb36485a0207b738f60892374b76aead\nauthor ANDREI KUCHMA <Andrej.Kuchma@constructor.tech> 1790774737 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790774737 +0200\n\nfix(desktop): opening a project no longer restarts the IDE (#580)\n\nAfter signing in and picking a project, the whole window reloaded: panels,\nthe assistants and the plugin host started again. The Studio view, the\nlanding page and `cfstudio://` links opened the project with\n`WorkspaceService.open(folder, { preserveWindow: true })`, which changes the\nworkspace by reloading the frontend (`reloadWindow`).\n\nTheia changes a workspace file''s folders in place -- that is how \"Add Folder\nto Workspace\" works -- so `openProjectInPlace` opens a project as one, with\nTheia''s own API only: `save(<project>.theia-workspace)` beside the project''s\nfolder (in place, no reload; named after the project, so the title bar and\nthe Explorer say its name), then `spliceRoots` to the project''s folder, which\nfires `onWorkspaceChanged`. The landing (already following that event)\ncloses, git, the start pages and the status bar follow the new folder. The\nnext start reopens the file as the most recently used workspace, so the\nmember lands in the project. A recent workspace *file* is still opened by\nTheia''s `open`.\n\nVerified live on the local desktop build: opening a project from the landing\ntook 0.6 s with no reload (a marker on `window` survived and\n`performance.timeOrigin` did not change); the title became \"Shop -\nConstructor Studio\", the landing closed, the status bar showed the project''s\nbranch, the Development start page listed its repository, and\n`Shop.theia-workspace` was written beside the folder.\n\nSigned-off-by: Andrej Kuchma <Andrej.Kuchma@constructor.tech>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqvQ3RCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAZZ8QAE3gPfQWP6b1svfgD7yg+R8e\nV+4t2DLgE4uWqegjYeP12MnBX81jsp7zl0fP6f9Px/eAA0Mk7/qt0yKPHVtYBOx5\npQe5hQhxkY+FWbHNcyCudqw7mmPcnLFfqhY/1yXGjQmns9yapbRw6bHbJ0G0l6AA\nXG6ele5YvA2cgkqvSAKdC1UVDrVoiG2NvkG6ludHJ60FcpL2nOIj/RJQYvQRxpCK\nsaxXaOyVLF+vtrQns74ryxsWsRPNB19Q1fi9DADnBqqguIcs5RW+9P9V9hlK4wIS\n5BqWGCpDDUIcQuP5JfamOvH91hE9+xLGmV/T8QpdjuG6cPq0Udf42oY4WZLTeGIt\nS/ytHQGS3MXbDh/a6p/p8OFQcLsQ931a6iODQQSmycn4XNMwaj3tMmmbLs2XT3Ry\nggNwGpoAINeBcGYY5jyZmjCfq9QbS+7Z8C+Dsl2Ui5CRCOwcLChJC8LWz7s3x+KG\njugQApU9tR6NpotPtmadTm2yUoXIAs+Wl9WM2+py8vOLcet6a6sblNPUlxFgy06t\nP+Snrz1UwXhD9zR3herLsA2dypoy5mhg7teeC6jQcKdxajuFoQHa2nbgd4FeO0pq\nP+FzLGJXS/Ydt1bV9Llbz4XerV+YgtWniIWgm3mXUIof2zZTsyMFubP6px2lonVf\nXKisyUyZn6tOoYRNX955\n=GVl3\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-30T13:25:38Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web