rents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/constructorfabric/studio-web/commit/53c2825a877333af85fe1f03cc3ed3b4f3e87ba0","sha":"53c2825a877333af85fe1f03cc3ed3b4f3e87ba0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/studio-web/commits/53c2825a877333af85fe1f03cc3ed3b4f3e87ba0"}],"sha":"f768552e81ec8a6815d3ae6ed97bf11bc085be6e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/studio-web/commits/f768552e81ec8a6815d3ae6ed97bf11bc085be6e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/301748190?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndrejK666/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndrejK666/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndrejK666/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndrejK666/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AndrejK666","id":301748190,"login":"AndrejK666","node_id":"U_kgDOEfxP3g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndrejK666/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndrejK666/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndrejK666/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndrejK666/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndrejK666/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndrejK666","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/studio-web/commits/53c2825a877333af85fe1f03cc3ed3b4f3e87ba0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T11:03:22Z","email":"Andrej.Kuchma@constructor.tech","name":"ANDREI KUCHMA"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T11:03:22Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(desktop): Analyze runs again — the /studio-api proxy forwards a body it can send (#569)\n\nEvery POST the desktop sent to Studio through its /studio-api proxy failed\nwith \"Response body object should not be disturbed or locked\": Analyze''s four\nchecks (Purpose, Leak, Bloat, Traceability) showed it as \"Nothing was\nrecorded\", and so would anything else that posts. The proxy handed fetch the\nincoming request stream, but @theia/filesystem''s file-download endpoint\nmounts `json()` on the whole backend app (file-download-endpoint.js:39), so\na JSON body had already been read by the time the proxy saw it.\n\n`requestBody` forwards bytes instead: a body a parser already read is\nserialised back, otherwise the stream is read to its end. A buffer can also\nbe sent again, which a stream could not (a redirect fetch follows).\n\nSigned-off-by: Andrej Kuchma <Andrej.Kuchma@constructor.tech>","tree":{"sha":"ba904c8d8f31737cec4dada8ff62ea68c9a5f164","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/studio-web/git/trees/ba904c8d8f31737cec4dada8ff62ea68c9a5f164"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/studio-web/git/commits/53c2825a877333af85fe1f03cc3ed3b4f3e87ba0","verification":{"payload":"tree ba904c8d8f31737cec4dada8ff62ea68c9a5f164\nparent e66764002cc7ac42e0793db104171bfa7465483a\nauthor ANDREI KUCHMA <Andrej.Kuchma@constructor.tech> 1790766202 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790766202 +0200\n\nfix(desktop): Analyze runs again — the /studio-api proxy forwards a body it can send (#569)\n\nEvery POST the desktop sent to Studio through its /studio-api proxy failed\nwith \"Response body object should not be disturbed or locked\": Analyze''s four\nchecks (Purpose, Leak, Bloat, Traceability) showed it as \"Nothing was\nrecorded\", and so would anything else that posts. The proxy handed fetch the\nincoming request stream, but @theia/filesystem''s file-download endpoint\nmounts `json()` on the whole backend app (file-download-endpoint.js:39), so\na JSON body had already been read by the time the proxy saw it.\n\n`requestBody` forwards bytes instead: a body a parser already read is\nserialised back, otherwise the stream is read to its end. A buffer can also\nbe sent again, which a stream could not (a redirect fetch follows).\n\nSigned-off-by: Andrej Kuchma <Andrej.Kuchma@constructor.tech>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqvOx6CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAArUUQADcq783nYPTjK4wi0rCn8xPs\ncGaPZcq0kzMbPwe1XMg4I2WDW1rJTjPv+cY6KjhocdlIv+bY6DlNYcdQPaFtSTxR\noSnoRH9RrtzpKP+cNQ+1q1a9J6431Hv3k99VMvTLjr5s+eDvAuNYOvn+jAaQ0kh1\nHsdAcDzjoOmDu4oLETE4M0jJ0Prx1yHZnM6NYJE6YrNox1Bqr8DVUalA0UryIrnz\n12QrPgOwG+u8ZcV0nB9XwMr54ZYdWzaa1O8QnYmyHf4OghpO+5QdUM7AwWK8MRom\ng3RrZrf6PO1XPKV3O18pUYlvgcLA8K/NDvvRFpMBwTvFi2M7Ol6+IUNwlROB96yA\n28OQ+zYyz2Q7C7C3r3c8QEdILY6rnsV1nL9ozBFErPr9kVKYUCQMtOFXQxXbz8Lv\n7vxQAscUP4PwZ29RHfesRQrJxBoTqCPfqTkUKHoTzH33pG2Wn3n+qQl3eNX27gx3\n1HNzYnDPhvC//2T1a4Ya02+D+i78Yy7eESmAlGB0O3bvev1JRjTxWAwPpU4q2zkM\nydFdkIUs3HIHbjjhQMC+LakfJ4wiqwSz9ijsAWktTGmr/Ekd1boExsSoHbhqDXVH\npwwZepMrRPHqmzmPyjFO1dH/+VSfFhHy/5qtKckcYuXKf9G0Boj+k3YlvjihVZI4\nqqyb38G7Oty5OO3eRH4Z\n=u63+\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-30T11:03:23Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https: