settled (#570)\n\nThe Specs table offered Confirm only on a proposal and Not a doc on\neverything else, so a confirmed file, one set by hand and an undetermined\none looked the same: the state lived in the Status column''s tooltip and in\nthe side panel. A State column now shows it on every row -- proposed,\nconfirmed, set by hand, undetermined, not a document -- with how it was\ndecided (declared in the file, matched the template, Spec Quality, chosen\nby hand) on hover.\n\nSigned-off-by: Andrej Kuchma <Andrej.Kuchma@constructor.tech>","tree":{"sha":"d8884be604883b016c72e524c952e5084aff8c0f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/studio-web/git/trees/d8884be604883b016c72e524c952e5084aff8c0f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/studio-web/git/commits/e66764002cc7ac42e0793db104171bfa7465483a","verification":{"payload":"tree d8884be604883b016c72e524c952e5084aff8c0f\nparent fca64fa407d3447f5318ee2eec7027cae18a6731\nauthor ANDREI KUCHMA <Andrej.Kuchma@constructor.tech> 1790766143 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790766143 +0200\n\nfeat(specs): each row says whether its type is settled (#570)\n\nThe Specs table offered Confirm only on a proposal and Not a doc on\neverything else, so a confirmed file, one set by hand and an undetermined\none looked the same: the state lived in the Status column''s tooltip and in\nthe side panel. A State column now shows it on every row -- proposed,\nconfirmed, set by hand, undetermined, not a document -- with how it was\ndecided (declared in the file, matched the template, Spec Quality, chosen\nby hand) on hover.\n\nSigned-off-by: Andrej Kuchma <Andrej.Kuchma@constructor.tech>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqvOw/CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAj9EQADjBOW9gWKSr/EUv15vRNnLg\n5Q7FNB7/syVtjimnrR9q96sgA32WZejhLYkdMXIpLtKpVrh1EU7CnbSRMBIr4Oft\n7TuCZp/MfO2u2kDZx/+f0oa5VmQMAHONnM3ZIFotPbBCQOqJWP8y7ZhCVl/Cu8/i\nqDYG46l5AlYBEDIo9gLtATpRk9lRnvdlTP5559DNtd8X/aOQyUW9JL/c6Xm