6731"}],"sha":"e66764002cc7ac42e0793db104171bfa7465483a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/studio-web/commits/e66764002cc7ac42e0793db104171bfa7465483a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/301748190?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndrejK666/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndrejK666/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndrejK666/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndrejK666/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AndrejK666","id":301748190,"login":"AndrejK666","node_id":"U_kgDOEfxP3g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndrejK666/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndrejK666/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndrejK666/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndrejK666/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndrejK666/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndrejK666","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/studio-web/commits/fca64fa407d3447f5318ee2eec7027cae18a6731/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T10:59:03Z","email":"Andrej.Kuchma@constructor.tech","name":"ANDREI KUCHMA"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T10:59:03Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(prototype): a project row''s \"…\" opens its menu (#568)\n\nClicking \"…\" on a row of a workspace''s project table did nothing, so the\ntable''s only Rename and Delete could not be reached.\n\nThe menu did open, and it closed again within the same click. The effect\nthat closes it on any click adds its `document` listener while the click\nthat opened the menu is still bubbling. That listener then hears the same\nclick reach `document` and closes the menu before anything is painted.\nTraced on the real bundle over CDP: `click` on the button, listener added,\nlist mounted, the new listener fires with the button as target, list\nunmounted.\n\nThe close handler now ignores clicks inside a `.prowmenu`: this menu''s own\nitems, which close it themselves, and another row''s \"…\", which switches to\nthat row. Everywhere else still closes it.\n\nVerified on the rebuilt bundle against the local stack. One click opens a\nvisible Open / Rename / Delete list, and a click outside closes it.\n\nSigned-off-by: Andrej Kuchma <Andrej.Kuchma@constructor.tech>","tree":{"sha":"10102613c756236145b8feacf764b73573e3d61f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/studio-web/git/trees/10102613c756236145b8feacf764b73573e3d61f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/studio-web/git/commits/fca64fa407d3447f5318ee2eec7027cae18a6731","verification":{"payload":"tree 10102613c756236145b8feacf764b73573e3d61f\nparent f9db24a3b2ad5fbe74c5d8e8b45ab783661cec92\nauthor ANDREI KUCHMA <Andrej.Kuchma@constructor.tech> 1790765943 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790765943 +0200\n\nfix(prototype): a project row''s \"…\" opens its menu (#568)\n\nClicking \"…\" on a row of a workspace''s project table did nothing, so the\ntable''s only Rename and Delete could not be reached.\n\nThe menu did open, and it closed again within the same click. The effect\nthat closes it on any click adds its `document` listener while the click\nthat opened the menu is still bubbling. That listener then hears the same\nclick reach `document` and closes the menu before anything is painted.\nTraced on the real bundle over CDP: `click` on the button, listener added,\nlist mounted, the new listener fires with the button as target, list\nunmounted.\n\nThe close handler now ignores clicks inside a `.prowmenu`: this menu''s own\nitems, which close it themselves, and another row''s \"…\", which switches to\nthat row. Everywhere else still closes it.\n\nVerified on the rebuilt bundle against the local stack. One click opens a\nvisible Open / Rename / Delete list, and a click outside closes it.\n\nSigned-off-by: Andrej Kuchma <Andrej.Kuchma@constructor.tech>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqvOt3CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAHjUQAJw5QPAUTZ2tNLS0pT9UuRyb\n2s0v0Gc+aWzgNcWQRXaFsQWcD+M+Sz00ksxeeyKcdmQtaA0ZdynI6MVgH7b+knx7\n2rJ4B8T4VXWBwwbch1Ro6jJV2E9vHqnNddk5tU28MvQlRrvpSqXK8KngviZJDwrT\nGoFzL6FhIQUPCzo4JU2CzHR7+Za3pXC4/VIIMuAm6J7KPd8ROXmUwgZ4A6d2Y6Bx\n6ux6giYcg999Ka6LI2AmbiKJiLBvf3hzB0k8clcwVuQzd4sIape4ryspa1R8mQ1o\neSQGPt3Lc8aMwkMWjAxVYjCSCnbD0OTbCO6x0jJuqJhAmHJ5Qt696YXf6IEkPtUM\nkDwkHC5lvh1eZTkcxdSqMNDXA0Qw2mo/tLNgFsdywgmjT1h1jpgjkUFAhNlArBOA\nuqFVHS3KXFJdZPEcTd+d615rtoZ9qrPhzJxltmiOhcIgFuFi6YV1bGGQThsAFaTg\n6LWwaq+/IRWIi+M4jfVKG7Tu5+MPcCNTfg7qdVfnHVhvd7YO/Q/SHoht8bvx+VzO\nF3XYyCaHzbnx+CSa98vFvQbAe/uZxoXQJi5IiDL6jc3QT8AnffaQ/YTL3xQF/vqO\n/CZo5taZU0JOLtFKgRAUA15V5cON0+hY0PUBjNY1fVhuumA8p9rm7+GBm+ZCZUfP\ngf7JO6++Z0gmPe0OxUD1\n=SmmY\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-30T10:59:04Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/constructorfabric/studio-web/commit/fca64fa407d3447f5318ee2eec7027cae18a6731","node_id":"C_kwDOTl7dJtoAKGZjYTY0ZmE0MDdkMzQ0N2Y1MzE4ZWUyZWVjNzAyN2NhZTE4YTY3MzE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/constructorfabric/studio-web/commit/f9db24a3b2ad5fbe74c5d8e8b45ab783661cec92","sha":"f9db24a3b2ad5fbe74c5d8e8b45ab783661cec92","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/studio-web/commits/f9db24a3b2ad5fbe74c5d8e8b45ab783661cec92"}],"sha":"fca64fa407d3447f5318ee2eec7027cae18a6731","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/studio-web/commits/fca64fa407d3447f5318ee2eec7027cae18a6731"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/301748190?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndrejK666/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndrejK666/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndrejK666/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndrejK666/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AndrejK666","id":301748190,"login":"AndrejK666","node_id":"U_kgDOEfxP3g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndrejK666/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndrejK666/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndrejK666/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndrejK666/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndrejK666/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndrejK666","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/studio-web/commits/f9db24a3b2ad5fbe74c5d8e8b45ab783661cec92/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T10:55:07Z","email":"Andrej.Kuchma@constructor.tech","name":"ANDREI KUCHMA"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T10:55:07Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(specs): the Spec Quality menu runs on the documents the filters show (#567)\n\nWith a type filter set to Architecture Decision Record, the menu''s Refine,\nLeak, Bloat and Trace still ran over every binding in the project: the\nfilters shaped the table and nothing else. Now each run takes the files\nbehind the rows left on screen, and each item names how many that is.\n\n- With no filter set the set is the whole project, as before.\n- Bloat and Trace compare within the view, so an ADR-only run finds\n  duplicates and references among the ADRs.\n- Authored documents still go from their own panel; they have no binding.\n\nSigned-off-by: Andrej Kuchma <Andrej.Kuchma@constructor.tech>","tree":{"sha":"3948ae63ed98b690dc26fc3d2bff01d0598b51ca","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/studio-web/git/trees/3948ae63ed98b690dc26fc3d2bff01d0598b51ca"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/studio-web/git/commits/f9db24a3b2ad5fbe74c5d8e8b45ab783661cec92","verification":{"payload":"tree 3948ae63ed98b690dc26fc3d2bff01d0598b51ca\nparent cb9f6fa9cb6624488c03df74575d41e27fa3f869\nauthor ANDREI KUCHMA <Andrej.Kuchma@constructor.tech> 1790765707 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790765707 +0200\n\nfeat(specs): the Spec Quality menu runs on the documents the filters show (#567)\n\nWith a type filter set to Architecture Decision Record, the menu''s Refine,\nLeak, Bloat and Trace still ran over every binding in the project: the\nfilters shaped the table and nothing else. Now each run takes the files\nbehind the rows left on screen, and each item names how many that is.\n\n- With no filter set the set is the whole project, as before.\n- Bloat and Trace compare within the view, so an ADR-only run finds\n  duplicates and references among the ADRs.\n- Authored documents still go from their own panel; they have no binding.\n\nSigned-off-by: Andrej Kuchma <Andrej.Kuchma@constructor.tech>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nw