"https://github.com/constructorfabric/studio-web/commit/cb9f6fa9cb6624488c03df74575d41e27fa3f869","sha":"cb9f6fa9cb6624488c03df74575d41e27fa3f869","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/studio-web/commits/cb9f6fa9cb6624488c03df74575d41e27fa3f869"}],"sha":"f9db24a3b2ad5fbe74c5d8e8b45ab783661cec92","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/studio-web/commits/f9db24a3b2ad5fbe74c5d8e8b45ab783661cec92"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/301748190?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndrejK666/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndrejK666/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndrejK666/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndrejK666/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AndrejK666","id":301748190,"login":"AndrejK666","node_id":"U_kgDOEfxP3g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndrejK666/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndrejK666/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndrejK666/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndrejK666/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndrejK666/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndrejK666","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/studio-web/commits/cb9f6fa9cb6624488c03df74575d41e27fa3f869/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T10:43:07Z","email":"Andrej.Kuchma@constructor.tech","name":"ANDREI KUCHMA"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T10:43:07Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(gearbox): the scanning notice once, New Gear''s preview says what to open, and no \\?\\ in its path (#566)\n\n- The antivirus notice (\"Reading the N gear source files took…\") is shown\n  once per profile: a stored flag, read before and written after the notice.\n  Two opens finishing close together (a create, then the open it triggers)\n  could both read \"not shown\". `hintScanning` now claims the check before its\n  first await; an open with nothing slow to report releases it.\n- New Gear with no product and no repository of gears open showed the\n  engine''s refusal for a command line (\"no source root is open; pass roots to\n  initialize or --root to the CLI\"). `describeScaffoldRefusal` says what to\n  do instead: open a product, or add a repository that holds gear.gdl files.\n  Other refusals pass through as the engine said them.\n- The preview''s destination showed `//?/C:/...`: the engine reports the\n  verbatim prefix with forward slashes too, and `plainPath` only knew the\n  backslash form.\n\nSigned-off-by: Andrej Kuchma <Andrej.Kuchma@constructor.tech>","tree":{"sha":"9abfe72d6720dbe990ca0b6876087f6b4c72427f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/studio-web/git/trees/9abfe72d6720dbe990ca0b6876087f6b4c72427f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/studio-web/git/commits/cb9f6fa9cb6624488c03df74575d41e27fa3f869","verification":{"payload":"tree 9abfe72d6720dbe990ca0b6876087f6b4c72427f\nparent efdffcf463f425b6d6aaf3d9725486af9111616e\nauthor ANDREI KUCHMA <Andrej.Kuchma@constructor.tech> 1790764987 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790764987 +0200\n\nfix(gearbox): the scanning notice once, New Gear''s preview says what to open, and no \\?\\ in its path (#566)\n\n- The antivirus notice (\"Reading the N gear source files took…\") is shown\n  once per profile: a stored flag, read before and written after the notice.\n  Two opens finishing close together (a create, then the open it triggers)\n  could both read \"not shown\". `hintScanning` now claims the check before its\n  first await; an open with nothing slow to report releases it.\n- New Gear with no product and no repository of gears open showed the\n  engine''s refusal for a command line (\"no source root is open; pass roots to\n  initialize or --root to the CLI\"). `describeScaffoldRefusal` says what to\n  do instead: open a product, or add a repository that holds gear.gdl files.\n  Other refusals pass through as the engine said them.\n- The preview''s destination showed `//?/C:/...`: the engine reports the\n  verbatim prefix with forward slashes too, and `plainPath` only knew the\n  backslash form.\n\nSigned-off-by: Andrej Kuchma <Andrej.Kuchma@constructor.tech>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqvOe7CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAki0QADgbmAeH/6wt81qZLQQF3JvF\nMfaAUbh/Jx6GXWbjK8DU6s2R0oWe0135w57rig31Rycz047W6hVr2VqcB4W6HQzl\nyVfc31BmFQr6ikOiRP1+XLeLIz4B928GS5XwvbiMBALtU//msAqoYwK0kBkG5ojQ\nL+6dbAH6hxwT7Vztw6Z96m16DR6wnmIbqptnJOd/KGDZN7Gcot1pT9c7OosIOvpR\nhbsFeN9bK8lFo5oomEbonQ5uYbmVnuI0l9CoQaAfurVgbWHMw+owhPHVg0sSeRd1\nHlCGhUwhehbVMui8u2lQOrHwmlWTB8karmXk20J8k/UBgPr1DzN/ZxynQz4dXN1K\nWc91rnqYzJzY+Z64L0Piju8LVPulJxvrzWJhA45FpBQVBgJz3UOZ53vG53/v9h4V\nIEQ7yNo+z5pUeAjyZPFmO9bEoovKSh9jZdfi8ZQPY5mHqL14etOV/pqhFMIup6YR\nsaJPv8TB2PEiNV4ybcfrtHUBR/7H8+vYO3vNMyhwWshsgKp7Y8S24xUyNHQp0bDp\nvVe2tnZtFpsycyFnQqzTfgBjAuMvUH0K+f6dNWMLXhOX8czaBZRGIB+fTyRvWHQg\nDRc6yZdoQQsmOgMUZXlTKkEJYOdYGQ6k26igMk6GLxr7ZlqMYwUhJA8+sPhuf/PS\nu+RO5Kd1Fv+SEbLzs6G7\n=ipYD\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-30T10:43:08Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/re