\nbackend past the chart''s 1Gi, and dev''s rev 103 was OOM-killed seconds after\nboot. Raised by hand to 2Gi it settled at about 220Mi. values-dev now says\n2Gi, so the next delivery does not put the 1Gi back.\n\nSigned-off-by: Andrej Kuchma <Andrej.Kuchma@constructor.tech>","tree":{"sha":"0752713c72468f61fcd54ac4a2320bad41f1ca70","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/studio-web/git/trees/0752713c72468f61fcd54ac4a2320bad41f1ca70"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/studio-web/git/commits/ee0191eb4856dd16e3450f9769feb2331b39bbb2","verification":{"payload":"tree 0752713c72468f61fcd54ac4a2320bad41f1ca70\nparent b1fc91cc4fd6afdc3df80af7712a2ec49a1ae8b1\nauthor ANDREI KUCHMA <Andrej.Kuchma@constructor.tech> 1790753150 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790753150 +0200\n\nfix(deploy): dev''s backend has room for the Gearbox engine it runs (#555)\n\nThe engine is a child of the backend and shares its container''s memory\nlimit; projecting the corpus on the first catalogue request took the\nbackend past the chart''s 1Gi, and dev''s rev 103 was OOM-killed seconds after\nboot. Raised by hand to 2Gi it settled at about 220Mi. values-dev now says\n2Gi, so the next delivery does not put the 1Gi back.\n\nSigned-off-by: Andrej Kuchma <Andrej.Kuchma@constructor.tech>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqvLl+CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAABuwQAAtnOhwt41uL7lbGXNKh27jN\n7b0nFbvn0aeZR+5l0zk4YMpCSOW510V3XTEm6xBnC+oe/wZtx37tnyPFnKVZTUfu\njwSJjTIDItdu7oHbhNYO+dwm6e+ITXwPgMTvdXI4/8pYC5TUq7rXv6s5ODOiTCqL\nF4ADhOTS8P67R28Au5A1PY0qipXLucaMB7TQhQ+46vfHuk7Lyp5freXk4WT+4H8x\nZSV1TTCeOiEBgwH6xiDxb/L2ymAIdJbBC9IRrH3fIp5rCgbPnav0TtamZ7W8EQoT\nYKyr1wSRwrMhO9ktqfdNFgM+bkOjaUk7Mwrmid7+implC1oq3TyaVvZOy9FCNx6/\nFCG+WsOcmUG4Dl1pfk0P/jr34z2wbKLf6cJe3GCdpVm6S6A4ZLqEcqNEeaIZZMvt\nX/IWnjtDWvxmrxNVnJ7DF1bhDnsBgleHa3E8gd0ENZ7gMJ7TpwIvaevY3f0u36In\nZ2VO3/GUWitkAuyuddX+z3pKg+q/VJLTj9F7kBLYuaG2PQkdYqVYqK5KR7Sls8RH\nHT13y6Kqgikw/rD/Yuz1QRB