w/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/constructorfabric/studio-web/commit/e3b731353bad07706bb121be490123fadb241eea","node_id":"C_kwDOTl7dJtoAKGUzYjczMTM1M2JhZDA3NzA2YmIxMjFiZTQ5MDEyM2ZhZGIyNDFlZWE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/constructorfabric/studio-web/commit/8c700e8d2e48a85dfaa735c6d36949af9248fd9b","sha":"8c700e8d2e48a85dfaa735c6d36949af9248fd9b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/studio-web/commits/8c700e8d2e48a85dfaa735c6d36949af9248fd9b"}],"sha":"e3b731353bad07706bb121be490123fadb241eea","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/studio-web/commits/e3b731353bad07706bb121be490123fadb241eea"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/301748190?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndrejK666/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndrejK666/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndrejK666/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndrejK666/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AndrejK666","id":301748190,"login":"AndrejK666","node_id":"U_kgDOEfxP3g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndrejK666/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndrejK666/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndrejK666/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndrejK666/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndrejK666/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndrejK666","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/studio-web/commits/8c700e8d2e48a85dfaa735c6d36949af9248fd9b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-29T21:20:29Z","email":"Andrej.Kuchma@constructor.tech","name":"ANDREI KUCHMA"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-29T21:20:29Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(components): build readiness — SPEC / SDK / IMPL, the board against the repository (#550)\n\nThe Components table gets a Build readiness column: the roadmap board''s\nprogress axes (Design, SDK, Implementation) as SPEC / SDK / IMPL bars,\nwith what the repository shows underneath -- the specs'' ticked\nrequirement markers and how many of their requirement IDs the code cites\n-- and \"Board ahead of the repository\" where the board claims at least\n40 points more than the repository shows.\n\nThe scan counts the second one now: `impl_trace` (\"7 of 9 requirement\nIDs in code\") is the specs'' cpt-* IDs that the gear''s production code\ncites, tests left out (a test citing one says it is checked, not built).\nSpec and code read IDs with one function, so the two compare as equal.\nThe gear schema gets the field beside `progress`.\n\nSigned-off-by: Andrej Kuchma <Andrej.Kuchma@constructor.tech>","tree":{"sha":"ec1ae0341480ecec2019b962262640862b39329b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/studio-web/git/trees/ec1ae0341480ecec2019b962262640862b39329b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/studio-web/git/commits/8c700e8d2e48a85dfaa735c6d36949af9248fd9b","verification":{"payload":"tree ec1ae0341480ecec2019b962262640862b39329b\nparent a3097de13a92c4306772745d211d6ff71ac86c4e\nauthor ANDREI KUCHMA <Andrej.Kuchma@constructor.tech> 1790716829 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790716829 +0200\n\nfeat(components): build readiness — SPEC / SDK / IMPL, the board against the repository (#550)\n\nThe Components table gets a Build readiness column: the roadmap board''s\nprogress axes (Design, SDK, Implementation) as SPEC / SDK / IMPL bars,\nwith what the repository shows underneath -- the specs'' ticked\nrequirement markers and how many of their requirement IDs the code cites\n-- and \"Board ahead of the repository\" where the board claims at least\n40 points more than the repository shows.\n\nThe scan counts the second one now: `impl_trace` (\"7 of 9 requirement\nIDs in code\") is the specs'' cpt-* IDs that the gear''s production code\ncites, tests left out (a test citing one says it is checked, not built).\nSpec and code read IDs with one function, so the two compare as equal.\nThe gear schema gets the field beside `progress`.\n\nSigned-off-by: Andrej Kuchma <Andrej.Kuchma@constructor.tech>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqvCudCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAfygQAGs/Vio5P9QQfDvZxVYn8+Yz\nReagpAbwBF/DrKpQEhDharkk2WDtLWC0CTvr6iYox4qjimDTzlL/0HU/fWHfJFlE\nqM+coJoX0ImUs6tI2r/uUju+ojLqSkTP2fhCDxONYSE85VtrgmXaOqlBIHVF5saS\nh6OUsHncVCz5nXhIgZ7PFn6TYSNwyGGsTqc3OChVQFDXYNB4dCuiP0FaisHJTAfZ\nKy8HYXBM7FN80/BIfse1FLIgyOGs7IhJ9ypz0ygMNPOhSCXUWb+eDKRhmdlauMkQ\n/lszFl/i6H9NEZUKW3xWmsyU5UG37hE4uH5TjMaaR1XYYvplmiWyCvbX3LGy9XJq\nwAvAEUvygzxtPJbAU1+F4yF9Ch5xOW7UxNWfTiCqEVEJvqZv+/jLBp7zdNtMkszG\nmrzFUEsM9Q0YFRuJEH+6mDMpwRkznfdB/rdP6J+0GQHOEPcOZ2gngObAd8JErMdM\n7bzZJSWh7Yu7a98KQHJix8YZyC8DFFaG0628DiZBH6So59pSIRwlPhK3Qn8XsUMj\neK1Q0hJljJmVh1MGtRimGmQ4ePdot5IayF42TNG23UfZtile0Fq60Z1VnOsPue+8\n6ttUahByRK6UV8a2xJ+2zjj2QQilyfQ0WnAVLDZMOFbYzjAtfInOveB/xRkmWPKE\n/bAxPAIDQy1i6u1jL66W\n=5v7T\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-29T21:20:30Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","org