:"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/studio-web/commits/328cf5121a2eb9e405ae47947383f863d28313ad"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/301748190?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndrejK666/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndrejK666/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndrejK666/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndrejK666/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AndrejK666","id":301748190,"login":"AndrejK666","node_id":"U_kgDOEfxP3g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndrejK666/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndrejK666/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndrejK666/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndrejK666/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndrejK666/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndrejK666","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/studio-web/commits/8474dfa8ccb31f08a6ea84b891af2f11a451a443/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-29T20:55:49Z","email":"Andrej.Kuchma@constructor.tech","name":"ANDREI KUCHMA"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-29T20:55:49Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(ide): the roadmap report in the IDE — the board''s plan, and a workbook saved where you pick (#547)\n\nThe Building ribbon''s Corpus group gets a Roadmap tab next to Components: the\nsame report the portal shows (GET /studio-components-catalog/v1/roadmap-report)\n-- per stage, plan state, milestone and consumer, the overdue gears, and one\nrow per planned component with its plan, the reasons it is off track, who\nneeds it and its grade. A component''s name opens its page in Components; its\nlink icon opens the board item.\n\n\"Save as workbook\" writes the Roadmap and Summary sheets as an .xlsx through\nTheia''s save dialog and FileService, so it lands in the workspace (or wherever\nthe person picks) the same way in the portal''s session and on the desktop. The\nwriter is a stored zip built in the browser, as in the prototype, so the IDE\nbundle takes no spreadsheet dependency.\n\nSigned-off-by: Andrej Kuchma <Andrej.Kuchma@constructor.tech>","tree":{"sha":"8451e241c220c70ad7c20b260baee496c39c4934","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/studio-web/git/trees/8451e241c220c70ad7c20b260baee496c39c4934"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/studio-web/git/commits/8474dfa8ccb31f08a6ea84b891af2f11a451a443","verification":{"payload":"tree 8451e241c220c70ad7c20b260baee496c39c4934\nparent 789c3ed76ec625436ef4aa3fb52aaa6c017598be\nauthor ANDREI KUCHMA <Andrej.Kuchma@constructor.tech> 1790715349 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790715349 +0200\n\nfeat(ide): the roadmap report in the IDE — the board''s plan, and a workbook saved where you pick (#547)\n\nThe Building ribbon''s Corpus group gets a Roadmap tab next to Components: the\nsame report the portal shows (GET /studio-components-catalog/v1/roadmap-report)\n-- per stage, plan state, milestone and consumer, the overdue gears, and one\nrow per planned component with its plan, the reasons it is off track, who\nneeds it and its grade. A component''s name opens its page in Components; its\nlink icon opens the board item.\n\n\"Save as workbook\" writes the Roadmap and Summary sheets as an .xlsx through\nTheia''s save dialog and FileService, so it lands in the workspace (or wherever\nthe person picks) the same way in the portal''s session and on the desktop. The\nwriter is a stored zip built in the browser, as in the prototype, so the IDE\nbundle takes no spreadsheet dependency.\n\nSigned-off-by: Andrej Kuchma <Andrej.Kuchma@constructor.tech>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqvCXVCRC1aQ7