tructorfabric/studio-web/commit/ffcb53b472096850b1595363584fef820ecb3da1","sha":"ffcb53b472096850b1595363584fef820ecb3da1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/studio-web/commits/ffcb53b472096850b1595363584fef820ecb3da1"}],"sha":"789c3ed76ec625436ef4aa3fb52aaa6c017598be","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/studio-web/commits/789c3ed76ec625436ef4aa3fb52aaa6c017598be"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/301748190?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndrejK666/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndrejK666/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndrejK666/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndrejK666/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AndrejK666","id":301748190,"login":"AndrejK666","node_id":"U_kgDOEfxP3g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndrejK666/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndrejK666/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndrejK666/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndrejK666/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndrejK666/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndrejK666","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/studio-web/commits/ffcb53b472096850b1595363584fef820ecb3da1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-29T20:35:49Z","email":"Andrej.Kuchma@constructor.tech","name":"ANDREI KUCHMA"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-29T20:35:49Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(desktop): mermaid diagrams and KaTeX equations render on the desktop (#545)\n\nThe editor loads `mermaid.js` and `katex.js` with a script tag on first use;\nbrowser-app/esbuild.mjs builds them as their own entry points. electron-app\nhad no esbuild.mjs of its own, so `theia build` wrote its default, which\nbuilds neither: 0.3.0-beta.5''s lib/frontend holds bundle.js and no\nmermaid.js, and every diagram failed with \"could not load mermaid.js\".\n\nelectron-app/esbuild.mjs is Theia''s default for an electron target plus the\nsame two entry points, exempted in .gitignore as browser-app''s is. The other\nbrowser-app corrections (.wasm as a file, no secondary-window) are about a\nsession image''s size and are left out.\n\nChecked with the local desktop build: `theia build --mode development`\nwrites lib/frontend/mermaid.js (7.9 MB), katex.js, katex.css and the KaTeX\nfonts beside index.html, and package.mjs copies lib/ whole.\n\nSigned-off-by: Andrej Kuchma <Andrej.Kuchma@constructor.tech>","tree":{"sha":"827cef26690f5e862413dc9a9923d30c41b20af3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/studio-web/git/trees/827cef26690f5e862413dc9a9923d30c41b20af3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/studio-web/git/commits/ffcb53b472096850b1595363584fef820ecb3da1","verification":{"payload":"tree 827cef26690f5e862413dc9a9923d30c41b20af3\nparent 237a8484ea2b1a8666c6f1ed87197d6371a8a365\nauthor ANDREI KUCHMA <Andrej.Kuchma@constructor.tech> 1790714149 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790714149 +0200\n\nfix(desktop): mermaid diagrams and KaTeX equations render on the desktop (#545)\n\nThe editor loads `mermaid.js` and `katex.js` with a script tag on first use;\nbrowser-app/esbuild.mjs builds them as their own entry points. electron-app\nhad no esbuild.mjs of its own, so `theia build` wrote its default, which\nbuilds neither: 0.3.0-beta.5''s lib/frontend holds bundle.js and no\nmermaid.js, and every diagram failed with \"could not load mermaid.js\".\n\nelectron-app/esbuild.mjs is Theia''s default for an electron target plus the\nsame two entry points, exempted in .gitignore as browser-app''s is. The other\nbrowser-app corrections (.wasm as a file, no secondary-window) are about a\nsession image''s size and are left out.\n\nChecked with the local desktop build: `theia build --mode development`\nwrites lib/frontend/mermaid.js (7.9 MB), katex.js, katex.css and the KaTeX\nfonts beside index.html, and package.mjs copies lib/ whole.\n\nSigned-off-by: Andrej Kuchma <Andrej.Kuchma@constructor.tech>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqvCElCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAt8sQAEqrcn/W1SnMxInKEspQkZcY\nt6crX1TYGXH1USUzDi2T7xaRPwo85pjUlLq02NYXZ4srF25coIYKShKJ42j1f3vM\nPryckR/Yz8nIT6rlxC2RkHDnlvmxglfuy/H/da7GAoCth2r9Qyw6EH85YHzdo+yf\no255W30S6J3/bFPj7/72ZkSbMxnftfjS43uQ2Xjvcs+JXIMNiL7b5nwXKvEBnUsn\nALR4LHlXnom8QGKZx4g5yK+IPoJIho6RpFpPH5h8HJJQNiMH27qDpFewSTIy8R3P\ntOxeT4fkWG2FkMU15UPeJLV3lIzzIk9h5WFl9tLGeNSIqLv3v3WAPkNzNcO8p5H1\nEG+8KBy+rbydnVzlEVnG1yi7692mk/Ki90tvfVYDOxbyiyGATAur4RV9BOEUmKJa\n21eHBu5pcCA7tUDDVR5t/zE/gp7Pavy7A9yeXkkd2z42IRoJdUf4qeyMdyTmNA7X\ndCHYLJBrntXOhc3FMhEu2ZZY0Q/cbYMh1cSdK1RWCC5uwlKuiJpranm0ngL/Rpux\n7O4/V5qpZGyZ5XGMF02CVZjQp2YwMP+JMY8a4GGNcuMDiQuIrxDZx2Yx59XltLgF\nSVdwHVXC/i9DqVo5KZOpAaw52O4686kyfxMu6+X3seHUYIUD3MXaDIfCUJWXRv3l\n9bzVa5zXBw9/mRjnppNR\n=AZW2\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-29T20:35:50Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/constructorfabric/studio-web/commit/ffcb53b472096850b1595363584fef820ecb3da1","node_id":"C_kwDOTl7dJtoAKGZmY2I1M2I0NzIwOTY4NTBiMTU5NTM2MzU4NGZlZjgyMGVjYjNkYTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/constructorfabric/studio-web/commit/237a8484ea2b1a8666c6f1ed87197d6371a8a365","sha":"237a8484ea2b1a8666c6f1ed87197d6371a8a365","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/studio-web/commits/237a8484ea2b1a8666c6f1ed87197d6371a8a365"}],"sha":"ffcb53b472096850b1595363584fef820ecb3da1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/studio-web/commits/ffcb53b472096850b1595363584fef820ecb3da1"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/301748190?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndrejK666/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndrejK666/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndrejK666/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndrejK666/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AndrejK666","id":301748190,"login":"AndrejK666","node_id":"U_kgDOEfxP3g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndrejK666/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndrejK666/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndrejK666/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndrejK666/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndrejK666/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndrejK666","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/studio-web/commits/237a8484ea2b1a8666c6f1ed87197d6371a8a365/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-29T20:35:35Z","email":"Andrej.Kuchma@constructor.tech","name":"ANDREI KUCHMA"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-29T20:35:35Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(prototype): a gear''s pull requests against the window before (#544)\n\nThe Components page''s pull request tiles showed one window''s totals with\nnothing to read them against. /studio-components-catalog/v1/activity takes\ncompare=previous and then also counts pull requests over the window of the\nsame length just before (pull_requests_previous), with the same one query\nper repository to Insight; without it nothing changes, and /reference does\nnot ask. The tiles now say how each number moved: open, merged and closed\nby how many (neither better nor worse), and the merge time as Better or\nWorse, since shorter is better. Under an hour or 5 % reads as the same.\n\nSigned-off-by: Andrej Kuchma <Andrej.Kuchma@constructor.tech>","tree":{"sha":"e3b10fca580598e3882865098c5ee80405f5ef5c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/studio-web/git/trees/e3b10fca580598e3882865098c5ee80405f5ef5c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/constructorfabric/studio-web/git/commits/237a8484ea2b1a8666c6f1ed87197d6371a8a365","verification":{"payload":"tree e3b10fca580598e3882865098c5ee80405f5ef5c\nparent 05b669da77062fe67310d2ca88f5d1cb05ad76f6\nauthor ANDREI KUCHMA <Andrej.Kuchma@constructor.tech> 1790714135 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790714135 +0200\n\nfeat(prototype): a gear''s pull requests against the window before (#544)\n\nThe Components page''s pull request tiles showed one window''s totals with\nnothing to read them against. /studio-components-catalog/v1/activity takes\ncompare=previous and then also counts pull requests over the window of the\nsame length just before (pull_requests_previous), with the same one query\nper repository to Insight; without it nothing changes, and /reference does\nnot ask. The tiles now say how each number moved: open, merged and closed\nby how many (neither better nor worse), and the merge time as Better or\nWorse, since shorter is better. Under an hour or 5 % reads as the same.\n\nSigned-off-by: Andrej Kuchma <Andrej.Kuchma@constructor.tech>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqvCEXCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA94sQAJVcZxLtDoeQ9tmWDNX8exzY\noqjqhXaeeDYztQMF9OdSH3VP2YXYvgZV6hDrTPFawxIrbNcR9bJpycD5zE4pMzC2\nHP2prftaoOGmbXmFBDSlk2Y9S+w2cifARrPsODIKEuIh9pBgLd0WtnC3JDOGlEDG\nMxSfCR+NOP9M9/oV+PvMVCNK2W9hFWWS4fgmgBByvHQhEt2s6GNLmkScWaI9Jt42\nZc64qzoRO2Ws3nhQQP5DMy7H3S5RODZm7o9RvMJZAa9/DqUT3X+m+j1R/I2cuG0i\n29NUA8IaT1pUvet4Zx2IcfrIFwfnAwc5MZ46FhK/xgHwXuXdl/WtrQYKUUOH7Pdl\ntYL2FJFNpBjaWoSHqZhQwX3fjrfCR1IrmGnl+VwK/UAYyrObHonkQZJGVBJ389du\nAXWfHxGzWgydKAKyleOirGPsHl7KS6uOKxAdgew+nhgtH/8Oyabv5QxIKb2ZhKGR\nIPTfUobOGAjdpW2u9xqHt0RRAsBZqXoOmwqtOoqFv1AMoMFJkTyJkqU3NM74DhL5\n9bBNvxnHenMT9SEMMVov9RYIVmKD59MX/bL1Tw1+s4UIm6u4LfBXoHvJMV31NSwb\niKlmOm8NNjbe2X0UhKNNhXRVGCRzrkjvm5Vsr+NSNn/QkVzh7wV+F3RFhwoJ9Def\ndh7oPwojmtmQ5MS6fUTl\n=yro9\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-29T20:35:35Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"htm