:06:47Z","email":"p.szczypka.dev@gmail.com","name":"szczyppka"},"message":"feat: bootstrap react-app as a Module Federation remote exposing Widget\n\nSet up a new React + TypeScript app using the webpack config pattern from\nfrontend-shell (entry/output/resolve/ts-loader/HtmlWebpackPlugin/devServer),\nconfigured as the ''reactApp'' Module Federation remote. It exposes a single\nplaceholder component at ''./Widget'' that renders ''Hello from react-app\nremote'' with minimal styling, so it''s visually obvious when loaded correctly\nin a host shell. react and react-dom are shared as singletons.\n\nTests are written first (Widget.test.tsx, webpack.config.test.ts) to lock in\nthe contract described in the task spec, then the implementation follows.\n\nThe dev server (`pnpm dev`) runs on port 8081.","tree":{"sha":"05a107bce6587931ed9ac058000003c34f3b66d0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SzczypkaWeb/react-app/git/trees/05a107bce6587931ed9ac058000003c34f3b66d0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SzczypkaWeb/react-app/git/commits/2f18a40b22c28babc821d4826a19950f6e4199a9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/152203010?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/szczyppka/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/szczyppka/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/szczyppka/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/szczyppka/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/szczyppka","id":152203010,"login":"szczyppka","node_id":"U_kgDOCRJvAg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/szczyppka/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/szczyppka/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/szczyppka/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/szczyppka/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":