s://api.github.com/users/Vinuka-Osura/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vinuka-Osura","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vinuka-Osura/Chronicle.Portfolio.App/commits/4a91bb996a97f535d89556386d95589dbba1cc8d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-28T12:31:09Z","email":"vinukaosura@gmail.com","name":"Vinuka-Osura"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-28T12:31:09Z","email":"vinukaosura@gmail.com","name":"Vinuka-Osura"},"message":"docs: product proposal, implementation spec, software city concept\n\nFounding documents for Chronicle, captured before any code exists so the\ndata model (implementation-spec.md section 3) and product scope are\nversion-controlled from commit 1.\n\nAnnotated where the as-built architecture supersedes the original brief:\nsingle Aspire-orchestrated solution, Domain/Application/Infrastructure/\nPortfolio layering with MediatR CQRS, Blazor admin hosted inside\nPortfolio.Server, and Software City as a separate repository coupled only\nthrough the career-graph contract.","tree":{"sha":"791f43e01609677ad71d677a9ad5f748c05a5586","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vinuka-Osura/Chronicle.Portfolio.App/git/trees/791f43e01609677ad71d677a9ad5f748c05a5586"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vinuka-Osura/Chronicle.Portfolio.App/git/commits/4a91bb996a97f535d89556386d95589dbba1cc8d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/140843287?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vinuka-Osura/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vinuka-Osura/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vinuka-Osura/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vinuka-Osura/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Vinuka-Osura","id":140843287,"login":"Vinuka-Osura","node_id":"U