gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/walkingriver","id":1752021,"login":"walkingriver","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NTIwMjE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/walkingriver/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/walkingriver/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/walkingriver/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/walkingriver/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/walkingriver/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/walkingriver","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/walkingriver/agent-team/commits/fc7946f071d88bf50c57de86d144f3934a3ed501/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-28T16:16:29Z","email":"mikecallaghan67@gmail.com","name":"Michael Callaghan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-28T16:16:29Z","email":"mikecallaghan67@gmail.com","name":"Michael Callaghan"},"message":"docs: Update documentation to reference individual agent files\n\nRemove references to deprecated .claude-agents-bundle.md bundle.\nUpdate all guides to reference .claude/agents/ directory with 23 individual\nagent definition files.\n\nChanges:\n- README.md: Update Agent Definitions section to point to .claude/agents/\n- GETTING_STARTED.md:\n  * Update ''What You Have'' section\n  * Change quick start instructions to copy .claude/agents/ directly\n  * Update all three paths (new project, retrofit, study)\n- RETROFIT_GUIDE.md:\n  * Replace Step 8 ''Add Agent Definitions'' with simpler copy instructions\n  * List all 23 agents organized by category\n  * Point to agent-team repo as source for agent files\n\nBenefits:\n- Agents are now immediately usable without extraction step\n- Easier to find and customize individual agents\n- Better documentation of which agents do what\n- Links directly to agent repo and GitHub for easy access","tree":{"sha":"19ebd8a4914119cef7c31f38572f6877ef621bc3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/walkingriver/agent-team/git/trees/19ebd8a4914119cef7c31f38572f6877ef621bc3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/walkingriver/agent-team/git/commits/fc7946f071d88bf50c57de86d144f3934a3ed501","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1752021?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/walkingriver/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/walkingriver/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/walkingriver/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/walkingriver/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/walkingriver","id":1752021,"login":"walkingriver","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NTIwMjE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/walkingriver/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/walkingriver/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/walkingriver/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/walkingriver/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/walkingriver/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/walkingriver","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/walkingriver/agent-team/commit/fc7946f071d88bf50c57de86d144f3934a3ed501","node_id":"C_kwDOTmPnatoAKGZjNzk0NmYwNzFkODhiZjUwYzU3ZGU4NmQxNDRmMzkzNGEzZWQ1MDE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/walkingriver/agent-team/commit/5839759f204b88535698ea5e655dc6da733b9c92","sha":"5839759f204b88535698ea5e655dc6da733b9c92","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/walkingriver/agent-team/commits/5839759f204b88535698ea5e655dc6da733b9c92"}],"sha":"fc7946f071d88bf50c57de86d144f3934a3ed501","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/walkingriver/agent-team/commits/fc7946f071d88bf50c57de86d144f3934a3ed501"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1752021?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/walkingriver/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/walkingriver/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/walkingriver/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/walkingriver/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/walkingriver","id":1752021,"login":"walkingriver","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NTIwMjE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/walkingriver/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/walkingriver/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/walkingriver/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/walkingriver/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/walkingriver/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/walkingriver","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/walkingriver/agent-team/commits/5839759f204b88535698ea5e655dc6da733b9c92/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-28T16:13:16Z","email":"mikecallaghan67@gmail.com","name":"Michael Callaghan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-28T16:13:16Z","email":"mikecallaghan67@gmail.com","name":"Michael Callaghan"},"message":"refactor: Split agent bundle into 23 individual agent definition files\n\nReplace monolithic .claude-agents-bundle.md with individual agent definitions:\n\nGovernance (4):\n- architect.md: Authority agent, enforces deterministic testing\n- testing-coordinator.md: Resolves test design disagreements\n- jira-integration.md: Syncs Jira → OKF features\n- github-integration.md: Syncs GitHub → OKF, manages branches\n\nDevelopment (5):\n- frontend-dev-1.md, frontend-dev-2.md: Pair programmers (TypeScript)\n- backend-dev-1.md, backend-dev-2.md: Pair programmers (Java)\n- language-validator.md: Strict language spec enforcement\n\nProduct & Design (3):\n- business-analyst.md: Requirements → Gherkin specs\n- designer.md: UI/UX mockups and design system\n- technical-writer.md: API and feature documentation\n\nTesting (9):\n- testing-orchestrator.md: Coordinates all tests\n- unit-test-agent.md through load-test-agent.md: Specialized test runners\n- qa-lead.md: Critiques test quality after pass\n\nSecurity & Release (2):\n- security-engineer.md: Enforces security policy\n- release-manager.md: Coordinates releases\n\nEach agent file includes:\n- YAML frontmatter (name, description, model, reasoning, tools)\n- Role and invocation pattern\n- Key responsibilities\n- Read/write permissions\n\nFollows Cursor/Claude Code agent definition guidelines.\nMakes agents easier to discover, modify, and version control.\nRemoves need for extraction script—ready to use directly.","tree":{"sha":"6f0d6c8ddada027fd3a676315e98eaad1c6aa052","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/walkingriver/agent-team/git/trees/6f0d6c8ddada027fd3a676315e98eaad1c6aa052"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/walkingriver/agent-team/git/commits/5839759f204b88535698ea5e655dc6da733b9c92","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1752021?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/walkingriver/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/walkingriver/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/walkingriver/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/walkingriver/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/walkingriver","id":1752021,"login":"walkingriver","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NTIwMjE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/walkingriver/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/walkingriver/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/walkingriver/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/walkingriver/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/walkingriver/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/walkingriver","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/walkingriver/agent-team/commit/5839759f204b88535698ea5e655dc6da733b9c92","node_id":"C_kwDOTmPnatoAKDU4Mzk3NTlmMjA0Yjg4NTM1Njk4ZWE1ZTY1NWRjNmRhNzMzYjljOTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/walkingriver/agent-team/commit/17214ecf6453245ce710f2a6a1b53f4a896801a2","sha":"17214ecf6453245ce710f2a6a1b53f4a896801a2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/walkingriver/agent-team/commits/17214ecf6453245ce710f2a6a1b53f4a896801a2"}],"sha":"5839759f204b88535698ea5e655dc6da733b9c92","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/walkingriver/agent-team/commits/5839759f204b88535698ea5e655dc6da733b9c92"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1752021?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/walkingriver/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/walkingriver/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/walkingriver/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/walkingriver/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/walkingriver","id":1752021,"login":"walkingriver","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NTIwMjE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/walkingriver/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/walkingriver/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/walkingriver/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/walkingriver/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/walkingriver/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/walkingriver","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/walkingriver/agent-team/commits/17214ecf6453245ce710f2a6a1b53f4a896801a2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-28T15:59:51Z","email":"mikecallaghan67@gmail.com","name":"Michael Callaghan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-28T15:59:51Z","email":"mikecallaghan67@gmail.com","name":"Michael Callaghan"},"message":"feat: Initial commit - Agent-based development team system\n\nAdd complete system for building software with specialized AI agents:\n\nCore Documents:\n- agent-team-design.md: Complete 9-part system specification with 24 agent roles\n- GETTING_STARTED.md: Quick navigation and getting started guide\n- RETROFIT_GUIDE.md: Step-by-step guide for adding to existing projects\n- .claude-agents-bundle.md: Ready-to-use agent definitions for all 24 roles\n\nSetup & Utilities:\n- setup-okf-scaffold.sh: Automated project initialization script\n- README.md: Project overview and usage guide\n\nFeatures:\n- 24 specialized agents (governance, development, product, design, testing, security, release)\n- Pair programming with turn-based negotiation\n- Test-driven authority (Architect enforces decisions based on tests)\n- Zero tolerance for flaky tests (100% deterministic)\n- Google OKF documentation system (markdown in git)\n- Strict language enforcement per tier\n- Backward-compatible API design (semver)\n- Complete project portability\n\nThis is a production-ready framework for deterministic, test-driven software development.","tree":{"sha":"28700e0ca38fafe7b04cdba1c6aa817fddbd36f0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/walkingriver/agent-team/git/trees/28700e0ca38fafe7b04cdba1c6aa817fddbd36f0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/walkingriver/agent-team/git/commits/17214ecf6453245ce710f2a6a1b53f4a896801a2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1752021?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/walkingriver/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/walkingriver/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/walkingriver/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://a