d":95603241,"login":"Prem-Duvvapu","node_id":"U_kgDOBbLKKQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Prem-Duvvapu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Prem-Duvvapu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Prem-Duvvapu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Prem-Duvvapu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Prem-Duvvapu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Prem-Duvvapu","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Prem-Duvvapu/lld-with-ui/commits/bbc360be89e83b46e4c6927fdc23301dabf7560d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T16:50:52Z","email":"95603241+Prem-Duvvapu@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Prem Duvvapu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T16:50:52Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(a11y): announce outcome banners and make status colours readable (#155)\n\n77 conditional banners across 46 module pages were not live regions,\nso screen-reader users got no feedback after actions or failed\nrequests. Error banners are now role=\"alert\", outcome banners\nrole=\"status\" (chosen from the message type where it varies).\n\nLight-theme status tokens failed 4.5:1 as text on their own tints;\ndarken them in place and lower the dark danger tint. Move hardcoded\nbanner colours to the tokens. Surface Digital Wallet load failures\ninstead of logging them. Fix 320px overflow in coupon, airline and\ncourse-registration, and airline''s hidden focus outline. Guard roles\nand token contrast with accessibilityContracts.test.js (RCA-087).\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4f6fea2e326f1082acad1a3b500527baa9926643","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Prem-Duvvapu/lld-with-ui/git/trees/4f6fea2e326f1082acad1a3b500527baa9926643"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Prem-Duvvapu/lld-with-ui/git/commits/bbc360be89e83b46e4c6927fdc23301dabf7560d","verification":{"payload":"tree 4f6fea2e326f1082acad1a3b500527baa9926643\nparent c7c66a279f556570325e90e3ffd534d745dfadb6\nauthor Prem Duvvapu <95603241+Prem-Duvvapu@users.noreply.github.com> 1791219052 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791219052 +0530\n\nfix(a11y): announce outcome banners and make status colours readable (#155)\n\n77 conditional banners across 46 module pages were not live regions,\nso screen-reader users got no feedback after actions or failed\nrequests. Error banners are now role=\"alert\", outcome banners\nrole=\"status\" (chosen from the message type where it varies).\n\nLight-theme status tokens failed 4.5:1 as text on their own tints;\ndarken them in place and lower the dark danger tint. Move hardcoded\nbanner colours to the tokens. Surface Digital Wallet load failures\ninstead of logging them. Fix 320px overflow in coupon, airline and\ncourse-registration, and airline''s hidden focus outline. Guard roles\nand token contrast with accessibilityContracts.test.js (RCA-087).\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqw9VsCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAIZ8QACNj6BjeI9go0wYnI8Tb8eGh\nfFkNo94tHwjppFsfZfmFL9lKOlpVa286O6NbSI0VXXKPK4ZMabr2rUifegD72ZUG\nPU7UXB5V/JkV/ZxOfiFsGFe3OZIJGavfyO/nZAzAEcyQxp5Vbgc4+7BS393LhIzw\nXbKtMjLaMl4W2SmqtdPiYp6EIu5DVw/rXXw/yly/Y+kEoPWDUQji0b4qPAdCZJJv\nAcQFKBQab2dHZ6cDmmyskfwJBLGcg9Xk2yNK9aWrBtWHjAJPHbZlXpgLZUlQCcfI\nyh8q+aMDPTJHWMtlIhXQkUo+8bacIaAqNydH64H3c2NL72cP0FLvDSNkVmupvQSD\nKFkctPHleWGXsL61eNmAVk1YUiV7v5qvJQlXGWpzoM9csxNiY+35EQ2GLmjmCo7b\nQEX+okU9ZKuoWjgFc9a9wtm1BTlcojBRMTDM/wkJO5sLI668NbfHHkFOVy1DdyNB\njYCh4Nk7rMBsPC3MiZlALi3HiMeEWaSFx67MArH/O9yh/QmRplmwSuOGVplstbQ1\newcSGHrmiB7JN+M8SPsbvRSaYEK/ZTkkX8eCyQmm5nn2Cs5Aef1yVGeEC6oNWnV5\ny/fnPF+M3bc8/dvSohvhN5aUYQcPjd+yZl8qILpVf2glAqRB2J2b4+WfmdGIoL3i\nWm64eFxSlmcnKKBvHyuG\n=9uc5\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-05T16:50: