"html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Prem-Duvvapu/lld-with-ui/commits/6ef706bc2c33be30bd6591d289b6e97fd75b58b1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-16T06:37:54Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-16T06:37:54Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"feat(home): collapse the header controls behind a menu and two toggles\n\nFirst-time mobile visitors hit a full screen of controls before any\ncontent: 4 action buttons, a 6-category progress breakdown, a search\nbar, difficulty pills, a pattern dropdown and 3 checkboxes, all\nexpanded by default. That reads as \"this site has a lot of features\"\nrather than \"this site is simple to use.\"\n\n- Surprise me / Export / Import / Take a tour collapse into a single\n  ☰ menu button with a dropdown panel, closed by default and closing\n  on an outside click.\n- The category-breakdown bars collapse behind the existing progress\n  line, which becomes a toggle (▾/▲).\n- The pattern dropdown and the three checkboxes (unreviewed-only,\n  revisit-only, suggested-learning-order) move into a \"⚙️ Filters\"\n  panel, closed by default and showing an active-filter count on the\n  toggle itself so an applied filter isn''t invisible once collapsed.\n\nSearch and the difficulty pills stay directly visible — they''re the\ntwo controls a first-time visitor actually needs to browse. Everything\nelse is one tap away instead of blocking the first screen.\n\nThe site tour''s pattern step now opens the Filters panel via `prepare`\nbefore pointing at the pattern select, matching the existing pattern\nfor tab clicks; its closing step''s \"Take a tour\" reference now says\nwhere that button lives (☰ → Take a tour).\n\nAdded homeControls.test.jsx (5 tests) asserting the three collapsibles\ndefault closed, that the menu opens/closes including on outside click,\nand that the Filters toggle shows an active count without needing the\npanel open. Bumped the frontend test-count line in CLAUDE.md/AGENTS.md/\nREADME.md to match (444 tests, 10 files).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01J45fJ5ygqtgkKRiKD8JdfD","tree":{"sha":"36fcd053b9413422b582ff8bca3b390f79172c89","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Prem-Duvvapu/lld-with-ui/git/trees/36fcd053b9413422b582ff8bca3b390f79172c89"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Prem-Duvvapu/lld-with-ui/git/commits/6ef706bc2c33be30bd6591d289b6e97fd75b58b1","verification":{"payload":"tree 36fcd053b9413422b582ff8bca3b390f79172c89\nparent 0d7054bcb70f3f7970ae891bf025af6f5d7a46c2\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1789540674 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1789540674 +0000\n\nfeat(home): collapse the header controls behind a menu and two toggles\n\nFirst-time mobile visitors hit a full screen of controls before any\ncontent: 4 action buttons, a 6-category progress breakdown, a search\nbar, difficulty pills, a pattern dropdown and 3 checkboxes, all\nexpanded by default. That reads as \"this site has a lot of features\"\nrather than \"this site is simple to use.\"\n\n- Surprise me / Export / Import / Take a tour collapse into a single\n  ☰ menu button with a dropdown panel, closed by default and closing\n  on an outside click.\n- The category-breakdown bars collapse behind the existing progress\n  line, which becomes a toggle (▾/▲).\n- The pattern dropdown and the three checkboxes (unreviewed-only,\n  revisit-only, suggested-learning-order) move into a \"⚙️ Filters\"\n  panel, closed by default and showing an active-filter count on the\n  toggle itself so an applied filter isn''t invisible once collapsed.\n\nSearch and the difficulty pills stay directly visible — they''re the\ntwo controls a first-time visitor actually needs to browse. Everything\nelse is one tap away instead of blocking the first screen.\n\nThe site tour''s pattern step now opens the Filters panel via `prepare`\nbefore pointing at the pattern select, matching the existing pattern\nfor tab clicks; its closing step''s \"Take a tour\" reference now says\nwhere that button lives (☰ → Take a tour).\n\nAdded homeControls.test.jsx (5 tests) asserting the three collapsibles\ndefault closed, that the menu opens/closes including on outside click,\nand that the Filters toggle shows an active count without needing the\npanel open. Bumped the frontend test-count line in CLAUDE.md/AGENTS.md/\nREADME.md to match (444 tests, 10 files).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01J45fJ5ygqtgkKRiKD8JdfD\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQFTCcjAK\ncNXiZLNOKBiXqb4W8ta7m0x2NG8tUEGuM4WFfLQ1fKf+Dbzrk57yqflrAO5QskffO4AxBGYO/toK\nDQQ=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-16T06:38:00Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node