.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Prem-Duvvapu/lld-with-ui/commits/944e50b88c3e6b01f95e0ca2a04bc7457f787c6f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-13T14:38:31Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-13T14:38:31Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"feat: add export/import, surprise-me, revisit flag, category breakdown, and keyboard shortcuts to Home\n\nFive related power-user features on the Home page, all still local-only\n(no backend/auth in this app):\n\n- Export/import progress as JSON (utils/progressData.js) -- bundles the\n  reviewed, revealed, and revisit localStorage state into one file so\n  progress can follow a visitor to another browser/device.\n- \"Surprise me\" button -- jumps to a random unreviewed module (falls\n  back to any module once everything''s reviewed), for interview-prep\n  pacing.\n- \"Flag for revisit\" (hooks/useRevisit.js) -- a second, independent\n  per-module flag with its own \"revisit only\" filter, plus a\n  last-reviewed date now tracked by useProgress.js (migrates the old\n  array-of-paths format in place) and shown on hover over the\n  reviewed checkmark.\n- Per-category progress breakdown -- a mini progress bar per category\n  under the overall progress bar.\n- Keyboard shortcuts -- \"/\" focuses search, Esc clears it, arrow keys\n  move native focus between cards (Enter opens the focused card via\n  the browser''s own anchor behavior, no extra handler needed).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01J45fJ5ygqtgkKRiKD8JdfD","tree":{"sha":"5117fd9f82ea284dfabdd4b51de7963aac86b0c3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Prem-Duvvapu/lld-with-ui/git/trees/5117fd9f82ea284dfabdd4b51de7963aac86b0c3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Prem-Duvvapu/lld-with-ui/git/commits/944e50b88c3e6b01f95e0ca2a04bc7457f787c6f","verification":{"payload":"tree 5117fd9f82ea284dfabdd4b51de7963aac86b0c3\nparent d4ebd29ef8e094f6a16ab85676fec1a4c94d60c7\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1789310311 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1789310311 +0000\n\nfeat: add export/import, surprise-me, revisit flag, category breakdown, and keyboard shortcuts to Home\n\nFive related power-user features on the Home page, all still local-only\n(no backend/auth in this app):\n\n- Export/import progress as JSON (utils/progressData.js) -- bundles the\n  reviewed, revealed, and revisit localStorage state into one file so\n  progress can follow a visitor to another browser/device.\n- \"Surprise me\" button -- jumps to a random unreviewed module (falls\n  back to any module once everything''s reviewed), for interview-prep\n  pacing.\n- \"Flag for revisit\" (hooks/useRevisit.js) -- a second, independent\n  per-module flag with its own \"revisit only\" filter, plus a\n  last-reviewed date now tracked by useProgress.js (migrates the old\n  array-of-paths format in place) and shown on hover over the\n  reviewed checkmark.\n- Per-category progress breakdown -- a mini progress bar per category\n  under the overall progress bar.\n- Keyboard shortcuts -- \"/\" focuses search, Esc clears it, arrow keys\n  move native focus between cards (Enter opens the focused card via\n  the browser''s own anchor behavior, no extra handler needed).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01J45fJ5ygqtgkKRiKD8JdfD\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0A