n\nA hand-rolled spotlight walkthrough (no new dependency) that introduces\nnew visitors to the Home page''s tools: search, difficulty/pattern\nfilters, progress tracking, the unreviewed-only toggle, and the\nreveal-solution (\"try it yourself first\") concept inside a module.\n\n- hooks/useTour.js — localStorage-backed \"has seen the tour\" flag,\n  same shape as useProgress/useReveal.\n- components/WebsiteTour.jsx + .css — a spotlight overlay that\n  highlights each target element in turn with a positioned tooltip;\n  centered-modal steps for the welcome/closing screens that have no\n  target. Keyboard nav (Esc/arrows), dismissible any time.\n- Home.jsx — auto-launches once per browser on first visit (500ms\n  after mount), plus a persistent \"Take a tour\" button to replay it.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01J45fJ5ygqtgkKRiKD8JdfD","tree":{"sha":"23434f02671a15a0aac91ab5bc8bd9c0f45fcfa5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Prem-Duvvapu/lld-with-ui/git/trees/23434f02671a15a0aac91ab5bc8bd9c0f45fcfa5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Prem-Duvvapu/lld-with-ui/git/commits/d2e60ddbf9a994a3767aee8b0f63c054b28a763f","verification":{"payload":"tree 23434f02671a15a0aac91ab5bc8bd9c0f45fcfa5\nparent 46fb3a70630437890cc2c23672d3e4cc564dcc95\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1789297951 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1789297951 +0000\n\nfeat: add website tour for first-time visitors\n\nA hand-rolled spotlight walkthrough (no new dependency) that introduces\nnew visitors to the Home page''s tools: search, difficulty/pattern\nfilters, progress tracking, the unreviewed-only toggle, and the\nreveal-solution (\"try it yourself first\") concept inside a module.\n\n- hooks/useTour.js — localStorage-backed \"has seen the tour\" flag,\n  same shape as useProgress/useReveal.\n- components/WebsiteTour.jsx + .css — a spotlight overlay that\n  highlights each target element in turn with a positioned tooltip;\n  centered-modal steps for the welcome/closing screens that have no\n  target. Keyboard nav (Esc/arrows), dismissible any time.\n- Home.jsx — auto-launches once per browser on first visit (500ms\n  after mount), plus a persistent \"Take a tour\" button to replay it.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01J45fJ5ygqtgkKRiKD8JdfD\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQBE9yBia\nXXA8LKnpTVHWrRt024jMz+I4fc2G8L2hdzD580F1CDCJVpCf4gVbxRUDPTknX3w4T/bHYEZmiw5/\nKgE=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-13T11:12:36Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Prem-Duvvapu/lld-with-ui/commit/d2e60ddbf9a994a3767aee8b0f63c054b28a763f","node_id":"C_kwDOTmX-H9oAKGQyZTYwZGRiZjlhOTk0YTM3NjdhZWU4YjBmNjNjMDU0YjI4YTc2M2Y","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Prem-Duvvapu/lld-with-ui/commit/46fb3a70630437890c