,"followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Prem-Duvvapu/lld-with-ui/commit/171006defc7fba6dc1b79439f91d22a757734fb1","node_id":"C_kwDOTmX-H9oAKDE3MTAwNmRlZmM3ZmJhNmRjMWI3OTQzOWY5MWQyMmE3NTc3MzRmYjE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Prem-Duvvapu/lld-with-ui/commit/72de49f5929d22d5f393d6af9b60e0d57107c612","sha":"72de49f5929d22d5f393d6af9b60e0d57107c612","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Prem-Duvvapu/lld-with-ui/commits/72de49f5929d22d5f393d6af9b60e0d57107c612"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/Prem-Duvvapu/lld-with-ui/commit/dbd42a46cab420aa9a26368550e611981d822098","sha":"dbd42a46cab420aa9a26368550e611981d822098","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Prem-Duvvapu/lld-with-ui/commits/dbd42a46cab420aa9a26368550e611981d822098"}],"sha":"171006defc7fba6dc1b79439f91d22a757734fb1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Prem-Duvvapu/lld-with-ui/commits/171006defc7fba6dc1b79439f91d22a757734fb1"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Prem-Duvvapu/lld-with-ui/commits/dbd42a46cab420aa9a26368550e611981d822098/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-13T10:04:50Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-13T10:04:50Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"feat: add filter-by-design-pattern to the Home page\n\nA dropdown alongside the difficulty pills filters the module grid to\nonly those implementing a chosen GoF pattern (Strategy, Factory,\nObserver, State, Command, Chain of Responsibility, Decorator,\nComposite, Template Method, Builder, Singleton).\n\ndata/modulePatterns.js is generated from source of truth, not\nhand-curated: extracted directly from each module''s own\ndata/design/<key>.js designPatterns array (used: true entries only),\nthen normalized (~73 raw free-text variants like \"Strategy Pattern\n(MisfirePolicy)\" or \"Strategy + Factory-shaped Resolver\" collapse to\na canonical set). Deliberately excludes patterns every module claims\nby convention (Facade, Repository, Dependency Injection) since those\ndon''t discriminate anything -- including them would make nearly\nevery filter match nearly every module.\n\nFour modules (course-registration, library, shopping-cart,\nstock-brokerage) resolve to an empty pattern list -- that''s accurate,\nnot a bug, and matches what AUDIT.md already flagged about those\nmodules lacking a standout GoF pattern in their own design docs.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01J45fJ5ygqtgkKRiKD8JdfD","tree":{"sha":"1339ca00bb0316146930f94eee187f5ed2cb6fc7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Prem-Duvvapu/lld-with-ui/git/trees/1339ca00bb0316146930f94eee187f5ed2cb6fc7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Prem-Duvvapu/lld-with-ui/git/commits/dbd42a46cab420aa9a26368550e611981d822098","verification":{"payload":"tree 1339ca00bb0316146930f94eee187f5ed2cb6fc7\nparent 72de49f5929d22d5f393d6af9b60e0d57107c612\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1789293890 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1789293890 +0000\n\nfeat: add filter-by-design-pattern to the Home page\n\nA dropdown alongside the difficulty pills filters the module grid to\nonly those implementing a chosen GoF pattern (Strategy, Factory,\nObserver, State, Command, Chain of Responsibility, Decorator,\nComposite, Template Method, Builder, Singleton).\n\ndata/modulePatterns.js is generated from source of truth, not\nhand-curated: extracted directly from each module''s own\ndata/design/<key>.js designPatterns array (used: true entries only),\nthen normalized (~73 raw free-text variants like \"Strategy Pattern\n(MisfirePolicy)\" or \"Strategy + Factory-shaped Resolver\" collapse to\na canonical set). Deliberately excludes patterns every module claims\nby convention (Facade, Repository, Dependency Injection) since those\ndon''t discriminate anything -- including them would make nearly\nevery filter match nearly every module.\n\nFour modules (course-registration, library, shopping-cart,\nstock-brokerage) resolve to an empty pattern list -- that''s accurate,\nnot a bug, and matches what AUDIT.md already flagged about those\nmodules lacking a standout GoF pattern in their own design docs.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01J45fJ5ygqtgkKRiKD8JdfD\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQBDJe0+v\nnNJM6+ijMZ1pGn60FW+3EC78X3ne4tkMgya53lU5FPMo8nAO17d37VJFqLelmza+bps5bTy+dEJj\nwwc=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-13T10:04:55Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Prem-Duvvapu/lld-with-ui/commit/dbd42a46cab420aa9a26368550e611981d822098","node_id":"C_kwDOTmX-H9oAKGRiZDQyYTQ2Y2FiNDIwYWE5YTI2MzY4NTUwZTYxMTk4MWQ4MjIwOTg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Prem-Duvvapu/lld-with-ui/commit/72de49f5929d22d5f393d6af9b60e0d57107c612","sha":"72de49f5929d22d5f393d6af9b60e0d57107c612","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Prem-Duvvapu/lld-with-ui/commits/72de49f5929d22d5f393d6af9b60e0d57107c612"}],"sha":"dbd42a46cab420aa9a26368550e611981d822098","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Prem-Duvvapu/lld-with-ui/commits/dbd42a46cab420aa9a26368550e611981d822098"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https: