b-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Prem-Duvvapu/lld-with-ui/commit/72de49f5929d22d5f393d6af9b60e0d57107c612","node_id":"C_kwDOTmX-H9oAKDcyZGU0OWY1OTI5ZDIyZDVmMzkzZDZhZjliNjBlMGQ1NzEwN2M2MTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Prem-Duvvapu/lld-with-ui/commit/0e909e994e70b1d65e304eb67b6e673e28d2bce5","sha":"0e909e994e70b1d65e304eb67b6e673e28d2bce5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Prem-Duvvapu/lld-with-ui/commits/0e909e994e70b1d65e304eb67b6e673e28d2bce5"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/Prem-Duvvapu/lld-with-ui/commit/ebd6a6babc2c822cdfd387f75bf7c26c612a15be","sha":"ebd6a6babc2c822cdfd387f75bf7c26c612a15be","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Prem-Duvvapu/lld-with-ui/commits/ebd6a6babc2c822cdfd387f75bf7c26c612a15be"}],"sha":"72de49f5929d22d5f393d6af9b60e0d57107c612","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Prem-Duvvapu/lld-with-ui/commits/72de49f5929d22d5f393d6af9b60e0d57107c612"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Prem-Duvvapu/lld-with-ui/commits/ebd6a6babc2c822cdfd387f75bf7c26c612a15be/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-13T09:56:29Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-13T09:56:29Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"feat: add per-visitor progress tracking on the Home page\n\nEach LLD module card now has a \"mark as reviewed\" toggle. Progress is\ntracked as a done/not-done checklist -- no auth or backend state\nexists in this app, so it''s persisted per-browser in localStorage\n(useProgress hook), which is the right fit for a single person using\nthis site to track their own interview-prep review, without needing\nto add a login system.\n\n- hooks/useProgress.js: localStorage-backed reviewed-set, survives\n  reloads, silently no-ops if storage is unavailable (private\n  browsing, quota, blocked).\n- Home.jsx: a progress bar (\"X / 60 reviewed\") above the search/filter\n  controls, a per-card checkmark toggle (stops propagation so it\n  doesn''t trigger the card''s navigation Link), a reviewed-card visual\n  state, and a \"show only what''s left to review\" filter for actually\n  using it during prep.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01J45fJ5ygqtgkKRiKD8JdfD","tree":{"sha":"4e1ace1048dbde146be2e2deccbdfd7ac778f610","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Prem-Duvvapu/lld-with-ui/git/trees/4e1ace1048dbde146be2e2deccbdfd7ac778f610"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Prem-Duvvapu/lld-with-ui/git/commits/ebd6a6babc2c822cdfd387f75bf7c26c612a15be","verification":{"payload":"tree 4e1ace1048dbde146be2e2deccbdfd7ac778f610\nparent 0e909e994e70b1d65e304eb67b6e673e28d2bce5\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1789293389 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1789293389 +0000\n\nfeat: add per-visitor progress tracking on the Home page\n\nEach LLD module card now has a \"mark as reviewed\" toggle. Progress is\ntracked as a done/not-done checklist -- no auth or backend state\nexists in this app, so it''s persisted per-browser in localStorage\n(useProgress hook), which is the right fit for a single person using\nthis site to track their own interview-prep review, without needing\nto add a login system.\n\n- hooks/useProgress.js: localStorage-backed reviewed-set, survives\n  reloads, silently no-ops if storage is unavailable (private\n  browsing, quota, blocked).\n- Home.jsx: a progress bar (\"X / 60 reviewed\") above the search/filter\n  controls, a per-card checkmark toggle (stops propagation so it\n  doesn''t trigger the card''s navigation Link), a reviewed-card visual\n  state, and a \"show only what''s left to review\" filter for actually\n  using it during prep.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01J45fJ5ygqtgkKRiKD8JdfD\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQPlZ+zIg\nHHqs0v1JlkFO222almjWr67cLVCaJaQlW+G0hhQQrQN/6Z5H3aQ29YFHghbiIkwOYsoBsLaYX1qG\njA8=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-13T09:56:34Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions",