/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Prem-Duvvapu/lld-with-ui/commits/64d52b75cc24fee003b27204d298af3fac2e2e74/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-10T10:51:35Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-10T10:51:35Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"feat: add per-module GitHub source links to every LLD page\n\nEvery module page now shows two small \"view source\" links -- Backend\nand Frontend -- pointing at that module''s actual folder on GitHub''s\nmain branch, so a resume/portfolio viewer can jump straight to the\nreal code behind whatever demo they''re looking at.\n\n- data/moduleSourceLinks.js: an explicit module-key -> {backend,\n  frontend} path lookup, not a string template -- the mapping isn''t\n  uniform (the 9 concurrency primitives nest under\n  com/lld/concurrency/<key>/, logging-framework''s backend package is\n  just `logging`, lru-cache''s is `lrucache`, parking''s is\n  `parkinglot`, and stockbroker''s frontend folder is\n  `stock-brokerage`).\n- components/GithubSourceLinks.jsx: renders the two links (or nothing\n  if the module key isn''t in the table, rather than guessing a path\n  that could 404), using theme tokens only.\n- Wired into LldPage''s breadcrumb row (top-right) -- covers the ~53\n  modules that use the shared shell automatically.\n- Manually added to the 7 pages that hand-roll their own header\n  instead of using LldPage (airline, coffeemachine, library,\n  linkedin, ludo, movieticket, vendingmachine), next to their\n  existing ThemeToggle.\n\nCovers all 60 modules. Verified against the full 60-module ->\nfrontend-folder / backend-package mapping derived directly from the\nrepo''s actual directory listings, not assumed from module keys.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01J45fJ5ygqtgkKRiKD8JdfD","tree":{"sha":"96fcc10a78e51702087ef1cc6d03da1e75464c9a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Prem-Duvvapu/lld-with-ui/git/trees/96fcc10a78e51702087ef1cc6d03da1e75464c9a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Prem-Duvvapu/lld-with-ui/git/commits/64d52b75cc24fee003b27204d298af3fac2e2e74","verification":{"payload":"tree 96fcc10a78e51702087ef1cc6d03da1e75464c9a\nparent 61d490176258a7d6e9a8bad539b98f1fe2a7e6cc\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1789037495 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1789037495 +0000\n\nfeat: add per-module GitHub source links to every LLD page\n\nEvery module page now shows two small \"view source\" links -- Backend\nand Frontend -- pointing at that module''s actual folder on GitHub''s\nmain branch, so a resume/portfolio viewer can jump straight to the\nreal code behind whatever demo they''re looking at.\n\n- data/moduleSourceLinks.js: an explicit module-key -> {backend,\n  frontend} path lookup, not a string template -- the mapping isn''t\n  uniform (the 9 concurrency primitives nest under\n  com/lld/concurrency/<key>/, logging-framework''s backend package is\n  just `logging`, lru-cache''s is `lrucache`, parking''s is\n  `parkinglot`, and stockbroker''s frontend folder is\n  `stock-brokerage`).\n- components/GithubSourceLinks.jsx: renders the two links (or nothing\n  if the module key isn''t in the table, rather than guessing a path\n  that could 404), using theme tokens only.\n- Wired into LldPage''s breadcrumb row (top-right) -- covers the ~53\n  modules that use the shared shell automatically.\n- Manually added to the 7 pages that hand-roll their own header\n  instead of using LldPage (airline, coffeemachine, library,\n  linkedin, ludo, movieticket, vendingmachine), next to their\n  existing ThemeToggle.\n\nCovers all 60 modules. Verified against the full 60-module ->\nfrontend-folder / backend-package mapping derived directly from the\nrepo''s actual directory listings, not assumed from module keys.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01J45fJ5ygqtgkKRiKD8JdfD\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQF7hjedY\ndDRJK/CdedFVVO8gfX78V898B+wmDK6a2Lcunq0N6cgDyahu7F/9Hbb80MisV1Gd/+NvOPJPxfQ0\n+A4=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-10T10:51:41Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Prem-Duvvapu/lld-with-ui/commit/64d52b75cc2