rka1pha","id":60667828,"login":"darka1pha","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwNjY3ODI4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darka1pha/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darka1pha/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darka1pha/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darka1pha/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darka1pha/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/darka1pha","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/darka1pha/nova/commits/6419794893e91c2c723d5c948c1da497dcb026b6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-10T07:01:07Z","email":"abolfazl.omrani1999@gmail.com","name":"darka1pha"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-10T07:01:07Z","email":"abolfazl.omrani1999@gmail.com","name":"darka1pha"},"message":"feat: add dry run option for package merging and file copying\n\n- Introduced a `dryRun` option in `mergePackageAdditions` to allow previewing changes without modifying the package.\n- Added `dryRun` option in `copyAddonWithRemap` to calculate paths without actual file copying.\n- Enhanced `NovaProjectManifest` to include optional fields: `schemaVersion`, `template`, `preset`, and `pluginVersions`.\n- Implemented `migrateManifest` function to upgrade raw manifest data to the latest schema while preserving custom metadata.\n- Updated `readProjectConfig` and `writeProjectConfig` to handle new manifest structure and ensure backward compatibility.\n- Modified `initializeProjectConfig` to support new optional fields and ensure proper initialization of plugin versions.\n- Expanded `collectAnswers` function to include template and preset options, improving project setup flexibility.\n- Updated feature options to include new AI-related features and ensure consistent feature flag handling.","tree":{"sha":"3437dfe7f19064a4d162a1ad1aa89ce64a4f4bea","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/darka1pha